<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">Kharam: Bible Translation 1st Edition.</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Matthew</para>
  <para style="toc1">MATTHEW Dungjuiya Chongkahoi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matthew</para>
  <para style="toc3">Matt</para>
  <para style="mt1">MATTHEW</para>
  <para style="mt2">Dungjuiya Chongkahoi</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chonglamsaat</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Matthew dungjuiya Chongkahoi hi</char> Inzootna Kathar larik mili karra Jisu Christa ringkhuo jarra kamalar inkhat kha eii. Inmani ngaihi “Gospel” hiwa tinachu “Chongkahoi” tia injetna. Hiwangai hi Jisu thisuonuk, Matthew in, Mark in, Luke in khat-um John in inleimajia. Matthew dungjuiya chongkahoi hi angnikhuo tak ah inmajiame ti kasing-kathei ngai'n jetmu, takkha hiwahi Christa inneisuo kum 60 pheiwei khan lei-echa. Khat-um huwa munna inmajiame ti-um jetmu, takkha katamkhat in Palestine khat-um Jerusalem khuopuiya lei-ete tia inngaidon.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Matthew kamajiapa hi</char> Jisu'n ama siamruoi ka-esik ah akoima, ama hi rampar kakhom inkhat alei-eii. Ama hi araming Levi tia um in-injetna. Matthew hi Tirton soomleini karra inkhat kha eii halli ama'n Jihudi larik kateelngai sik ah imajia eii. Hiwahi Inzootna Maruo Pathian chong chongmun 60 chungtiang inthiangnga nimu mator. Ama'n ingaidon imalarzoot khachu ama jarra inleirilsuok jei Jisu hi Messiah eii, Pathian ikadang kanasanpa eii tihi eii. Matthew innum Pathian rengram jarra katamma aleimajia. Messiah in nuoipilchung rengramma reng hong esik eii tia Jihudi ngai'n inleingaidon. Matthew in kalok ah in-engpuina khachu, Pathian ratha rengram khachu ngamna khan eii tia alei.</para>
  <para style="ip">Matthew dungjuiya chongkahoi hi Inzootna Kathar phutnasik akatha larik inkhat eii, ajarchu hiwahin Inzootna Maruo chongmun ngai rakip kha inchel. Hiwahin Inzootna inni ngaikha aminjom. Kasing-kathei ngai innum Moses larik ngai tichu Inzootna Maruo larik ma-insa ranga ngaikhale Matthew omchan hi innaithei tia inlei. Jisu'n Chingnga iminchu Pathian chong (Matthew 5-7) hile Moses diangnga dan ipe khale minkhi acha (Innidan 19:3-23-33).</para>
  <para style="iot">Asuungnga kaom Chong</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Matthew in chongkahoi hi Jisu Christa innei khat-um Jisu chuon jarra aphut <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MAT 1-4">1–4</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Matthew in Jisu chuon khat-um ama minchuna katamkhat kha arilcheen <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MAT 5-25">5–25</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Matthew juoheknatiang khan insaangkhet ah Jisu chuon, athina khat-um ahongringna jarra eii <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MAT 26-28">26–28</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Christa Pilepu ngai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luk 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>Abraham khat-um David sapa Jisu Christa, pilepu ngai ramingrui kha hingaihi eii.<verse eid="MAT 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2"/>Abraham in Isaac anei; Isaac in Jacob anei, Jacob in Judah khat-um ama unai ngai anei; <verse eid="MAT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3"/>Halli Judah le anumei Tamar in Pharez khat-um Zerah innei, Pharez in Hezron anei, Hezron in Ram anei, <verse eid="MAT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4"/>Ram in Amminadab anei, Amminadab in Nahshon anei, Nahshon in Salmon anei, <verse eid="MAT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5"/>Salmon li Rahab in Boaz innei, Boaz li Ruth in Obed innei, Obed in Jesse anei, <verse eid="MAT 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6"/>khat-um Jesse in Reng David anei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Uriah numei leika-e kha David in aneiya Solomon inleinei; <verse eid="MAT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7"/>Solomon in Rehoboam anei, Rehoboam in Abijah anei, halli Abijah in Asa anei, <verse eid="MAT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8"/>Asa in Jehoshaphat anei, Jehoshaphat in Joram anei, Joram in Uzziah anei, <verse eid="MAT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9"/>Uzziah in Jotham anei, Jotham in Ahaz anei, Ahaz in Hezekiah anei, <verse eid="MAT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10"/>Hezekiah in Manasseh anei, halli Manasseh in Amon anei, Amon in Josiah anei, <verse eid="MAT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11"/>halli Josiah in Jechoniah le a-u anai ngaikha Babylonna raalringnga insurra inruoi pheiweikhan inleinei. <verse eid="MAT 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12"/>Halli Babylonna inruoi suonuk Jechoniah in Shealtiel anei khat-um Shealtiel in Zerubbabel anei, <verse eid="MAT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13"/>Zerubbabel in Abiud anei, halli Abiud in Eliakim anei, Eliakim in Azor anei, <verse eid="MAT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14"/>Azor in Zadok anei, khat-um Zadok in Achim anei, halli Achim in Eliud anei, <verse eid="MAT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15"/>Eliud in Eleazar anei, khat-um Eleazar in Matthan anei, halli Matthan in Jacob anei, <verse eid="MAT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16"/>halli Jacob in Mary ruothar Joseph anei, Mary hi Christa Jisu nu eii.<verse eid="MAT 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Khanthoa, Abraham makheiya David katunghi khang soomleimili eii, David makheiya Babylon raalringnga inruoi katung khang soomleimili eii, khat-um khamakheiya Messiah innei katung khang soomleimili eii.<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Christa Innei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luk 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>Jisu Christa hi hinthoa inleinei. Anu Mary hi Joseph sik ah inleibiak, takkha inmani moi inruoima, Ratha Inthiangnga inphut ama'n nai awonjei ti inleijetjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 1:27">Luk 1:27</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>Aruothar Joseph hi mikatha akatuun katho miring inkhat ejarra, ama'n Mary hi mipui maikuungnga minjakzoot mak ah ruuk ah inthenpui nasik alei-ngaidon. <verse eid="MAT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>Ama'n hiwa jarra angaidon laikhan, Pumi marwaan tirton inkhat ama ramangnga inlarra ati, “David sapa Joseph, nanumei Mary hi kaneisik chimaro. Ama naiwon hi Ratha Inthiangnga inphut eii.<verse eid="MAT 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/>Ama'n sapa inkhat aneisik eii, halli nang in araming Jisu tia naphuo sik eii, ajarchu ama'n ami ngaikha inmanu ah inphut akatansik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 1:31">Luk 1:31</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>Pumi khan Pathian chongkachoi ngai diangnga ileiril ngaikha inthiangnga atungnasik hiwa rakip hi tuun asuokjei.<verse eid="MAT 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/>“Enru, inthiang nungaak inkhat in nai lawonta sapa inkhat aneisik eii, halli ama ramingkha Immanuel tia inkoi sik eii” (hiwa tinachu, “Einile kaom suom Pathian tina eii”). <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Isa 7:14</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>Joseph in ahong inthei pha Pumi marwaan tirton ileiti angnga ama'n Mary kha anumeiya aneijei.<verse eid="MAT 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/>Takkha Mary in sapa kha aneimak laiseng khan Joseph in amale lei-inchunpui mak, halli Joseph in ama raming kha Jisu tia aleiphuo jei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 2:21">Luk 2:21</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Nisuo tiangnga inphut Mi kasingngai Kahong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>Herod in Reng achanglai, Judea ramsuungnga kaom Bethlehem khuopuiya Jisu hi innei suopha, nisuo tiangnga arsi larik kathei mi ngaikhan Jerusalemma inhongnga, <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/>inhongrakel, “Jihudi ngai sik ah innei reng naiteii kha hun omme? Ajarchu keini'n nisuo tiangnga ama arsi kha kinmu khat-um keini ama chubei kathosik ah kinhong eii.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>Reng Herod in hiwa chonghi ajetpha, amale Jerusalemma kaom miring rakip inmalung aleipoong. <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>Ama'n thiampu kalian rakiple dan karu ngaikha akoichunna inmani diang, “Christa hunme inneisik?” tia aleirakel.<verse eid="MAT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Inmani'n amadiang inleimasang, “Judea ramma kaom Bethlehem khuopui khan eiiz” “Ajarchu Pathian chongkachoipa khan hintia aleimajia:<verse eid="MAT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>‘E Judah ramma kaom Bethlehem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">Nangchu Judah Reng waikaroon ngai karra akasiinkhet kha emakche;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">ajarchu kami Israel ngai lamkakei inkhat kha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">Nang diangnga inphut alahongsuok sik eii.’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mic 5:2</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>Khawa jarra Herod in nisuo tiangnga kasing-kathei ngaikha ruuk ah akoiya angtikpha tak khanme khawa Arsi kha kasuok tikha inmani diang katha ah ajetjei. <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>Khawasuo khan ama'n inmani kha Bethlehem tiang aleitirra, “Nangni'n si-inlang naiteii jarra katha ah entok inlang ningmu pha kei um kasiya chubei katho nasik keidiang naminjetru aleiti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9"/>Inmani'n Rengchong kha inrangaiya insijei, halli enru, nisuo tiangnga inleimu arsi khan naiteii omna chungnga ahongngir maklaiseng inmani matiang asijei. <verse eid="MAT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10"/>Inmani'n arsi kha inmupha, karok khan aleisip. <verse eid="MAT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Inmani'n Innsuung kha inluut ah, naiteii khan anu Mary le inleiom inmupha, kemurkhup inthep ah inmani'n chubei inleithoa inkutchoi ngai inmalongnga, Soonna, Berou, khat-um myrrh, inkeisuoa amadiang kutchoi inleipeii.<verse eid="MAT 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>Khawasuo khan Pathian in inmani kha Herod diang kirkhaimaru tia inramangnga aminjet ah inmani'n lam khattiang inrouwa inramtiang inleikirjei.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Egypt ah Intaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>Inmani'n inmathaanna insi suonuk, enru, Pumi marwaan tirton inkhat Joseph ramangnga inlarra ati, “Intheiro, naiteii khat-um anu ruoi-inlang, Egypt tiang taanru, kei'n khawa munkha mathaanru katimak laiseng khawakhan omru, ajarchu Herod in naiteii kha thatnasik ah ahong entoksik eii.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>Joseph in zaankhan intheiya, naidoong le anu kha aruoiya, Egypt tiang inleisijei,<verse eid="MAT 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/>Pumi'n Pathian chongkachoipa diangnga iril kha, “Kei'n Kasapa kha Egypt makheiya kakoi” tikha huuitungnasik Khawa munkhan Herod thimaklaiseng aleiom. <char style="rq"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Hos 11:1</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Naipang Ngai Inthat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>Halli Herod in nisuo tiangnga kasing-kathei ngai'n ama diang maleisei innathojei ti ajetpha, araangtheiya, arsi larik kathei ngaidiang inthiangnga ijet dungjuiya Bethlehem khat-um akoolla kaom ramsuungnga pasal naiteii kumni makheiya nuoitiangnga kaom rakip hi chong apeya aleimithat.<verse eid="MAT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17"/>Hinthoa Pathian chongkachoi Jeremiah ileiti kha huuitungjei:<verse eid="MAT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18"/>“Ramah ah rasa inkhat inleijet,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">khawa kha kapoongthei kachap rasa eii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Rachel in asa ngaisik achap;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">ama kha matheemtai matormu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">ajarchu inmani inthisuojei.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="JER 31:15">Jer 31:15</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Egypt ah inphut Inheikir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Herod thisuo nuk, enru, Egypt ah Pumi marwaan tirton inkhat in Joseph ramangnga inlarra ati, <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>“Intheiro, naiteii li anu kha ruoi inlang, Israel ramtiang heikirtaro, ajarchu naiteii kha thatsik katho inmani ngaikha inthijei.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Khawa jarra Joseph intheiya, naiteii li anu aruoiya, Israel ramtiang inheikirjei.<verse eid="MAT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Takkha Joseph in Archelaus hi apa Herod rathuulla Judea Reng ejeiti ajet ah, khawa munkhan kasisik aleichi. Halli Pathian in aramangnga kheella amindik ah ama'n Galilee ram khattiang aleisijei, <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/>Pathian chongkachoi ngai'n inleiril, “Amahi Nazareth mi intisik eii” intikha huuitungnasik ah Ama'n Nazareth inti khuopui khan ahong-omjei.<verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">John Baptist chongril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jn 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1"/>Khawapha takkhan John Baptist in Judea neelramma aheisuok ah chongril aleiphut,<verse eid="MAT 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2"/>“Manu ah inphut ningmalung thuultaru,” “Ajarchu marwaan Rengram kha anaijei!” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 4:17">Matt 4:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:15">Mk 1:15</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/>Ajarchu Pathian chongkachoi Isaiah in ileiril kha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Neelram ah Mi inkhat in akheek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Nangni Pumi sik ah lam boolru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">Ama lamkha mintuunru!’ ” tia irilkha John hi eii, <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa 40:3</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>John apumtak Salaileem mulla inbool puondiar aleitho; ama'n sawun koongkhit akoongnga aleikhit, halli ama bak-inchu khaisor li ram khuoining alei eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="2KI 1:8">2 Reng 1:8</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>Jerusalemma inphut, Judea rampumpui, khat-um Jordan Tuidung sirra kaom mipuingai amadiang inleihong. <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>Inmani'n inmanu inrilsuok ah, khat-um ama'n inmani Jordanna baptize aleitho.<verse eid="MAT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>John in Pharisee le Sadducee ngai baptize thonasik inheiwa amupha khan, inmani diang ama'n ati, “Nangni Maruul sangai akahongsik Pathian rachaakna akajuosik makheiya taanru tia tu-in nangnidiang narilpiya me? <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Matt 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>Manu ah inphut ningmalung thuulna kanaminmu sik chuon ngaikha thoru,<verse eid="MAT 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/>Keini kinpu Abraham om keengnga poongraalna ah inphut taansuok mator kinte ti-inlang ngaidonmaru, ajarchu kei'n nangni diang kati, Pathian in hiwa lung ngaihin Abraham sangai amin eii mator! <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Matt 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/>Tuuntak hin thingkuung ngaikha tukpur nasik rei kha insuuk ah omjei; khawa jarra kara katha kakaramak thingkuung rakip kha intuk khiak ah mei suungnga indeeng luutsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Matt 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>Malung thuulna jarra kei'n nangni tuiya baptize kanatho, takkha kei kanuk ah akajuopa khachu keineek ah alok, keichu ama Hureikhaang kachoi sik um rahoi suokmong, Ama inchu nangni Ratha Inthiang li meiya baptize anathosik eii. <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/>Ama'n saangzaapna kha akut ah achoi khat-um asaang kha inthiangnga zaapthiangta Ama'n saang ngaikha asapang suungnga athunsik eii, takkha arasi ngaikha akathimak mei suungnga adeengluut sik eii.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Baptize thona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mk 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luk 3:21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:22">22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>Khawa phakhan Jisu'n Galilee makheiya John diang Baptize intho nasik Jordan katung aleihong. <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Takkha John in zootmak ah aheiti, “Nang in kei kha baptize nanatho sik keeng,” “takkha nang in keidiang nahong bejei?”<verse eid="MAT 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Halli Jisu'n aleimasang, “Tuunna sikchu nazootpi diro, ajarchu Pathian imanuom rakip kha hintho ah eini'n nithosik eii.” khawa jarra John in aleizootpi jei.<verse eid="MAT 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>Jisu baptize atholi, tui makheiya ahongsuok jei, halli marwaan kha inlongjei, halli Pathian Ratha kha wathu angnga juochumma ama chungnga ajuochong kha aleimu,<verse eid="MAT 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/>Halli marwaanna inphut rasa inkhat in ajuoti, “Hiwahi kei'n kiminriang khet kasapa kha eii, ama chungnga kamalung atai.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Inphut 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Minpkla 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">Matt 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:5">17:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luk 9:35</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Matheemna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12">Mk 1:12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>Khawasuo Ratha khan Jisu kha neelramma Seitan in matheem nasik aruoi jei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="HEB 2:18">Heb 2:18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 4:15">4:15</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>Halli suun li zaan nisoommili bu angeipha, Jisu awon ahongchaam jei. <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Akathamak Seitan khan ama diang ahongli ati, “Nang Pathian Sapa kha na-e inchu, hiwa lung ngaihi waipool uolru ti-inlang chong pero.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>Takkha Jisu'n aleimasang, “Chong inthiang in ati, ‘Waipool bitkhan miring ngai'n ring matormu, takkha Pathian murra kasuok chongramol ngaikhan inring sik eii.’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Innidan 8:3</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>Khawasuo khan akathamak Seitan in Jisu hi Inthiang Khuopui khan aruoiya, Biak-inn insaangkhet chungnga aminngirra, <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/>ama diang ati, “Nang Pathian Sapa kha na-e inchu, natheinuo ah inchoomthaak ro, ajarchu chong inthiang in aril,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Pathian in nang jarra ama tirton ngaidiang chongpeii apesik eii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">nakeii kha lungnga intook maknasik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">inmani'n nangkha naleipom inte.’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Minpkla 91:11</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 91:12">12</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>Jisu'n ama diang amasang, “Hiwahi um chong inthiang in ati, ‘Nang in Napumi Pathian kha madan in enmaro.’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Minpkla 91:11</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 91:12">12</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Khawasuo khan akathamak Seitan in insaangtak chingbungnga aruoiya nuoipilchung rengram rakip le inmani rakip poina ngaikha ama diang aleiminmu. <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>“Nang in keihi kemurkhup thep ah chubei nanatho inchu,” “Kei'n hiwangai rakip hi nang kanapesik eii” Seitan in ati.<verse eid="MAT 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>Khawapha Jisu'n aleimasang, “Siro, Seitan! chong inthiang in ati, ‘Napumi Pathian bitkha chubei thoro halli sepa thoro!’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Minpkla 91:11</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 91:12">12</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>Khawapha akathamak Seitan khan Jisu kha alei mathaanjei; halli marwaan tirton ngai'n injuo ah ama kha inleisanjei.<verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Galilee ah Achuon Phutna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14">Mk 1:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Luk 4:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12"/>John hi mikhumna ah indajei ti Jisu'n ajetpha, Galilee tiang aleisijei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Matt 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mk 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19">Luk 3:19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:20">20</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13"/>Ama'n Nazareth amathaanna, Zebulun li Naphtali ram Galilee tuidiil koolla kaom khuopui Capernaumma asiya ajuo omjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 2:12">Jn 2:12</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>Hiwahi Pathian chongkachoi Isaiah diangnga ileiminril kha huui tungna eii,<verse eid="MAT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>“Zebulun ram li Naphtali ram,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">tuipui lamma kaom Jordan raalkhat tiang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Zaatlop ngai ram, Galilee!<verse eid="MAT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>Aziingna ah leikaom miring ngai'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">war kalok kha inmujei.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">halli thina raliim ramma kaom ngai chungnga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">war kha ajuowar jei.” iti kha huui tungnasik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 9:1">Isa 9:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 9:2">2</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>“Ningmalung thuulru, ajarchu marwaan Rengram kha anaijei!” iti achong kha khawa pha makheiya Jisu'n karil aphut jei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 3:2">Matt 3:2</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Ngakasur mi Mili Ikoi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mk 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>Jisu'n Galilee tuidiil khamma aheiwapha, Peter intia inkoi Simon khat-um anaipa Andrew, ama'n unai inni tuidiil khan leen inwor kha aleimu, ajarchu inmani kha ngakasur in eii. <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>Jisu'n inmani diang ati, “Heiwaru, kei najuiru, halli kei'n nangni mi kasur naminchu kate.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>Khawapha takkhan inleen inda ah anuk inleijui jei.<verse eid="MAT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>Ama'n hin aheiwapha unai inni khat, James le John, Zebedee sa ngai, inpa Zebedee le inruoiya rakuong inkhat ah, inmani leen inboolla in-om aleimu, halli Jisu'n inmani aleikoi, <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>Khawapha takkhan inmani inrakuong khat-um inpa inda ah, ama nuk injuijei.<verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Mipui Minchuna rilpina khat-um mindamna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luk 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>Khawasuo Jisu'n Galilee rampumpui khan asi ah synagogue ngaikhan aleiminchu, halli rengram jarra Chongkahoi ngai arilpiya, rirai rakip karoon mi ngai khat-um kanangai aleimindam. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 9:35">Matt 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:39">Mk 1:39</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>Ama jarra chongngai hi Syria rampumpui kha alei-inthang jei, khawa jarra mi ngai'n ama diang akana, rirai rakip kana ah kapoong ngai: ratha kathamak kaluut, rikei karoon, apang kathi rakip inhong ruoiya Jisu'n inmani rakip kha aleimindam jei. <verse eid="MAT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Galilee le Khuo Soom tiya injet (decapolis), Jerusalem, Judea, khat-um Jordan ram raaltiangnga inphut mipui katamtak in ama nuk inleijuijei.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Chingnga Iminchu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>Jisu'n mipui ngaikha amuli chingtiang khan akaljei, halli in-ongnga ompha, Ama siamruoi ngai'n akoolla inlei-inchun, <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>halli ama'n inmani kha kaminchu aphut jei:<verse eid="MAT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Rawaan Katha ngai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luk 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/>“Ratha ah kasuol kin-eii ti kajet ngaikha rawaan intha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">ajarchu Marwaan Rengram hi inmanita eii.”<verse eid="MAT 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/>“Malung kapoong ngaikha rawaan intha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">ajarchu Pathian in inmani alaminhoi sik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 61:2">Isa 61:2</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/>“Malung kadai ngaikha rawaan intha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">ajarchu nuoipilchung hi inmanita esik asuok.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 37:11">Minpkla 37:11</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/>“Chuon katuun sikbit ah wonchaam tuikaraal ngaikha rawaan intha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">ajarchu Pathian in inmani kha alaminkhop sik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 55:1">Isa 55:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 55:2">2</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/>“Minriang kajet ngaikha rawaan intha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">ajarchu Pathian in inmani diang aminriang sik eii.”<verse eid="MAT 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/>“Malung inthiang ngaikha rawaan intha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">ajarchu inmani'n Pathian kha inlamusik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 24:3">Minpkla 24:3</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 24:4">4</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/>“Hoina daina sik ah chuonkatho ngaikha rawaan intha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">ajarchu inmani kha Pathian sangai tia akoisik eii.”<verse eid="MAT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/>“Chuonkatuun jarra inrachaak ngaikha rawaan intha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">ajarchu Marwaan Rengram hi inmanita eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="1PE 3:14">1 Pet 3:14</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/>“Kei jarra mi ngai'n nangni innaran khat-um innarachaak, halli nangni chungnga kathamak rakip innanoon jei inchu nangni ningrawaan atha.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="1PE 4:14">1 Pet 4:14</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/>Hoiru khat-um rokru, ajarchu marwaanna nangnisik chuonthoman kalok kha inda, ajarchu nangni matiangnga leikaom Pathian chongkachoi ngaikha hinthoa inleirachaak. <char style="rq"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2 Khang 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Chuon 7:52</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Machi khat-um War</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mk 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34">Luk 14:34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:35">35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>“Nangnichu nuoipilchung machi kha ning eii. Takkha machi khan al makjei inchu, khawa kha angtho-thoa nimin-al sik me? khawakha kalekjuonna mi ngai keiiya intou eleiya iteii um anemna ommakjei.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mk 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34">Luk 14:34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:35">35</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/>“Nangnichu nuoipilchung pumpui war kha ning eii. Chingnga insak khuopui kha thup thamak.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 8:12">Jn 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">9:5</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/>Mi ngai'n sariakmei kha inminkaili kok nuoiya damu; khawa rathuulla sariakmei kechungnga indali, innsuungnga kaom mirakip munasik inminwar. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mk 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Luk 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">11:33</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/>Kha angnga mi ngai'n nangni chountho katha kha inmuwa marwaanna kaom ning Pa kha minpaak nasik nangni war kha mi ngai maikuungnga warrase. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1PE 2:12">1 Pet 2:12</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dan jarra Minchuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>“Kei'n Moses Dan khat-um Pathian chongkachoi ngai chongkha kaminmang sik kijuo eii tia ngaidonmaru, keichu kaminmang kijuo emong, takkha khawa ngai huui kamintung kijuo eii.”<verse eid="MAT 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/>Ajarchu kei'n nangni diang inthiangnga kiril hi eii. Marwaan li nuoipil ahek maklaiseng, Dan chongramol kasiin khet emakli wiarkhat bit um hiwarakip atungmaklaiseng inmangnuni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:18. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiwarakip atungmaklaiseng; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli hiwa minchuna rakip hi pui lahongtung sik eii </char></note> <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 16:17">Luk 16:17</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/>Khawa jarra, tuka-ang inkhat in chongpeii karra akasiin khet inkhat kha amakoiya mi ngaidiang khajek kha thoru tia aminchu inchu marwaan Rengramma akasiin khet esik eii, Inkhattiang, tuka-ang inkhat in Dan kha ajuiya mi ngaidiang aminchu inchu, amakha marwaan Rengramma akalok khet esik eii. <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/>Ajarchu kei'n nangni diang kiril hi eii, nangni chuontho katuun kha Dan ocha ngai khat-um Pharisee ngai neek ah kheella ningthomak inchu, nangni marwaan Rengram supluut luut nutun.<verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akaraang jarra Minchuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>“Mi ngai'n matiang khan inleiril kha nangni'n ningjetjei, ‘Mi thatmaru; tuka-ang inkhat in mi athat inchu achungnga chongtan kangar kha omsik eii.’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Suok 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Innidan 5:17</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/>Takkha tuun kei'n nangni diang kati: tuka-ang inkhat in ama unai ngaidiang araang inchu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:22. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">araang inchu; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">manuscript lekkhat achu ajar omleiya naraang inchu</char></note> chongtan kangar amusik eii, halli tuka-ang inkhat in a-u anai ngaikha ‘Anemna kaboi nang!’ tia akoi inchu ama kha Katar ngai maikuungnga inkeisuosik eii, halli tuka-ang inkhat in ka-am anemna kaboi nang atia akoi inchu chikaom meikhurra achulsik eii. <verse eid="MAT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/>Khawa jarra nang in Pathian diang maichaam khan kutchoi nape siktiang na-u nanai ngai'n nachungnga angmekhat hoimakna kaom kha nahong ngaidon inchu, <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/>nakutchoi kha maichaam ma-khan da-inlang, woikhat kirnook inlang na-u nanai ngai khale juo-inzoot naru, halli heikir inlang Pathian diang nakutchoi kha jopero.”<verse eid="MAT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/>“Nang inhalpui mi inkhat in nang chungnga zootmak ah chongtanna munna anaruoi inchu, lamma ningsi lai innot ah inzootnaru, kha emak inchu ni-inhalpui ama'n nangkha chongkatanpa diang khan napeta, halli chongkatanpa in nangkha mikhumna kangaak ngaidiang napeta nang mikhumna khan nadasik eii.” <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/>Kei'n nang diang inthiangnga karil, nang in ahekna napesik kasuok sial kha nape maklaiseng khawa munna inphut heisuok thanunijei.<verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zool-inthai jarra Minchuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>“Zool-inthai emaru, ‘inleiti kha nangni'n ningjetjei.’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Suok 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Innidan 5:18</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/>Takkha tuun kei'n nangni diang kati, numeisa inkhat kha taksa manuom nakhan ka-en mi rakip in ama malungnga ama khale inruoiya zool-inthai kha ejei.”<verse eid="MAT 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/>Halli namit changtiang khan nangkha manu ah anamachul sik e-inchu, kel-inlang kalekjuonro! ajarchu napumtak kha meikhurra kaminluut sikneek ah nataksa saram inkhat kamang khan nang sik ah athawiai. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 18:9">Matt 18:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:47">Mk 9:47</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/>Nakut changtiang khan nangkha manu ah anamachulsik e-inchu, tan-inlang kalekjuonro! ajarchu napumtak kha meikhurra kaluutsik neek ah nataksa saram inkhat kamang khan nangsik ah athawiai. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 18:8">Matt 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:43">Mk 9:43</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sangram Inthenna jarra Minchuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Matt 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Mk 10:11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>“Hiwahi inleiril jei, ‘tuka-ang in anumei inthenpui inchu, inthenpuina chongmajia kha numeisanu diangkhan perase.’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 19:12">Levi 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 30:2">Teelna 30:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:21">Innidan 23:21</ref> </char><verse eid="MAT 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/>Takkha tuun kei'n nangni diang kati: zool-inthai jarra elekleiya, mi inkhat in anumei inthenpui ngai asuok ah halli anumei khan inn aneinook inchu ama'n anumei kha zool-inthai amin ejei, halli numeisanu kaneinook mi kha um zool-inthai amin ejei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 19:9">Matt 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Mk 10:11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1 Cor 7:10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Chongkhomaak jarra Minchuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>“Nangni'n, matiangnga mi ngai'n inleiril kha nangni'n ningjetjei, khachu ‘Nangni chong inkhitna kha makoi maru, takkha angme chongkhomaak ni-insaam kha Pumi diang khan thoro.’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 19:12">Levi 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 30:2">Teelna 30:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:21">Innidan 23:21</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/>Takkha kei'n nangni diang karil: Chong ning inkhit pha chongkhomaak insaam maru, marwaan rakook inlang khomaak insaam maru, ajarchu hiwahi Pathian in-ongna eii, <char style="rq"><ref loc="JAS 5:12">Jam 5:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:22">Matt 23:22</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/>emakli nuoipil rakook inlang-um khomaak insaam maru, ajarchu ama ke dana kha eii; emakli Jerusalem rakook inlang-um khomaak insaam maru, ajarchu akalok Reng khuopui kha eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 48:2">Minpkla 48:2</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/>Nalu ma-ou inlang khomaak insaam maro, ajarchu nang in samramol inkhat bit um minbang kate emakli minwom kate nimator emak. <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/>Hintiro ‘Oh’ natili ‘Oh’ tiro emakli ‘Ngang’ natili ‘Ngang’ tiro. hiwa chungtiang heikasuok ngaisengchu Kathamak Mipa makheiya aheikasuok eii.”<verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phaphu luok jarra Minchuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29">Luk 6:29</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:30">30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>“Hinna inleiti kha nangni'n ningjet, ‘Mit inkhat sik ah mit inkhat, ha inkhat sik ah ha inkhat.’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 21:24">Suok 21:24</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:20">Levi 24:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:21">Innidan 19:21</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/>Takkha kei'n nangni diang kati, nangni'n akathamak mi kha phaphu luok maru. Tuka-ang inkhat in nangem changtiang kabeen inchu, nangem kaangkhat tiang um doupiro. <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/>Halli tuka-ang inkhat in nang kha chongtanna khan anaruoiya nasongkol aleizoot ah chongkal inchu, ama diang khan napuonsil kha um leirase. <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/>Khat-um tuka-ang rup inkhat in aphur kha nazootmak pumma mile inkhat naminchoi inchu, mile inni choipiro. <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/>Tuka-ang inkhat in nang diang phur khat anani pha, ama diang khan pero, halli tuka-ang inkhat in phur khat apuukzoot pha, ama diang khan minpuuk ro.<verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ni-inhalpui ngai Minriang sik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27">Luk 6:27</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:28">28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>“Hinna inleiti kha nangni'n ningjet, ‘Na-indiang na-inwaipui ngaikha minriangro, ni-inhalpui ngaikha matirro.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/>Takkha tuun nangni diang kei'n kati: nangni inhalpui ngaikha minriangro, khat-um nangni kanaminpoong ngai sikbit ah nina neipiru, <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/>Kha angnga marwaanna kaom ning Pa sangai kha ning esik eii, ajarchu ama'n akase li akatha ngai chungnga in-angnga ama'n kani aminsuok, halli mi katha li mi kathamak ngai sik um ruo aminsur. <verse eid="MAT 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/>Ajarchu nangni'n nangni kanaminriang mi ngaibit ningminriang inchu Pathian in nangni diang angtho-thoa thoman anapesik me? rampar kakhoom ngai innum khan intho emak abe! <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/>Khat-um nangni'n ning-u ningnai ngaidiang bit khoya ningtho inchu, mi ngai diangnga nangni'n ang kakheel ningthome? zaatlop ngai innum khan intho emak abe!<verse eid="MAT 5:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/>Khawa jarra Marwaanna kaom ning Pa in pui itung angnga Nangni um puikatung kha eru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 19:2">Levi 19:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:13">Innidan 18:13</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Pena jarra Minchuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>“Mipui maikuungnga inmani namu nasik ah nangni chuon katha ngaikha thomak nasik inringtheiru, khawakha ningtho inchu Marwaanna kaom ning Pa diangnga nangnisik thoman iteii um ommak.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 23:5">Matt 23:5</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/>“Khawa jarra mi ngai naminpaak nasik akatha inleem ngai'n synagogues ah khat-um lampuiya intho angnga, nangni'n kutchoi ningpe pha malar maru. Kei'n inthiangnga nangni diang kati, inmani'n inthoman kha kahuuiya inralaang suojei.” <verse eid="MAT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/>Nangni'n kaneimak ngaidiang kutchoi ningpe pha ningkut changtiang ningtho kha ningwei tiangnga ningkut in jetmarase, <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/>Ajarchu ruuk ah kanamu ning Pa in nangni diang anape kirna sik ah; ningpe kha ruuk ah inpe erase.<verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nina jarra Minchuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luk 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>“Nangni'n ningni pha, akatha omchan kathongai angmaru! ajarchu mi rakip in inmani inmu nasik ah, chubei thona inna khat-um lamraki ngaikhan inngirra kani inmanuom. Kei'n nangni diang inthiangnga kati, inmani'n inthoman kha kahuuiya inmujei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 23:5">Matt 23:5</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/>Takkha nangnichu ningni pha, ning innsuung luutru, ning innkhar kha khar inlang, mit ah inmumak, ning Pa ama diang niru. Halli ruuk ah kanamu, ning Pa in nangni diang najuope kirte.”<verse eid="MAT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/>“Halli nangni ningni pha, zaatlop ngai itho angnga anemna kaboiya inlet-inlet ah nikirmaru, ajarchu inmani'n kasoot ah inni kha inpathian ngai'n najetpite tia inngaidon. <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/>Khawa jarra inmani angmaru, ajarchu nangni'n ama diang ningni maklai nangni sik ah angme insam kaom kha ning Pa in anajetpi. <verse eid="MAT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/>Khawa jarra hintho inlang nangni'n niru:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">Marwaanna kaom kin Pa:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">Naraming kaya omrase;<verse eid="MAT 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/>Narengram juotung rase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">marwaanna nalungdou intho angnga nuoipilchungnga inthorase.<verse eid="MAT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/>Keini sik arei kaom bak le in awini napero.<verse eid="MAT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/>Halli keini chungnga kamasial ngai kinrangaidam angnga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">Keini itho masialna ngaikha narangaidamro.<verse eid="MAT 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/>Halli keini matheemna khan naminchulmaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">takkha Kathamak ah inphut keini nasanro. Ajarchu Rengram, ranak khat-um lurna-lianna ngaihi hektik kaboiya nangta erase Amen.”<verse eid="MAT 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/>Ajarchu “Nangni'n mi ngai intho masialna ngaikha ningngaidampi inchu, marwaanna kaom ningpa Pathian in nangni kha um anarangaidam sik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MRK 11:25">Mk 11:25</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/>Takkha nangni'n mi ngai ningngaidam mak inchu, ningpa Pathian innum nangni itho masial ngaikhan narangaidampi nuni.<verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bu ngeijarra Minchuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>“Halli nangni'n bu ningngei phakhan, akatha omchan katho ngai angnga maisuo kapoong malarmaru. Ajarchu inmani'n bu kinngei ti mi rakip in namurasu tia kapoong meelsuo inmalar. Kei'n inthiangnga kati, inmani inthoman kha kahuuiya inmusuojei.” <verse eid="MAT 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/>Takkha nangnichu bu ningei pha, ninglu ah sariak kanoot ru halli ningmai phiaru, <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/>halli ningbu ngei kha mi ngai'n jetmarasu, takkha mit ah inmumak ning Pa bit khan ajetsik eii. Halli ruuk ah kanamu, ning Pa in nangni diang najuope sik eii.<verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Marwaanna Inchongna ngai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33">Luk 12:33</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:34">34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>“Inngeii li thir-ek ibakmator halli inruup ngai'n inmakoiya inmaruup mator neipilchung hin nangni sik ah neinaak bukmaru.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="JAS 5:2">Jam 5:2</ref>,<ref loc="JAS 5:3">3</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/>Takkha inngeii li thir-ek inbak matormakjei halli inruup ngai innum inmakoiya inmaruup theimak marwaanna nangni sik ah neinaak kha inbuk ru. <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/>Ajarchu naneinaak omna khan namalung um aomsik eii.<verse eid="MAT 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Taksa sik ah War</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luk 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>“Taksa sik ah meiserchu mit eii, khawa jarra namit atha inchu, napumpui kha war in asipsik eii, <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/>takkha namit athamak inchu, napum kha kaziing in asipsik eii. Khawa jarra nasuungnga kaom war kha aziing inchu, angtuk chikaom tak ah kaziing mejei!”<verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pathian li Neinaak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luk 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>“Tu inkhat innum karu inni suok ematornutun; ajarchu inkhat amatir li inkhatpa kha aminriang sik eii, emakli ama'n inkhat sik nangir li inkhatpa kha donnuni. Khawa jarra nangni'n Pathian li sialsum inni suok emator nutun.”<verse eid="MAT 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>“Hiwa sik ah kei'n nangni diang kiril eii, nangni'n ringna sikbit ah angme baksik, angme insik halli puondiar sik jarra angme kinthosik ti-inlang ningmalung mindongmaru.” Ringkhuo khan bak li in neek ah halli nipum in puondiar neek ah kakheel emak abe? <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/>Chungnga wa ngaikhi enru, inmani'n wor um wormu, aat um aatmu, halli sapangnga um bukmu, takkha marwaanna kaom ning Pa in inmani kha aminbak! nangnichu wa ngai neek ah aman katam emakchube? <verse eid="MAT 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/>Halli nangni tu inkhat in amalung minpoongli aringkhuo lekkhat kaminsei mator ningommabe?<verse eid="MAT 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/>“Halli puondiar jarra ang sikme malung poongna ningnei? Leiya rei ngaiso angtho-thoa inmoongme enru: inmani chuonnum thomu, pat um khermu,<verse eid="MAT 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/>takkha kei'n nangni diang kati, khachu Reng Solomon in inei neilenung rakip ah inliang innum hiwa reipar ngai thadan leiphamak.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1 Reng 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2 Khang 9:3-6</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/>Takkha awini moongnga kaom leihar ziingngachu meiya haalsik ramma kaom leihar kha Pathian in hituk katha ah aminliang inchu, E, ngamna kasiin ngai, ama'n nangnile kheella naminliang makniabe?<verse eid="MAT 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/>“Khawa jarra angme baksik, angme insik, emakli, angme kasilsik tia malung minpoong maru.” <verse eid="MAT 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/>(Ajarchu zaatlop ngai'n hiwa phur rakip hi in-entok.) Halli marwaanna kaom ning Pa in phur rakip hi nangni diang arei om ti anajetpi. <verse eid="MAT 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/>Takkha nangni'n Pathian Rengram khat-um ama dikna kha ma-insa ah entokru, halli phur rakip hi nangni diang kheella anapedel sik eii. <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/>Khawa jarra ziingnga sik malung minpoong maru; ajarchu ziingnga sikchu ziingnga atheinuo ah malung inpoongte. Nisuo khat ah poongna khan nisuo khat sik ah kahunthek kha ejei.<verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Aleiilak ngai chungnga Chongtan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37">Luk 6:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:38">38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41">41</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:42">42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>“Mi leiilak chungnga chong tanmaro, kha e-inchu Pathian innum nangni chungnga chong natannuni,<verse eid="MAT 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/>ajarchu nangni chongtan khale in-angrip ah, nangni kha chong analatansik eii, halli nangni'n ningjuo uol dan khale in-angrip ah nangni diang um ana uol sik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MRK 4:24">Mk 4:24</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/>Halli namit ah kaom thinglek khachu khaisik ngaidon mak cheya, na-u nanai ngai mit ah kaom madir kha angsik ah ni-enme? <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/>Halli namit ah thinglek ompumma, angtho-thoa na-u nanai ngaidiang, namit ah kaom madir kha kei'n nakhaipi kate, natisikme? <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/>Akatha inleem nang! nang in ma-insakhet ah namit ah kaom thinglek kha khaidiro, halli khawasuoli nang in na-u nanai ngai mit ah kaom madir kha inthiangnga khaisik munate.<verse eid="MAT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>“Inthiang phurkha ui ngaidiang pemaru; halli ninglungman katam ngaikha wokngai matiang dapimaru. Inmani'n khawakha inkeiiya intouli khan inhong-inheiya nangnikha na-eicha.”<verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Niru, Entokru, Rakhoongru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>“Niru, nangni diang napete; Entokru, nangni'n muningte; halli inkhar kha rakhoongru, nangni diang namalong pite. <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/>Ajarchu akani mi rakip in inchang, aka-entok rakip in inmu, halli akarakhoong amadiang inmalong pisik eii. <verse eid="MAT 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/>Nangni karra tume asapa in bu anili lung amadiang kapesik? <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/>Emakli nga ananili amadiang maruul kapesik? <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/>Nangni ningthamak innum, ningsa ngaidiang akatha kutchoi ningpethei inchu, marwaanna kaom ning Pa in akani inmani diang kheella akatha phur kha apemaksik!”<verse eid="MAT 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/>“Khawa jarra nangni'n mi ngai ningchungnga ningmintho zoot angrakip kha nangni innum inmani diang khan thoru: ajarchu hiwahin Moses Dan khat-um Pathian chongkachoi ngai minchuna kha eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 6:31">Luk 6:31</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akasiin Kot</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luk 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>“Nangni'n kot kasiin khan luutru, ajarchu poongnamun katung kot kha alok khat-um lam kha jui abei, halli mi katam in khawakha injui. <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/>Takkha ringna katung kotchu asiin khat-um lamkha jui-intak, halli khawa kaluut mi intoom.”<verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Thingkuung le Akara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43">Luk 6:43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:44">44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>“Keelngam omchan katho, halli asuung ngachu awonkachaam malang angnga nangni diangnga kahong Pathian chongkachoi inleem ngaikha insingtheiru.” <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/>Nangni'n angme intho khan inmani jetningte. Raling kuung makheiya theibom, halli raling kuungnga theichang inra ngai abe? <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/>Khawa jarra akatha thingkuung rakip in akatha kara inra, khat-um kathamak thingkuung in kathamak kara kha inra. <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/>Akatha thingkuung in kathamak kara inramak, halli akathamak thingkuung khan akatha kara karamak.<verse eid="MAT 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/>Akatha kara kakaramak thingkuung rakipkha intukkhiak ah meisuungnga indeengluut. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 3:10">Matt 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:9">Luk 3:9</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/>Khawajarra, inmani kara khan nangni'n inmani kha jetningte. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Matt 12:33</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kei Nangni Najetmong</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luk 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>“Kei diang ‘Pumi, Pumi’ kanati mi rakip in marwaan rengram kha luutnunu, takkha marwaanna kaom ka-Pa lungdou akatho ama bitkhan aluutsik eii. <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/>Chongtan Nikhuo khan, mi katamtak in keidiang intisik eii, Pumi, Pumi! nang ramingnga keini'n Pathian chong kha kinleiril emak abe, nang ramingnga keini'n ratha kathamak angjet ngai kinleinong suok emak abe, khat-um inlakchuon angjet kinleitho emak abe?<verse eid="MAT 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/>Khawa phakhan kei'n inmani diang inthiangnga karilsik eii, Kei'n angtikniteii nangni najetmong; nangni thomak sik kathongai, kei diangnga inphut suoktaru! <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Minpkla 6:8</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Inn Kasak Inni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luk 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>“Khawa jarra, kei kachong ngaihi jetli kajui miring rakip kha lungpui chungnga a-inn kasak akasing mi inkhatle in-ang.” <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/>Halli ruo katamma ahongsur, tuidung kha ahonglian, khat-um thi kana ah ahongraangnga inn kha aseem jei, takkha inn kha lung chungnga insak jarra leipurmak.<verse eid="MAT 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/>“Halli kei kachong ngaihi jetli kajuimak miring rakipchu neel chungnga inn kasak aka-am mi inkhatle in-ang. <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/>Halli ruo katamma ahongsurra, tuidung ahonglian, khat-um thi kana ah ahongraangnga, inn kha aseempur jei. Khawa kha setheiya apurjei!”<verse eid="MAT 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Thomatorna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28"/>Jisu'n hiwa rakip arilsuo pha, mipui ngai'n ama minchuna kha inleingak, <char style="rq"><ref loc="MRK 1:22">Mk 1:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:32">Luk 4:32</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29"/>ajarchu ama'n inmani Dan karu ngai khale in-angleiya; thomatorna kanei inkhat ah aleiminchu.<verse eid="MAT 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Mi mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mk 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>Jisu'n chingnga inphut ajuochum pha, mipui katamtak in ama nuk inleijui. <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>Halli enru, takbangri karoon mi inkhat in ama koolla ahongnga chubei thoa ati, “Ocha, nang in nanazootpi inchu, keihi nanaminthiang mator.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:2. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kei naminthiang ro: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hiwa rirai kana mi hi inthiang mak ah in-ngaidon</char></note><verse eid="MAT 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>Jisu'n akut aheisoonna ama kha akatook ah ati, “Kei'n kazootjei,” “Nang kadam etaro!” Khawaphatak takbangri kha inthiangjei.<verse eid="MAT 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/>Halli Jisu'n ama diang ati, “Rangairo! nang tu-inkhat diang rilpimaro, takkha siro, thiampu diang napumtak juominmuro, halli inmani diang nang nadam jei tina sakhi inpenasik; Moses chongpeii dungjuiya pesik doiphur kha juopero.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Levi 14:1-32</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Roman Lamkakeipa Suok Mindamna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luk 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>Halli Jisu'n Capernaum aluut pha, Roman raalmi rajakhat lamkakei inkhat in ama diang hongnga, nasanro ahongti: <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>“Ocha, kasuokpa kha apang kaangkhat kathi kana khan kapoongtak ah ana ah sithei mak ah inna azaalla omjei.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>Jisu'n amadiang ati, “Kei'n sikata halli ama kamindamsik eii,”<verse eid="MAT 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>“Emak ocha,”Raalmi rajakhat lamkakeipa khan aheimasang, nang in ka-inna nahongsik hi “Kei rahoi suokmong, takkha chongbit kha pero kasuok kanapa kha damte. <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>Ajarchu Kei kapumtak um, ranak kanei mi inkhat nuoiya kaom ka-eii, halli kanuoiya raalmi in-om, halli hiwa mipa diang, ‘Siro!’ katili ama asi; mikhat diang, ‘Heiwaro!’ katili aheiwa; halli kasuokpa diang, ‘Hi thoro katili’ ama'n atho.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>Jisu'n hiwahi ajet pha, angak ah anuk kajui mipui ngaidiang ati, “Kei'n nangni diang inthiangnga karil, Kei'n Israel ngai karra hituk ngamna kanei miring inkhat um lamumong.<verse eid="MAT 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/>Kei'n nangnidiang karil, nisuo tiang li niluutna tiangnga inphut mikatam khat hong-inta marwaan rengramma bubakna khan Abraham, Isaac khat-um Jacob ngaile in in-ong suomsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 13:29">Luk 13:29</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/>Takkha Rengramma kaom sik ngai khan mi ngaikha rengram makheiya aziingna munkhan indiangjuon sik eii, khawamun khan inmani chapna li hakarialna esik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Matt 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luk 13:28</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>Khawasuoli Jisu'n raalmi rajakhat lamkakeipa diang aheiti, “Na-inna siro, na-inngamna angnga nangsik intho rase.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 8:13">Halli khawa phatak khan asuokpa kha adamjei.<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Mikatamtak Amindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mk 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>Jisu'n Peter inna aheiwa pha, Peter tarpi ritun ana ah zaalmunna izaalkha aleimu. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>Ama'n akut akatook pha ritun khan amathaanjei; halli ama intheiya ama kha sepa aphut jei.<verse eid="MAT 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Kholei aheitung pha, mipui in Jisu diang raikhuo kaluut angjet inheiruoi. Jisu'n kana rakip aleimindam khat-um chongnga ratha inthiangmak ngaikha aleipuutsuok.<verse eid="MAT 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/>Pathian chongkachoi Isaiah diangnga ileiminril, “Ama apumtak in eini nana ngai kha anakhaipi khat-um niri nirai ngai anaroonpi” ti pui tungnasik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Isa 53:4</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Nukkajui sik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luk 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>Jisu ama mipui ngai'n inhei-um amu pha, tuidiil khamkhat tiang rakaannasik asiamruoi ngaidiang chong aleipeii. <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>Dan ocha inkhat ama diang aleihongnga ahongti. “Ocha,” “Kei nasina rakip nanuk kajuisik ka-insuuk suojei.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>Khawapha Jisu'n amadiang aleiti, “Ram-ui ngai'n inkhur innei, halli lairalak ah wa ngai'n rabu innei, takkha Miring Sapa alu danasik munchu ommak.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>Siamruoi karra inkhat in ati, “Ocha, kapa kaphuum kasisik hi ma-insakhet ah nazootpidiro.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Takkha Jisu'n ama diang aleimasang, “Kanuk najuiro,” “Halli akathi ngaikhan inmani intheinuo ah inphuum rasu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Thipui Mindai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mk 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>Jisu'n rakuong inkhat suungnga aleiluut pha, asiamruoi ngai ama nuk inleijui. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Halli enru, jetlei-theileiya tuidiil chungnga akangartak thipui inkhat ahongraangnga, rakuong kha tuithisiip in aheimakhujei; takkha Jisu chu aleizaalla alei-om. <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>Khawakhan siamruoi ngai'n insia ama injuokeitheili inti, “Pumi, nasanro!” “Keini kinthisik ejei!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>Halli Jisu'n aleimasang, “E ngamna kasiin ngai, angsikme khatuk ningchi?” Halli ama'n intheiya thikaraang khat-um tuithisiip kha chong apeli akhaapjei; halli pumdai ajuodaijei.<verse eid="MAT 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>Halli mi ngaikhan inngak ah inti, “Thikaraang li tuithisiip ngai innum achong injui, hiwahi ang mi chat me?”<verse eid="MAT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Raikhuo iruoi Mi Imindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mk 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>Jisu'n Gadara tuidiil ram raalkhat tiang ahongpha, ranak kanei thaanna inphut heikasuok raikhuo iruoi miring inni alei-intongpui. Inmani kha chikaomthei in ejarra, khawa lam khan tu inkhat um leisi matormu. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/>Halli enru, inmani'n inkheekli inti, “E Pathian Sapa, angme nang in keini diangnga nimanuom? apha heitungmaklai nang in keini naminpoong sik niheiwabe?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Inmani makheiya kalaakdet ah wok rahooi katamtak inbak ah inlei-om. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Halli raikhuo ngaikhan Jisu diang inti, “Keini nanapuut suoksik e-inchu, wok rahooi ngai suungnga keini natirro.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>Jisu'n “Siru,” inmani diang ati; halli inmani'n inheisuok ah wok ngai suungnga inleiluut jei. Enru, Wok rahooi rakip ngaikha insuk tuidiil pangtiang sumpalingkhang inthoa tuiya intali inthijei.<verse eid="MAT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Khawapha wok kakhaal ngaikhan intaanna khuopuiya inluut ah, akasuok thurchi rakip khat-um raikhuo in iruoi mi ngai jarra inleirilpi jei. <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Khawa jarra khuopui makheiya miring rakip in Jisu inmupui nasik inheisuokjei; khat-um inmani'n ama inmupha, inmani ram makheiya mathaan nasik inleiti.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Apangkathi Miring inkhat mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mk 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>Jisu'n rakuong chuongnga khat-um tuidiil rakaanna akhuopui tiang akirnookjei, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:1. </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Akhuopui: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Capernaum (4:13. hin enru)</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>Halli enru, miring lekkhat in zaalmumna zaalla kaom apangkathi miring inkhat, ama diang inhongruoi. Jisu'n inmani ngamna kha amu pha, apangkathi miringpa diang ama'n ati, “Kasapa namalung minhoiro! namanu ngaikha kana-ngaidam pijei.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Halli enru, dan ocha lekkhat in, “Hiwa mipa in Pathian diang kase ah aril jei!” tia inmani inkhat li inkhat inlei-inti<verse eid="MAT 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>Jisu'n inmani ingaidon angme ti ajet ah aheiti, “Nangni'n kha ka-ang kathamak angsik ah ningngaidon me? <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/>‘Namanu ngai kha kana-ngaidam suojei,’ emakli ‘Inthei-inlang siro’ tihi, hume kheella kabei? <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/>Kha-enchu kei'n nangni diang nuoipil chungnga Miring Sapa in manu ngai ngaidamna ranak anei tikha namalarpi kate.” Halli apangkathi mipa diang ama'n ati, “Inthei ro, napher rut inlang, inna siro!”<verse eid="MAT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>Mipa kha intheiya inna asijei. <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>Mipui'n khawa inmu pha, inmani'n inleichi, khat-um mipui diang hika-ang ranak kape Pathian kha inleiminpaak.<verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Matthew ikoi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mk 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Jisu'n khawa mun amathaanna, khat-um ama'n hin aheiwa pha, ama'n rampar kakhoom araming Matthew inti inkhat, achuon thona munna, in-ongnga kaom aleimu. Ama'n ama diang ati, “Kei najuiro.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Matthew in intheiya anuk aleijui jei.<verse eid="MAT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>Jisu'n Matthew inna bu abaklai, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:10. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Matthew inna; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli ama inna (khachu Jisu inna)</char></note> rampar kakhoom katamtak ngaile aleiilak manu karoon ngai'n inheiwa ah Jisu le ama siamruoi ngai bubakna khan inlei in-ong. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 15:1">Luk 15:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 15:2">2</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/>Pharisee lekkhat in hiwahi inleimu khat-um ama siamruoi ngaidiang inleirakel, “Angsik ah me nangni ochapa'n hika-ang rampar kakhoom khat-um manu karoon ngaile inruoiya inbaksuom?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>Jisu'n inmani iti aleijet halli aleimasang, “Akanamak mi ngai sik achu kathiam rangai mak, takkha tuka-ang akana ngai sik bit chu arangai.<verse eid="MAT 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/>Si inlang entokru chong inthiang in angme iti tikha: ‘Kei imanuom khachu riangwai kha eii, sa ah doiphur inpe kha emak.’ Kei'n kijuo hichu mi kadik ngai kakoi emong, takkha manu karoon ngai kakoi kijuo eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 12:7">Matt 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos 6:6</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bu ngeijarra chongrakel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mk 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>John Baptist nukkajui ngai'n Jisu diang inhongnga inhongrakel, “Keini le Pharisee ngai'n bak-in kinngei, takkha nasiamruoi ngai inchu angsik ah me bak-in inngeimak?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>Jisu'n aleimasang, “Moipa in moiruoina khan omlaiseng asap-asuon ngai poong inte tia nangni ningngaidon be? kha emak! Takkha nikhuo kha laheiwate inmani diangnga inphut moipa kha inlaruoi suok nasik, khanna inphut inmani bak-in inngei sik eii.”<verse eid="MAT 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/>“Tu inkhat innum songkol maruo chungnga puon kathar lek khat kathuidel ngai mu, akathar inkathuidel puon khan heikeirinta khat-um songkol kachet kha kheella achetpui sik eii. <verse eid="MAT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/>Tu inkhat innum tuong kamaruo khan theibom tuithar kha thunnamu, ajarchu tuong kha koita, theibomtui kha inhiai sik eii, khat-um theibomtui tuong kha ajuomang sik eii, Khawa rathuulla, theibom tuithar kha theibomtui tuong kathar khan inthun, halli innireella katha tak ah inda.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akalokpa sanu le Jisu puon kakatok numeisanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mk 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>Jisu'n hiwa arillaitak khan, Jihudi chuonkaroon inkhat ama diang aleihong, ama maikuungnga inbok ah ati, “Kei kasanu hi tuuntak khan athijei; takkha heiwa inlang ama chungnga nakut najuoda piro, halli ama hongringte.”<verse eid="MAT 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>Khawa jarra Jisu intheiya ama nuk ajuijei, khat-um ama siamruoi ngai ama le inleisi suomjei.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20"/>Kumsoomleini thikasarra kana numeisa inkhat Jisu nuk ah aheijui khat-um ama puonmor aleikatook. <verse eid="MAT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21"/>Ama'n atheinuo ah inti, “Kei'n ama puon bit kakatook inchu, Kei kadam sik eii.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>Jisu'n numeisanu diang ahei-inlet ah aleiti, “Kasanu, malung minsiin maro! Na-inngamna khan anamindam jei.” Khawa pha chei khan numeinu kha adamjei.<verse eid="MAT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>Khawasuoli Jisu'n chuon karoonpa inna aleiluut. Akathinu phuumna sik ah khuongli dar katho ngaile mipui chorkati ngaikha ama'n ajomu pha, <verse eid="MAT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/>ama'n ati, “Mi rakip suokru! Naipangnu hi kathi emak ama hi akalazaal eii!” Khawa pha khan inmani rakip in ama innuipuina inleinei. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Takkha mipui masuoksuoli, Jisu'n naipangnu omna inn tiang aluut ah akut ajuo ma-ou ah ama ahong intheijei. <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Hiwa chong ngai jar rakip hi rampumpui inthangjei.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Mitkacho Miring inni Mindam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>Jisu'n khawa mun mathaanna, khat-um ama'n hin aheiwapha, mitkacho miring inni'n ama kajui inleiphut. “David Sapa, Keini naminriangro!” tia inmani'n inleikheek.<verse eid="MAT 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>Jisu'n innsuung aluutsuo pha, mitkacho miring inni ngai ama koolla inheiwa, khat-um inmanidiang ama'n aleirakel, “Kei'n nangni kanamindam mator tihi ning-inngamna be?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Inmani'n inleimasang, “Oh, ocha!”<verse eid="MAT 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>Halli Jisu'n inmani mit katookpiya khat-um aleitipi, nangni inngamna dungjuiya ningchungnga, “Hiwa kasuok etarase!” <verse eid="MAT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>halli inmani inmit inhongmujei. Jisu'n chong kangartak inmani diang aleiril, “Enru tu inkhat diang um hiwahi rilmaru!”<verse eid="MAT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Takkha inmani inmathaanna khawa ram pumpui khan Jisu jarra chongngai inleiril thangjei.<verse eid="MAT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Chongkasuokmak Mi inkhat mindam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>Inmani'n insuok pha, miring lekkhat in Jisu diang raikhuo kaluut chong kasuokmak miring inkhat inhongruoi. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Takkha raikhuo kha apuutsuok li apuutsuokmak, mipa kha chong ahongriljei, halli mi rakip inleingakjei. “Keini'n Israel suungnga hinna kati iteii khat-um lamu ngaimung!” inleiti.<verse eid="MAT 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/>Takkha Pharisee ngai'n inleiti, “Ama'n raikhuo ngai waikaroonpa ranak ah hiwa raikhuo ngai ipuutsuok eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:25">Matt 10:25</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:24">12:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22">Mk 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:15">Luk 11:15</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n mi ngai minriangna anei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>Jisu'n khuopui rakip le khuo rakip khan aleisi. Synagogue suungnga ama'n aleininchu, Rengram jarra chongkahoi ngai aleiril khat-um rirai kana mi ngaile kana rakip aleimindam. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 4:23">Matt 4:23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:39">Mk 1:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:44">Luk 4:44</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/>Ama'n mipui ngai kha akakhaal kaboi keelngam ngai angnga inmalung inpoong khat-um kasansik kaboi kha amupha, amalungnga inmani kha aleipoongpui. <char style="rq"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Teelna 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1 Reng 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:16">2 Khang 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Ezek 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:34">Mk 6:34</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/>Khawa jarra ama'n asiamruoi ngaidiang aleiti, “Leirakhool sik chu alok, takkha khawa akarakhool sik chuonmi chu intoom. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 10:2">Luk 10:2</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/>Ama leikarakhool sik chuonmi kha ajuotir nasik leimapupa diangkhan niru.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Tirton Soomleini ngai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mk 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>Jisu'n ama siamruoi soomleini ngai aleikoichun halli ratha kathamak ngai puutsuok nasik khat-um rirai le kana rakip mindam nasik thomatorna ranak inmani diang aleipeii. <verse eid="MAT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Hiwa ngaihi tirton soomleini ngai raming ngaikha eii: Inkhat changna, Simon (Peter tia inkoi) khat-um ama anaipa Andrew; James le ama anaipa John, Zebedee sangai; <verse eid="MAT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>Philip le Bartholomew; Thomas khat-um Matthew, rampar kakhuompa; James Alphaeus sapa, le Thaddaeus; <verse eid="MAT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>Zealot Simon, khat-um Judas Iscariot, Jisu kapesuokpa.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Soomleini ngai Chuontho sik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mk 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>Hiwa miring soomleini ngaihi anuoiya minchuna angjet ngaile inruoiya Jisu'n aleitir suok: “Zaatlop ngai ram khan simaru emakli Samaritan khuopui khannum luutmaru.” <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/>Khawa rathuulla, Israel mi ngai kamangnga kaom keelngam ngaidiang nangni siru. <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/>Nangni'n hin ningsipha, Marwaan Rengram hi anaijei! ti-inlang rilru. <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/>Akana kha mindamru, akathi kha minring nookru, tuka-ang chikaom taksa kana in kana ah kaom ngai mindamru, raikhuo ngaikha puutsuokru. Nangni'n aman kaboiya ningmu kha, aman kaboiya peru. <verse eid="MAT 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/>Nangni ningmarsa ah soonna, dangka, emakli sumsenpum iteii choimaru;<verse eid="MAT 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/>Ramma ningsipha, sialkok, songkol inliak, kekok emakli sinasik kherol inchoimaru. Ajarchu chuonmi khan angme inmanisik arei kaom kha inpesik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1 Cor 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Tim 5:18</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/>“Nangni'n khuopui emakli khuo inkhat ningluut ah ningheiwa pha, tuka-ang inkhat in nangni karok ah kanadon ngai entokru, halli khawa munkha ningmathaan maklaiseng amale omsuomru. <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/>Nangni'n innsuung ningluut phakhan, nangni chungnga kahoi kadai erase, tiru. <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/>Khawa inna kaom mi ngai'n nangni karok ah innadon inchu, ningmalung kadai donnachong kha omchak rase; takkha inmani'n karok ah innadon emak inchu, ningmalung daina donnachong kha nangni diang heikir rase.<verse eid="MAT 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/>Khat-um innsuung emakli khuopui lekkhat in nangni karok ah innadon emakli nangni innarangai emak inchu, khawa munkha mathaanru halli ning keiiya rahut kha kathing thaakru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Chuon 13:51</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/>Kei'n nangni diang inthiangnga karil khachu khawa khuopui mi ngai diang neek ah, Chongtan Nikhuo khan Pathian in Sodom li Gomorrah mi ngaidiang kakheel riangwai amalarsik eii!” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 11:24">Matt 11:24</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Inphut 19:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:4-12">Luk 10:4-12</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akahongsuok sik Poongraalna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mk 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luk 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>“Rangairu! kei'n nangni hi malang ngai karra keelngam khale in-angnga kinatir eii. Maruul angnga insingtheiru khat-um wathu angnga malungkadai eru.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 10:3">Luk 10:3</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/>Insingtheiru, ajarchu khawa khan nangni kanasursik tuka-ang inom khat-um chongtanna khan nangni innaruoisik eii, halli inmani'n nangni Synagogue ah inawuoksik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MRK 13:9-11">Mk 13:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11">Luk 12:11</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-15">21:12-15</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/>Halli kei kajarra ramwai karoon ngaile rengngai maikuungnga zaatlop ngaile inmani diang sakhi sik ah innaruoisik eii. <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/>Inmani'n nangni sakhi sik innakeisuo pha, angme katisik emakli angtho-thoa karilsik me tia ningmalung minpoong maru. <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/>Nangni rilsik chongramol ngaikha nangnita enuni; chongramol ngaikha nangni diangnga karil ning Pa ratha ah inphut hongkasuoksik eii.<verse eid="MAT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/>“Mi ngai'n inmani unai ngaitak kha thatna sik ah inpesuoksik eii, khat-um pa ngai innum khale in-angrip ah inmani sangai diang inthosik eii; halli sangai innum inmani nu le pa ngai chungnga hei-inlet inta inmani inminthatsik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MRK 13:12">Mk 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:16">Luk 21:16</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/>Kei jarra mi rakip in nangni innamatirsik eii. Takkha ahekna katung kadei ngaikha inringsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 24:9">Matt 24:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:13">Mk 13:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:17">Luk 21:17</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/>Khuopui inkhat ah inmani'n nangni innaminpoong pha, khuopui inkhat tiang taandelru. Kei'n inthiangnga nangni diang karil Miring Sapa juokir makma, nangni Israel khuopui rakip ah ningchuon leiminhek nutun.<verse eid="MAT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/>“Siamruoi inkhat in ama ochapa neek ah lokmak; suok inkhat in amapupa neek ah lokmak.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luk 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Jn 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/>Khawajarra siamruoi inkhat in ama ochapa hong angjei, khat-um suok inkhat in ama mapupa ahong ang jei inchu hunjei. Innsuung khurra alu kha Beelzebul tia inkoi inchu, innsuungkhur mi ngai khachu angtuk ah kase ah inkoisik me! <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Matt 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:24">12:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22">Mk 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:15">Luk 11:15</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tume chi sik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luk 12:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>“Ajarchu mi ngaikha chimaru. Ang e-innum tuunna inmakhu rakip la inkhununi, khat-um ruuk ah intho rakip inlajet wiaksik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MRK 4:26">Mk 4:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Luk 8:17</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/>Kei'n nangni diang aziingna ah angme kiril kha nangni'n suunwarra ningril kirsik eii, halli angme ruuk ah ningjet kha innchungnga ninglarilsuok sik eii. <verse eid="MAT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/>Taksa chu kathat mator takkha ratha kathat matormak ngaikha chimaru; khaneek ah, taksa li ratha innireella meikhurra kaminmang mator Pathian kha khella chiru. <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/>Dangkapum inkhat ah wacharek inni nangni'n ningracho mator, takkha wacharek inkhat-um neipilchungnga ning Pa lungdou eleiya juotamak. <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/>Nangni sik achu, ningluwa kaom ningsam ramol katung ateelsuo jei. <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/>Khawajarra chimaru; wacharek katamtak ngai neek ah nangni aman katam ning-eii!<verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Christa kazoot li kazootmak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8">Luk 12:8</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:9">9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>“Tu-ennum mipui maikuungnga kei kanaralaang kha kei innum ama kha marwaanna kaom Kapa maikuungnga karalaangsik eii.”<verse eid="MAT 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/>Takkha mi ngai maikuungnga kei kanazootmak kha, Kei innum marwaanna kaom Kapa maikuungnga zootpinuning. <char style="rq"><ref loc="2TI 2:12">2 Tim 2:12</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kadai sik emak, takkha Raalchem sik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luk 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26">14:26</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:27">27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>“Kei'n nuoipilchungnga kadai kapesik kijuo eii ti ngaidon maru. Emak, kei kadai heikachoi sik ah kijuo emak, takkha raalchem kape sik kijuo eii.”<verse eid="MAT 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/>Kei'n pa li asa ngai, nu li asanu ngai, halli tarpi li amoinu ngai kaminhal sik kijuo eii; <char style="rq"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mic 7:6</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/>Nangni inhalpui kasekhet khachu na-innsuung mi ngaikha in esik eii.<verse eid="MAT 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/>“Tuka-ang kei neek ah apa emakli anu kaminriang ngaikha kei siamruoisik rahoi suokmu; khat-um tuka-ang kei neek ah insapa emakli insanu kaminriang ngaikha kei siamruoi sik rahoi suokmu.<verse eid="MAT 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/>Tuka-ang in inmani cross kadom leiya kei kanajui ngaikha kei siamruoi sik rahoi suokmu. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 16:24">Matt 16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mk 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Luk 9:23</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/>Tuka-ang inringkhuo kaminriang ngaikhan khawakha inminmang sik eii; takkha tuka-ang inringkhuo kei sik ah kaminmang ngaikhan khawakha inmu sik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 16:25">Matt 16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mk 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luk 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jn 12:25</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Thoman ngai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mk 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/>“Tu-ennum nangni kanadon ngaikhan kei innadon eii; khat-um tu-ennum kei nakadon khan kei najuokatirpa kha idon eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 16:25">Matt 16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mk 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luk 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jn 12:25</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/>Ajarchu tuka-ang in Pathian chongkachoi inkhat kha ama Pathian chongkachoi eii tia akadon khan Pathian chongkachoipa tum kha aralaangsik eii; halli tuka-ang in mikadik inkhat kha ama hi mikadik inkhat eii tia akadon khan mikadikpa tum kha aralaangsik eii. <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/>Kei'n nangni diang inthiangnga kiril eii, tu-ennum hiwa ngai karra akasiin khet kasiamruoi inkhat kha tuidai rabing inkhat kape khan suoileiya ama tum amusik eii.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s1">John Baptist ah inphut Chongkachoi ngai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luk 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>Jisu'n ama siamruoi soomleini ngai hiwa minchuna ngai apesuo pha, khawa munkha amasuo ah Galilee khuopui ngaikhan kaminchusik li chongkarilsik aleisijei.<verse eid="MAT 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>John Baptist in mikhumna suungnga angme Christa itho ngai jarra ajet pha, Christa diang ama siamruoi ngai lekkhat ama'n aleitir. <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>Jisu diang inmani'n inrakel, “Keini diang narilpiro,” “John in alajuo sik eii itipa kha nang na-ebe, emakli tuka-ang khat kinlangaak sikbe?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>Jisu'n aleimasang, “Kirru halli angme ningmu khat-um ningjet ngaikha John diang rilpiru:<verse eid="MAT 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/>Mitkacho in amu, kekakiak in asithei, tuka-ang chikaom takbangri kana ngai aminthiang, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:5. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">minthiang: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">enru 8:2</char></note> kuorkaseet in ajet, akathi kha aminringnook, khat-um Chong Kahoi ngaikha sara ngaidiang aleirilpi. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 35:5">Isa 35:5</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 35:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">Isa 61:1</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/>Tuka-ang kei jarra inngamsamna kaneimak mi kha angtuk rawaan kathame!”<verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>John siamruoi ngai'n insisuo phakhan, Jisu'n John jarra mipui ngaidiang aleiril: “Nangni'n neelramma ningsi pha, angme nangni'n enkinte tia ningsi? Leihardoon thikaraang in iseemkun kha be? <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/>Emakli angme enkinte tia ningsi? Puondiar kathatak ah inliang mipa kha be? Khawa ka-ang inliang mi ngai khachu reng koolla in-om! <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/>Kei diang rilru, nangni ang musik tia ningsuok me? Pathian chongkachoi kha be? Oh inthiangtak ah, kei'n nangni diang kati, John kha Pathian chongkachoi inkhat neek ah akalok kha eii.<verse eid="MAT 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/>John amatak jarra eii chong inthiang in ileiti kha: Pathian in ati, kei'n kei chongkachoipa nang namatiang nangsik ah lam kamalong kajuotirsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/>Inthiangnga kei'n nangni diang kanarilpi, numeisa ngai'n innei karra John Baptist neek ah kalok tuteii la-injir mak, takkha marwaan rengramma kasiinkhet kha ama neek ah kalok kha eii.<verse eid="MAT 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/>John Baptist in achong aril pha makheiya inphut tuun katung marwaan rengram hi poongraalna nuoiya alaom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:12. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">poongraalna nuoiya; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli poongraalna khan alaheiwa</char></note> halli poongraalna kape mi ngai'n khawa kha surnasik inlatho. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 16:16">Luk 16:16</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/>Ajarchu John pha katung Pathian chongkachoi ngaile Moses Dan khan Rengram jarra inleiril;<verse eid="MAT 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/>John hi alakajuo sik Elijah kha eii tia inleiril inmani chong kha ningralaang zoot inchu, <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:10-13">Matt 17:10-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:11-13">Mk 9:11-13</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/>Rangairu, ningkuor indou inchu!”<verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>“Tuun, kei'n hiwa khang hi angleme kaminkhi sik? Inmani ngai khachu naipang phurjuorna munna in-ong ngai khale in-ang. Rupkhat ngaikhan aleiilak ngaidiang inkheek ah inti, <verse eid="MAT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/>‘Keini'n moiruoi khuong li dar nangni sik ah kinsut, takkha nangni'n laam makchu! keini'n kathi laa kinsak, takkha nangni'n chapmakchu!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/>Ajarchu John in bak inleiya aleijuo, halli inmani'n ‘Ama suungnga raikhuo om inti!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/>han miring Sapa ajuo ah bu bak halli tui in, han inmani'n inti enro olkalok ju ka-inpa, rampar kakhoom ngaili ‘Manu karoon ngai sap!’ takkha Pathian singna hi ama chuon khan adik tia amalar.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngamna kaneimak Khuopui</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luk 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Jisu'n ama chuon-inlak katam athona khuopuiya kaom mi ngai'n inmanu ah inphut malungthuul nunu, khawa jarra ama'n khawa khuopui ngaikha aleiran.<verse eid="MAT 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/>“Hiwahi nangni sik ah angtuk poong kaom sikme, Chorazin! nang sik um angtuk poong kaom sikme, Bethsaida, nang sik um angtuk poong kaomme! chuon inlak nangni chungnga kitho ngaikha Tyre li Sidon chungnga kaleitho inchu, matiang khan khanna kaom mi ngaikhan inmani manu ah inphut malung thuulna kapoong puondiar tho inta khat-um inmani chungnga rahut inlei innootsik ejei! <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Isa 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Ezek 26:1–28:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Jo 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9">Amo 1:9</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 1:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Zech 9:2-4</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/>Kei'n nangni diang inthiangnga karil khachu Chongtan Nikhuo khan Pathian in nangni neek ah Tyre li Sidon mi ngaidiang minriang kha amalarsik eii!<verse eid="MAT 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/>Khat-um Capernaum nang um marwaan katung natheinuo ah na-indom saang zootbe? Nang chu meikhurra innahiai sik eii! nangni diangnga intho chuon inlak ngaikha Sodom chungnga inleitho inchu, wini katung sodom laleiom sik eii! <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Isa 14:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Inphut 19:24-28</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/>Takkha kei'n nangni diang kati, khachu Chongtan Nikhuo khan Pathian in nangni diang neek ah Sodom ram sik ah kheella minriang amalarsik eii!” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:15">Matt 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:12">Luk 10:12</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kei diang hongru halli soong hongmachumru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21">Luk 10:21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 10:22">22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>Khawa phakhan Jisu'n ati, “Pa, marwaan li nuoipil Pumi! kei'n nang kanaminpaak ajarchu nang in angme kasing li kajet ngaidiang nathup kha kasiin naipang ngaidiang namalarjei.” <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/>Oh, Pa, hiwahi nalungdou kha eii.<verse eid="MAT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/>“Kapa'n angrakip kei diang anapesuojei. Pa khan eleiya tu inkhat innum Sapa kha jetmu, khat-um Sapa khan eleiya tu inkhat innum Pa kha jetmu halli Sapa in ikadang ngaikha ama diang amalar.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Jn 3:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:18">Jn 1:18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10:15</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>“Phurrik karoonna kapoong nangni rakip kei diang hongru, halli kei'n nangni soong kanamachum sik eii.<verse eid="MAT 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/>Kanamkol lei-inlang roonru, kei diang inphut inchuru, ajarchu keichu kamalung adai khat-um kanunchan inchuol; halli nangni'n ning ratha sik ah soongmachumna muningte. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JER 6:16">Jer 6:16</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/>Ajarchu kanamkol roon abei khat-um kaphur zaang.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Sernikhuo jarra Chongrakelna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mk 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>Khawasuo sootlekleiya Jisu'n Sernikhuo inkhat ah gehubil asamma aleisi. Ama siamruoi ngaikha inwon aleichampi, khawa jarra inmani'n gehu wuui inchinna khat-um gehuru kha kabak inleiphut jei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Innidan 23:25</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Hiwahi pharisee ngai'n inmupha, inmani'n Jisu diang inleiti, “Enru, Hiwa Sernikhuo ni nasiamruoi ngai'n thomak sik eini sina Dan izootmak kha intho!”<verse eid="MAT 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/>Jisu'n aleimasang, “David inruoipui ngaile ama awon achampha angme inleitho nangni lateel ngaimak chube? <char style="rq"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam 21:1-6</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/>Ama'n Pathian inna aluut ah, thiampu ngai bit bak kacha inmani bak sik chu Dan izootmak, Pathian diangnga inpe waipool kha, ama khat-um ama inruoipui ngai'n inleibak. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Levi 24:9</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/>Kha emakli Jihudi ngai sernikhuo rakip thiampu ngai'n Biak-inn suungnga Jehudi ngai sernikhuo Dan inmakoi innum inmani masialna ommak ti Moses Dan kha nangni lateel ngaimak chube? <char style="rq"><ref loc="NUM 28:9">Teelna 28:9</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 28:10">10</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/>Biak-inn neek ah akalok angmekhat hin om tihi kei'n nangni diang kanarilpi eii.<verse eid="MAT 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/>Chong inthiang in ati, ‘Kei imanuom khachu riangwai kha eii, sa ah doiphur inpe kha emak.’ Nangni'n hiwahi inthiangnga angtiname ningleijet inchu, thosialna kaneimak mi ngaidiang nangni'n noonkuung ninglei pemak sik eii; <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 9:13">Matt 9:13</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos 6:6</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/>Ajarchu miring Sapa hi Sernikhuo Pumi kha eii.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kut Kathi Miring Inkhat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mk 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>Khawa mun amathaanna Jisu Synagogue inkhat ah aleisi, <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>Khawa munkhan akut kathi miring inkhat aleiom. Halli Jisu ithosial noonkuung pesik kamanuom mi lekkhat kha khan inlei-om, “Sernikhuo ni mi mindam sik hi eini sina Dan izootbe?” tia inmani'n ama diang inleirakel.<verse eid="MAT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/>Jisu'n aleimasang, “Nangni karra inkhat in keelngam inkhat anei halli khawa kha inthuuk khur inkhat ah Sernikhuo ni ata inle ama'n mahuum li keisuo makniya be? <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 14:5">Luk 14:5</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/>Miring inkhat in keelngam inkhat neek ah aman atamwiai! khawa jarra, Sernikhuo ni chuon katha thosik hi Dan izoot kha eii.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>Halli ama'n kut kathi mipa diang ati, “Nakut heisoonro.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:13">Ama'n akut aheisoon, halli kaangkhat tiangle in-angrip ah, akut kha adamjei. <verse eid="MAT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>Halli Pharisee ngai'n insuok ah khat-um Jisu thatnasik ah ininsiam jei.<verse eid="MAT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pathian in Ikadang Suok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>Jisu'n ama chungnga thatnasik ininsiam kha ajetpha, khawa mun makheiya aleisijei; khat-um mi katamtak in ama inleijui. Ama'n akana rakip aleimindam <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>halli inmani diang ama jarra aleiilak ngai diang rilpi maknasik ah chong kanatak aleipeii. <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>Hiwa ama'n athona jarchu Pathian chongkachoipa Isaiah diangnga Pathian in angme ileiti kha huui tungnasik eii:<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>“Enru, kei'n kikadang jei, kasuok,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">kiminriangpa kha, achungnga kamalung atai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Kei'n ama chungnga karatha kajuotirsik eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">halli ama'n zaat rakip diang kachongtanna kha arilsuoksik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 42:1-4">Isa 42:1-4</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>Ama'n murruolsiak thonuni emakli kheeknuni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">halli tu inkhat innum lampui ngaikhan arasa jetnunu.<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>Matorna chongtan katuun aminsi maklaiseng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">ama'n tuoitung kakui inkhat minkiak nuni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">thisikkatho meiser kha thatnuni.<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>halli ama chungnga mi rakip in ngamna indasik eii.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu le Beelzebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mk 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Miring lekkhat in Jisu diang raikhuo kaluut mitkacho khat-um chongkaril theimak miring inkhat inhongruoi. Jisu'n mipa kha aleimindam, khawa jarra ama'n chong rilthei jei halli amujei. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Mipui rakip in Jisu ithohi angme tia inleingak, “Amahi David Sapa emak be?” tia inmani'n inleirakel.<verse eid="MAT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>Pharisee ngai'n hiwahi inleijet pha, inmani'n inleimasang, “Ama'n raikhuo ngai ipuut suok hi inmani lamkakei Beelzebul in ama diang ranak ape jarra eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Matt 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>Jisu'n angme inmani ngaidon kha aleijet, halli inmani diang ama'n aleiril, “Rengram rakip in intheinuo ah rup inthenkhoiya inkhat li inkhat ininsuol inchu kasoot ah ngirmatornunu. Halli khuopui inkhattak emakli innsuungkhur inkhat li inkhat ininsuolla rup inthenkhoi inchu lekni ah chulsik eii.” <verse eid="MAT 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/>Ajarchu Seitan in Seitan kha apuutsuok inchu ama amatak chungnga inthenkhoi jei, kha ejei inle ama rengram kha langir matorniabe? <verse eid="MAT 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/>Kei'n Beelzebul ranak ah raikhuo ngai kapuut suok inle ningnuk kajui ngai'n tu ranak ah inmani inpuut suok me? khawa jarra inmani'n nangni chongkatan ngaikha in esik ejei! <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/>Takkha kei'n Pathian ratha ah raikhuo ngai hi kapuut suok jei inchu Pathian Rengram kha nangni chungnga ajuokatung ejei.<verse eid="MAT 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/>“Emakli akaraat mipa kha ma-insa ah khit leiya tume mi karaatpa inn kha makoi li ama phurpai ngai kalei matorsik? Inkhit suoli bit ama inna kaom phurngai kha amaruup matorsik eii.”<verse eid="MAT 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/>Tu e-innum kei le inruoimak ama kha kei na-inhalpui eii; halli tu e-innum kei le inruoiya nakakhompui mak ama kha inthiangnga akakalekchen kha eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mk 9:40</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 12:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/>Hiwajarra kei'n nangni diang kiril eii, miring ngai manu rakip le inmani'n inril akathamak rakip kha inngaidam pisik eii, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:31. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Inmani'n inril akathamak; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli Inmani'n Pathian chungnga inril akathamak</char></note> takkha tu e-innum Ratha Inthiang kha kase ah karil kha rangaidam nuni.<verse eid="MAT 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/>Halli Miring Sapa chungnga karilse tuka-ang ama kha arangaidam sik eii, takkha Ratha Inthiang chungnga akaril tuka-ang ama khachu tuun emakli apha rakip ah rangaidam omnuni jei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luk 12:10</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Thingkuung khat-um Akara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>“Thingkuung kha mintharu halli akara kha atha sik eii; emakli thingkuung kha minthamaru halli ama kara kha thanuni, ajarchu thingkuung khachu ama kara khanna nijet eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 7:20">Matt 7:20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:44">Luk 6:44</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/>E, maruul tusuon ngai, nangni'n kathachu emak chu ah angtho-thoa akatha chong ningril sikme? Ajarchu angme ningmalungnga kasip ngaikha murra ningrilsuok. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 3:7">Matt 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Luk 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:18">Matt 15:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:45">Luk 6:45</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/>Mikatha mi'n akatha phur kha akarei makheiya akatha phur aheikeisuo, khat-um akathamak mi in akathamak phur kha akarei makheiya akathamak phur ngai aheikeisuo.<verse eid="MAT 12:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/>“Kei'n nangni diang karil, mi ngai'n inleiril chongriam rakip ngai Chongtan Nikhuo khan ajar kha inlape sik eii. <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/>Ajarchu nang hi akadik emakli kadikmak eii ti malar nasik nachongril ngaikha neiman inta nang kha chong innatanna sik eii.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Chuon-inlak thonasik Nina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mk 8:11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 8:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>Halli Dan ocha lekkhat li Pharisee lekkhat ngai'n inti, “Ocha,” “keini'n nang diangnga chuon-inlak inkhat nitho kinmuzoot.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/>“Khawakhan Jisu'n aleimasang, kathamak li zool-inthai tuunna khang mi ngai'n chuon-inlak kha innarakel, takkha Pathian chongkachoi Jonah diangnga inpe chuon-inlak kha elekleiya chuon inlak inkhat-um khawa khan napenuni jei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 16:4">Matt 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mk 8:12</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/>Jonah apumtak nga kalok suungnga suunthum le zaanthum alei-om khale in-angrip ah, Miring Sapa kha nuoipil suungnga suunthum zaanthum alaomsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JON 1:17">Jona 1:17</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/>Nineveh mi ngai'n Chongtan Nikhuoni hongngir inta halli nangni kha noonkuung innape sik eii, ajarchu Jonah chongril kha inmani'n injet pha inmanuwa inphut inmalung inleithuul; kei'n nangni diang kiti khachu enru Jonah neek ah kalok inkhat hin aom.<verse eid="MAT 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/>Chongtan Nikhuoni khan Sheba Rengnu in hongngirta halli nangni kha noonkuung innapesik eii, ajarchu aram makheiya Reng Solomon singna iminchu kha akarangai sik aleihong; takkha enro, kei'n nangni diang kati, Solomon neek ah kalok inkhat kha hin aom! <char style="rq"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1 Reng 10:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Khang 9:1-12</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ratha Kathamak heiluutkirna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>“Miring inkhat suungnga ratha kathamak inkhat aheisuok pha, ama'n tui ommakna ramma aleisiya soongmachum nasik mun inkhat aleiratok, takkha leimumak. <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/>Ama'n atheinuo ah inti, ‘Kei ka inna kei kirtak te.’ Halli ama akirra inn karuok, inthiang khat-um katha ah inda kha ajuomu. <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/>Khawa phakhan ama asuok ah amaneek ah akathamak ratha sari aheiruoi, halli khawa khan inmani inhongnga in-om jei. Khawa jarra miringpa ringkhuo kha matiangnga omchan neek ah ahekna kha kheella thamakjei. Hiwahi eii tuunna khang mi kathamak ngai diang alakasuok sik.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Nu li Anai ngai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mk 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>Jisu'n mipui ngaidiang chongril laitak khan, enru, anu le anai ngai'n ama in-inbiakpui zoot ah inmani'n tuolla inleingir. <verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>Khawa jarra mi inkhat in ama diang aleiti, “Enro, nanu li nanai ngai'n nang inna-inbiakpui zoot ah inmani'n tuolla inngirra inom.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:47. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscript lekkhat achu hiwa chonglam 47 hi ommak</char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Jisu'n ama diang aleimasang, “Tume kei kanu? Tu ngaime kei kanai ngai?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>Halli akut akhiinna asiamruoi ngaidiang aleiti, “Enru! Hinna kaom ngai hi kanu le kanai ngaikha in eii! <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/>Ajarchu marwaanna kaom Kapa lungdou katho ngaikha kanai, kasar khat-um kanu in eii.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Muchi Kaworpa Chongminkhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mk 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Khawa nikhuo takkhan Jisu'n inn kha amathaanna asuok ah tuidiil khamtiang aleisi, khawakhan ama'n kaminchu sik ah alei in-ong.<verse eid="MAT 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/>Mipui katamtak ama koolla inlei inchun khawa jarra ama'n rakuong inkhat suungnga aluut ah alei in-ong, halli mipui katamtak in tuikham khan inleingir. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luk 5:1-3</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>Khawa khan Jisu'n chongminkhina aneiya chong angjet inmani diang aleirilpi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">“Enru, leikaneipa kha amuchi kawor sik aheisuok jei. <verse eid="MAT 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/>Ama'n leiya muchiru aheiwor pha, lekkhat in lamsirra achul, halli wa ngai inheiwa ah inruut li inbak. <verse eid="MAT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/>Aru lekkhat in lung chungnga neipil toomna mun ngaikhan achul, neipil inthuukmak jarra aru kha innottheiya ahongkek. <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/>Takkha kani hongsa phakhan achiak teii ngaikha inwuoi jei; ajarchu arajung kha inthuuk ah leisimak, khale inruoiya achiak ngaikha innot ah acharjei. <verse eid="MAT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/>Aru lekkhat in raling karra achul, ahongmoong takkha achiak kha raling in amakhujei. <verse eid="MAT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/>Aru lekkhat in neipil hoina khan achul, halli lekkhat in rajakhat, lekkhat in soomruk, khat-um lekkhat in soomthum ahong inra.”<verse eid="MAT 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/>Halli Jisu'n ahekna ah ati, “Akuor indou ama khan rangai rase!”<verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Chongminkhina Ajar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mk 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9">Luk 8:9</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:10">10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Khawasuo khan siamruoi ngai'n Jisu diang inhongnga inleirakel. “Angsikme nang in mipui ngaidiang chongnaril pha chongminkhina nineiman?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>Halli Jisu'n aleimasang, “Marwaan Rengram jarra inthup ngai jetnasik nangni diang innapejei, takkha inmani diang chu emak.”<verse eid="MAT 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/>Ajarchu mi kaneipa diang khan kheella inpedel sik eii; takkha iteii akaneimak mipa ama diangnga inphut inei lekteii kha um inkhaidel sik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 25:29">Matt 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mk 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luk 8:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">19:26</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/>Kei'n chongminkhina kaneimanna inmani diang karilna ajarchu inmani'n in-en, takkha mumu, inrangai, takkha jetmu emakli ngaidon matormu.<verse eid="MAT 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/>Halli Isaiah chongril kha inmani diang pui ahongtung jei:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">Hiwa mi ngai'n rangai chu rangai inte, takkha jetnunu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">inmani'n enchu en inte, takkha mununu, <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isa 6:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 6:10">10</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/>ajarchu inmani malungnga jetzootmu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">inmani inkuor khan rangai zootmu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">halli inmit kha inkasiingdel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Kha emak inchu, inmani inmit in inmusik eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">inkuor khan inrangai sik eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">inmalung khan injetsik eii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Pathian in ati, inmani kei diang inhong inletsik eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">halli kei'n inmani kamindam sik eii.<verse eid="MAT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>“Nangni sik ah chu, angtuk ningrawaan kathame! Ning mit in amu halli ning kuor in ajet. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 10:23">Luk 10:23</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 10:24">24</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/>Nangni diang inthiangnga kei'n karil khachu Pathian chongkachoi ngai li mi katuun ngai'n angme nangni imu kha inleimu zoot, takkha leimu matormu, halli angme nangni ijet ngaikha leijet matormu.<verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Muchi Kaworpa Chongminkhi kha rilcheen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mk 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>“Hanchu, muchi kaworpa chongminkhi in angme iti kha rangairu halli inchuru. <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/>Tu ennum Rengram jarra chong kha ajetli akangaidon tungmak ngai kha hiwa lamkoolla kachul muchiru khale in ang. Akathamak kha aheiwa ah inmani malung suungnga inwor muchi kha aleikhaipi. <verse eid="MAT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/>Lungkarra kachul muchi khachu tuka-ang in chong kha injetli innot ah karok ah kakeiluut ngaikha tina eii. <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/>Takkha inmani diang arajung kha inthuukmak jarra soot leidei matormu, Khawa chong jarra poongna emakli raalna aheiwa pha khan, inmani innot ah inmangjei. <verse eid="MAT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/>Halli raling karra kachul muchiru ngaikhan tuka-ang chong kha kajet; takkha hiwa ringkhuo jarra poongna le neile nung manuomna ngaikhan chong kha adiip ah, inmani kakara mak ngaikha atina eii. <verse eid="MAT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/>Halli neipil hoina munna inwor muchiru ngaikhan tuka-ang chong kha rangai li kajet: lekkhat in rajakhat, lekkhat in soomruk, halli lekkhat in soomthum kakara ngai tina eii.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Leiharra Chongminkhina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>Jisu'n chongminkhi inkhat arilla aleiti: “Marwaan Rengram khachu miring inkhat in muchiru katha kha aleiya iwor khale in-ang. <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/>Halli zaankhat, mi rakip inzaal pha, ama inhalpuipa kha aheiwa ah halli gehu karkhan leiharru aworra aleisijei. <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/>Achiak ngaikha ahonglok halli abuo ahongsuok pha khanchu leihar ngai kha um indangjei. <verse eid="MAT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/>Mipa suok ngaikhan ama diang inheiwa ah inti, ‘Ocha, nang in naleiya muchiru katha niwor emak abe? honname hiwa leihar ngai kaheiwa hi?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/>‘Hichu naka enzootmak lekkhat itho eii,’ tia ama'n aleimasang. ‘Asuok ngaikhan amadiang inrakel, keini kinsili leihar ngai kinjuochuon sik hi namanuom be?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/>Ama'n aleimasang, ‘Chuonmaru,’ ‘ajarchu nangni'n leihar ningchuon kaalkhan gehu lekkhat um inphoidel acha. <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/>Gehu le leihar kha inniya inrakhool maklaiseng moongsuom tarasu. Kei'n leikarakhool ngai diangkhan tipitakte ma-insa ah leihar kha khoomchun inlang haal sik ah khitchunru, halli gehu kha khomchun inlang kei sapang khan juothunru.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Anchamru ah Chongminkhina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mk 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18">Luk 13:18</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>Jisu'n inmani diang chongminkhina khat apenook ah ati: “Marwaan Rengram khachu miring inkhat in anchamru kha aleili ama leiya iwor hile in-ang. <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/>Hiwahi muchiru rakip karra akasiin khet kha eii, takkha ahongmoong pha khanchu, thingchiak ngai karra akalok khet thingkuung ahong eii. Khawajarra lairalak ah wa ngai'n inheiwali abaak ngaikhan inrabu inhong phan.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Cholla Chongminkhina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20">Luk 13:20</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:21">21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>Jisu'n inmani diang chongminkhina inkhat arilnook ah ati: “Marwaan Rengram khachu, numeisa inkhat in chol lekkhat aleiya waipooldi saida inthum khan minchella chol hongthei maklaiseng ida khale in-ang.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Chongminkhina ngai Neiman</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33">Mk 4:33</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 4:34">34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>Jisu'n hiwa rakip ngaihi chongminkhina kha aneimanna mipui diang aleiril; ama'n chongminkhina neiman lekleiya iteii um inmani diang leirilmak. <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/>Ama'n hiwa itho ngaihi Pathian chongkachoipa ileiril kha huui tungnasik eii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">“Chongminkhina neimankata kei'n inmani diang chong karilsik eii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">Nuoipilchung inbool makheiya inthup rakip ngaikha inmani diang kei'n karilsuok sik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Minpkla 78:2</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Leihar ru ah Chongminkhina Irilcheen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>Jisu'n mipui ngai ada ah inn suungtiang aluut pha, ama siamruoi ngai inheiwa ah ama diang injuoti, “Leihar ruwa chongminkhina hin angme tina keini diang narilpiro.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>Jisu'n aleimasang, “Muchiru katha kaworpa kha Miring Sapa kha eii; <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/>lei khan nuoipilchung hi eii; muchiru katha ngaikhan Rengram mi ngaikha in eii; leihar ngaikhan Akathamakpa sangai kha in eii; <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/>Halli inhalpui leiharru kaworpa ama khan Seitan kha eii. Saangrakhool pha khan nuoipilchung hekni kha eii, halli saangkarakhool ngaikhan marwaan tirton ngaikha in eii. <verse eid="MAT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/>Leihar ngaikha inkhoomchunna meiya inhaalle in angrip ah, nuoipilchung hekni khannum hi angnga alasuoksik eii: <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/>Miring Sapa in ama marwaan tirton ngaikha juotirta mi ngai manu ah kamachul ngaile thomaksik katho ngai rakip ama Rengram makheiya alaminchunsik eii, <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/>halli inmani kha meisuungnga indeengluutsik eii, khawamun khan inmani chap le hakarialna inlanei sik eii. <verse eid="MAT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/>Pa Rengram khan Pathian mi ngai'n kani angnga inlawar sik eii. akuor indou ama khan rangai rase!<verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Inthup Amankatam Neinaak Chongminkhina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>“Marwaan Rengram hi, Miring inkhat in leiya inphuumma kaom amankatam neinaak inmu khale in-ang. Ama'n amakhudella karok ah asiya ineirakip ajuorra, halli akirra lei kha ajuo incho jei.<verse eid="MAT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lungman katamma Chongminkhina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>“Halli Marwaan Rengram hi, Mi inkhat in lungman katamkhet iratok khale in-ang, <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/>ama'n lungmankatam amu pha, ama asiya, inei rakip kha ajuorra halli khawa lungman katam kha ajuo incho jei.<verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Leenna Chongminkhina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>“Woikhat um, marwaan Rengram hi, ngaphung rakip kasur ngakasurmi lekkhat in tuidiil suungnga inmani leen inwor khale in-ang. <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/>Leen kha asip pha, inmani'n tuikham tiang inkeisuo ah halli in-in ongnga nga katha seng kha paisuungnga inthun halli kathamak sengkha inkalekjuon jei. <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/>Nuoipilchung hekni um hiwa laka ang sik eii: marwaan tirton ngaikhan lajuo inta mi katha ngai diangnga inphut mi kathamak ngai kha lathen inta <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/>halli inmani ngaikha meisuungnga inlahiailuut sik eii, khawa munkhan inmani chap le hakarialna inneisik eii.<verse eid="MAT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akathar li Amaruo neinaak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>“Hiwa rakip hi nangni ningjet jeibo?” tia Jisu'n inmani diang aleirakel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">“Kinjetjei” tia inleimasang.<verse eid="MAT 13:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>Halli khan ama'n aleimasang, “Hiwa tinachu, marwaan Rengramma siamruoi ka eii Sinadan ocha rakip ngai'n ama neinaak bukna makheiya inphut phur kathar li maruo heikakeisuo inn-pupa khale in-ang.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nazareth ah Jisu Inzootmak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mk 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>Jisu'n hiwa chongminkhina arilsuo pha, ama'n khawa munkha aleimathaan jei <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>halli ama'n akhuo tiang akirnook jei. Inmani Synagogue khan aleiminchu, halli ama minchuna kajet rakip in inleingak ah inti, “Huwa makheiya ama'n hinnakati singwar imume?” Inmani'n inleirakel. “Halli chuon inlak ngai hile imume? <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>Amahi thingchuon kathopa sapa emak abe? Anu Mary, James, Joseph, Simon khat-um Judas anai ngai emuwabe? <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>Asar ngai rakip um einile hin niomsuom emak abe? Hunname hiwa rakip ama'n imu hi?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/>Khan intia inmani'n ama kha leizootmu jei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Halli Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Pathian chongkachoi inkhat hi amun rakip ah khoya intho takkha akhuo li a innsuungkhur mi ngai inchu khoya thomu.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Jn 4:44</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 13:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>Ajarchu inmani'n leingamnamu jarra, khawakhan ama'n chuon-inlak kha katamma leithomak.<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s1">John Baptist Thina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mk 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>Khawapha takkhan Galilee ramkaroonpa Herod in Jisu jarra aleijet. <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>“Ama hi inthiangnga John Baptist, athiya inphut akaringnook eii tia asuok ngaidiang aleirilpi. Khawa jarra ama'n hinna kati chuon-inlak thomatorna ranak inei eii.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>Ajarchu Herod in anaipa Philip numei Herodias jarra John hi asurra, halli akhit ah mikhumna khan aleida. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 3:19">Luk 3:19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:20">20</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/>Ajarchu John in Herod diang aleiti, “Herodias naneisik hi nangsik ah dan katuun kha emak!” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 18:16">Levi 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:21">20:21</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>John kha Herod in aleithat zoot, takkha ama'n Jihudi mipui ngai kha aleichi, ajarchu inmani'n John hi Pathian chongkachoi inkhat eii tia inleilei.<verse eid="MAT 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Herod inneina nikhuo khan Herodias sanu in mipui rakip maikuungnga aleilaam. khawa jarra Herod in amalung atai heiya <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>kei'n khomaak ka-insaam khachu, nang in napero nititak kha “Kei'n kanape sik eii tia, ama diang chong alei inkhit!”<verse eid="MAT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>Ama'n anu chongrilpi dungjuiya Herod diang aleini, “Hiwahin tuun kei diang John Baptist lukha bukheeng chungnga da-inlang napero!”<verse eid="MAT 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>Reng Herod kha amalung aleipoong, takkha ama'n ama mi ngai maikuungnga achong-inkhitna dungjuiya ama imanuom kha thopinasik ah chong aleipeii. <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>Khawa jarra ama'n mikhumna ah kaom John lu kha ajomintan. <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>Khawa lu kha bukheeng chungnga inheichoiya nungaaknu diang inleipeii halli ama'n anu diang aleichoi jei. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>John siamruoi ngai kha inheiwa ah, akaluong kha inleichoiya inleiphuum; halli inmani inkirra Jisu diang inleirilpi jei.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Mi Lising Ranga Iwai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Jn 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>Jisu'n John jarra chong ngai ajet pha, ama'n rakuong achuongnga khawa munkha amathaanna halli atheinuo ah mirasa neimakna muntiang aleisi. Khawa kha mipui'n inleijet, halli inmani'n inkhuopui inmathaanna kelamma anuk inleijui. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Jisu'n rakuongnga inphut ajuochum, halli mipui katamtak ngaikha ajomu pha, ama malung suungnga minriang khan aleisip, khawa jarra kana ngaikha aleimindam.<verse eid="MAT 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Khawani kholeitiang ama siamruoi ngai'n inheiwa ah inti, “Tuunchu khuo aboijei, halli hiwa munhi um mi ommakna ram eii, mi ngai hi minsi suotaro halli inmani'n inkhuo ngaikhan sisu-inlang inmani sik bak-in jo-incho tarasu.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>Jisu'n aleimasang. “Inmani simarasu,” “Inmani diang nangni'n baksik lekkhat kha peru!”<verse eid="MAT 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>Inmani'n inleimasang, “Keini'n waipool ranga li nga inni kinnei.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>Jisu'n ati, “Khawa kha e-inchu hin keidiang heichoiru.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>Ama'n mipui ngaikha leihar chungnga in-ong nasik chong aleipeii; halli ama'n waipool ranga le nga inni kha aleiya, marwaan tiang enna halli Pathian diang aleiminpaak, Ama'n waipool kha katherkhoiya asiamruoi ngaidiang aleipeii, halli asiamruoi ngai'n mipui ngaidiang inleisempi. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Akabak rakip ngaikha inleikhop, halli akaliam ngaikha siamruoi ngai'n inkhomchunna kokwar soomleini aleisip. <verse eid="MAT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Khawa aleikabak mi ngaikha numeisa naipang teelleiya, pasal seng lising ranga inlei eii.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Tuichungnga Isi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mk 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Jn 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Khawasuo ama'n mipui ngaikha aminsi pha Jisu'n asiamruoi ngai kha um rakuong minchuongnga tuidiil raalkhat tiang ama matiang aleiminsi jei. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>Mipui ngaikha atir suoli, ama'n nina sik atheinuo ah chingtiang aleikal. Kholei hongtung pha, khawa munkhan Jisu atheinuo ah aleiom; <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>tuikham makheiya rakuong khan tuidiil lai aheitung pha thipuile inintongnga, rakuong kha tuiphuuksan in aseemma leisi matormak jei.<verse eid="MAT 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>Ziingtiang phadan inthum li kuruk pheiwei khan, Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang tuichungnga aheiwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>Inmani'n tuichungnga ama iheiwa kha inleimuwa inmani'n inleichi. “Hiwa hi ratha kathamak eii!” intia chile inruoiya inmani'n inleikheek.<verse eid="MAT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Jisu'n inmani diang khawalai takkhan aleiti, “Malung mindong maru!” “Chimaru Kei ka eii!”<verse eid="MAT 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>Halli Peter in aleimasang, “Pumi, inthiangnga nang na-e inchu, nakoolla kei'n tuichungnga heiwa nasik chong napepiro.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>“Heiwaro” Jisu'n aleimasang. Khawa jarra Peter in rakuong makheiya achumma Jisu diang tuichungnga kasi aphut jei. <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>Takkha ama'n thipui kangar kha amu pha, ama'n aleichi halli tui suungtiang kaluut phutjei. “Pumi, Nasanro!” tia aleikheek.<verse eid="MAT 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>Khawalai takkhan Jisu'n akut sonna ama mahuumma ati, “E inngamna kasiin! angsikme ni-inngamsam?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>Inmani inin-niya rakuong khan inluutli, thikaraang kha ajuodai jei. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Halli rakuong suungnga kaom siamruoi ngai'n Jisu kha chubei inleitho. “Inthiangnga nangchu Pathian Sapa na eii!” tia inmani'n inti.<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gennesaret ah Jisu'n Akana Imindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mk 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>Inmani'n tuidiil kha inrakanna Gennesaret ram khan inheiwa jei, <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>khawa munna kaom mipui ngai'n Jisu kha inleijet, khawa jarra inmani'n chong inpeya khawa ramkoolla kaom akana mi rakip Jisu diang inmani'n inhong ruoi. <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>Inmani'n Jisu diang apuon morbit katook nasik ah nina inleinei; halli akakatook rakip ngaikha inleidam jei.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Upa ngai leisina Jarra Minchuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mk 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Halli Jerusalem makheiya Pharisee lekkhat le sina Dan ocha ngai'n Jisu diang inhongnga inhongrakel, <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>“Angsikme nasiamruoi ngai'n upa ngai sinadan kha inmakoi? Inmani'n inbak maklai inkut kha rasumu!”<verse eid="MAT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>Jisu'n aleimasang, “Hanchu angtiyame nangni'n Pathian chongpeii juimakchuwa nangni ngai sinadan kha ning ijui?<verse eid="MAT 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/>Ajarchu Pathian in aleiti, ‘Nanu li napa kha khoya thoro,’ halli ‘Nang in nanu li napa diang khomaak nasaam inchu, nang kha innathat sik eii.’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Suok 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Innidan 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 21:17">Suok 21:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Levi 20:9</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/>Takkha nangni'n ningti, khachu mi inkhat in anu emakli apa diang santhei lekkhat inei kha, ‘Hiwahi Pathianta ejei ti-inchu,’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/>ama'n anu emakli apa kaya sik hi arei suokmak. Nangni minchuna kha juinasik ah hiwa lam tiang nangni'n Pathian chongpe kha kaya makchu jei. <verse eid="MAT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/>Nangni akatha omchan kathongai! Angtuk katuunme nangni jarra Pathian chongkachoipa Isaiah ileirilsuok kha!<verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>‘Pathian in ati, hiwa mi ngai'n, kei hi inmur beiya khoya innatho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">takkha inmalung chu kei diangnga inphut kalaak ah in-om. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Isa 29:13</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>Kei chubei innathohi inmani sik anemna ommak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">ajarchu inmani'n miring sinadan ngaikha Kei sinadan ngai angnga inminchu!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Miring inkhat Kaminchok Phurngai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mk 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>Halli Jisu'n mipui ngai kha akoiya inmani diang ati, “Rangairu halli jetru! <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/>Ning bai suungnga kaluut khan nangni naminchok mak; khawa neek ah ahong kasuok khan nangni anaminchok.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Halli siamruoi ngai'n ama diang inheiwa ah inti, “Nang in tuuntak angme niril khan Pharisee ngai malung namintookpi nang nijetmak be?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>Jisu'n aleimasang, “Marwaanna kaom kapa ilingmak thingkuung rakip inlaphuk sik eii.<verse eid="MAT 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/>Inmani sik ngaidon pimaru! Inmani chu mitkacho ngai lamkakei mitkacho kha in eii; mitkacho inkhat in mitkacho kha lam akei inchu inin nireella khurra inta sik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 6:39">Luk 6:39</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>Peter in Jisu diang aleiti, “Hiwa chongminkhina hi keini diang narilcheen piro.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Nangni tuun katung aleiilak ngai neek ah lajetmak chu. <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/>Nangni ningmurra kaluut phurrakip kha ningwon suungnga aluut halli ningpum makheiya asuok tihi nangni ninglajetmak be?<verse eid="MAT 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/>Takkha murra hongkasuok kha malungnga inphut eii, halli hiwa ngaihin nangni anaminchok. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Matt 12:34</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/>Ajarchu ningmalungnga inphut ah akathamak ngaidonna, mithatna, zool-inthaina, halli aleiilak thamakna katho; inrupmaret, maleisei halli aleiilak karilse ngaihi hongkasuok eii. <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/>Hiwa ngai rakip in nangni naminthiangmak. Takkha inmani iti angnga kut rasuleiya inbak in nangni naminchok mak.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Numeisanu Inngamna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mk 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>Khawa munkha Jisu'n aleimathaanna Tyre li Sidon ram koolla aleisi. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Khawa ramma kaom Canaan numeisa inkhat ama diang hongnga, halli akheek ah ati, “David Sapa!” “Kei naminriangro, ocha! Kei kasanu kha raikhuo aluut ah poongtheiya omjei.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Takkha Jisu'n chongbai inkhat um ama diang leimasang mak. Asiamruoi ngai'n amakoolla inheiwa ah inti, “Ama minsitaro! Ama'n eini nuk anajuiya akheek ah om!”<verse eid="MAT 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>Jisu'n aleimasang, “Israel keelngam inmang ngai sikbit ah kei innajuo tir eii.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>Halli numeisa inkhat aheiwa ah akekuungnga inbok li, “Ocha, kei nasanro!” ati.<verse eid="MAT 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>Jisu'n amasang, “Naipang ngai bu an kha leili ui ngai diang pesik hi akatuun emak.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>“Atuun khawa kha, ocha,” numeisanu khan aleimasang, “Takkha ui innum inmapupa bubakna makheiya juokata buramol ngai kha inbak.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Khawajarra Jisu'n amadiang aleimasang, “Nangchu ngamna kalok numeisa na-eii! angme nimanuom kha nang sik ah inthorase.” Halli khawa phatak khan asanu kha adamjei.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mikatam tak Jisu'n Imindam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>Jisu'n khawamun amathaanna Galilee tuidiil tiang aleisi halli chingtiang akalla alei in-ong. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Mipui katamtak amadiang inleihong, kekakiak, mitkacho, ka-inkhooi, chongkasuokmak halli akana mi lekkhat, Jisu kekuungnga inhongruoi; halli inmani ngai kha ama'n aleimindam. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Khawa khan chongkasuokmak ngai'n chong inril, akeii inkhooi ngai'n indam, kasi theimak ngai'n insi khat-um mitkacho ngai'n inmu hi mipui'n inmu pha; Israel Pathian kha inminpaak.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mi Lising Mili Iwai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mk 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Jisu'n asiamruoi ngai akoolla akoiya aleiti, “Kei'n hiwa mipui ngaihi kaminriang, ajarchu inmani keile inruoiya nithum kinhong omjei tuunchu inmani bak sik inkhat-um neimujei. Kei'n inmani ngai hi bak-inleiya minsizoot mong, ajarchu inmani'n inntiang insipha phai-inwai inte.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>Siamruoi ngaikhan ama diang inheiti, “Hunmo hiwa neelram hin hiwa mipui ngai sik kahun bu le an joleimin?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>“Waipool angjet nangni ningnei me?” Jisu'n aleirakel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">“Waipool sari,” “le nga kasiin lekkhat,” kinnei tia inmani'n inleimasang.<verse eid="MAT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>Khawa jarra Jisu'n mipui ngai neipilla in-ong nasik chong aleipeii. <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>Khawasuoli ama'n waipool sari le nga aleiya, Pathian aleiminpaak, halli kather khoiya asiamruoi ngaidiang aleipeii; woikhat um asiamruoi ngai'n mipui ngaidiang inleisempi. <verse eid="MAT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>Inraya ah inbak halli inleikhop. Khawasuo ah siamruoi ngai'n akaliam seng inkhoomma kokwar sari aleisip. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Numeisa khat-um naipang teelleiya khawa kabak pasal seng lisingmili daam inlei eii.<verse eid="MAT 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Khawasuo khanchu Jisu'n mipui ngaikha aleiminsi jei, halli rakuong suungkhan aluut ah Magadan ramtiang aleisijei.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Chuon Inlak thonasik Nina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mk 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>Pharisee khat-um Sadducee lekkhat in Jisu diang inhongnga ama surnasik ah marwaanna chuon inlak inkhat nathopi inlang naminmuro inhongti. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 12:38">Matt 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luk 11:16</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>Halli Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Kani joluut pha, ‘Khuo thasik eii, ajarchu marwaanna kool-eng asuok ningti.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/>Halli ziingtiang makhan nangni'n ningti, ‘Wini chu ruo asursik eii, ajarchu marwaan asen khat um aziing,’ nangni'n nikhuo omchan ning en li angme kasuok sik ningril mator, takkha hiwa apha jarra akasuok chuon inlak ngaichu nangni'n angme suoksik tia rilmator makchu! <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:3. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscript lekkhat achu Jisu inti chongramol ngaihi Verse 2-3 ah thunmu</char></note><verse eid="MAT 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/>Hituk kathamak li Pathian kajetmak winiya mi ngai'n chuon inlak kha inratok! Takkha Jonah diangnga chuon inlak kha eleiya chuon inlak inkhat nangni diang napenunijei.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 16:4">Halli ama'n inmani ada ah asijei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Matt 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Luk 11:29</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pharisee le Sadducee ngai Chol</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mk 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>Halli siamruoi ngai'n tuidiil kham inkhattiang inheirakaan pha, inmani'n waipool kha hongchoisik inleimanil jei.<verse eid="MAT 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/>Jisu'n inmani diang ati, “In ensuiru; Pharisee ngaili Sadducee ngai cholla inphut khan.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Luk 12:1</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Inmani inkhat li inkhat karra ininbiak ah inti, “Ama'n hiwa atina ajarchu eini waipool heichoi makmi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>Jisu'n angme inmani itikha aleijet, khawa jarra inmani diang aleirakel, E ngamna kasiin ngai “Nangni inkhat li inkha waipool ningnei makna jarra angsik ah ning inbiak me?<verse eid="MAT 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/>Tuun katung nangni lajet makchu be? Kei'n miring lising ranga waipool ranga ah kiwai halli akaliam kokwar angjetme ningminsip nangni ngaidon makchube? <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 14:17-21">Matt 14:17-21</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/>Halli miring lising mili sik ah waipool sari ah kawaili kokwar angjetme nangni'n ningruut minsip? <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 15:34-38">Matt 15:34-38</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/>Kei'n nangni diang waipool jarra rilmong angsik ame khawa ning ijetmak? Pharisee li Sadducee ngai cholla inphut nangni'n in-ensuiru!”<verse eid="MAT 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>Khawasuo khanchu ama'n inmani diang in-ensuiru tia irilhi waipool khanna inneiman chol kha emak takkha Pharisee li Sadducee ngai minchuna ngai khanna inphut eii ti asiamruoi ngai'n inleijet.<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu jarra Peter in Irilsuok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mk 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>Jisu'n Caesarea Philippi ram koolla kaom khuopui khan aheiwa pha, ama'n asiamruoi ngaidiang aleirakel, “Miring Sapa hi mi ngai'n tu eii intime?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>Inmani'n inleimasang, “Mi lekkhat in John Baptist na-eii inti,” “Lekkhat in Elijah na-eii inti, halli lekkhat ngai'n Jeremiah emakli Pathian chongkachoi ngai karra inkhat na-eii inti.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 14:1">Matt 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14">Mk 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7">Luk 9:7</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:8">8</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/>Halli Jisu'n inmani diang aleirakel, “Nangni inle Keihi tu ka-eii ningtime?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>Simon Peter in aleimasang, “Nangchu Messiah, akaring Pathian Sapa kha na-eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 6:68">Jn 6:68</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:69">69</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>“Bar-Jonah sapa Simon, narawaan atha!” tia Jisu'n aleimasang. “Ajarchu hiwa akatuun hi miring taksa ah inphut nangdiang akajuo emak, takkha marwaanna kaom Kapa diangnga inphut akajuo eii. <verse eid="MAT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/>Tuun khawa jarra Kei'n nangdiang kati, nang Peter na-eii (tinachu ‘lung’), hiwa lungpui chunghin Kei'n kakoisuok kasaksik eii, halli khawakha meikhur luutna kot innum matornuni.<verse eid="MAT 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/>Kei'n nangdiang marwaan Rengram sou kha kanapesik eii; nang in nuoipil chungnga nikhit kha marwaan khannum inkhitsik eii, halli nuoipil chungnga nimasuo kha marwaan khannum insuosik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 18:18">Matt 18:18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:23">Jn 20:23</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>Khawa suoli Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang ama hi Messiah eii ti tu inkhat diang um rilpimaru tia chong aleipeii.<verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Ama Poongna le Thina sik jarra Iril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Mk 8:31–9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>Khawapha makheiya Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang, “Kei Jerusalemma kasisik eii halli uparup ngai, thiampu kalian ngai halli sina Dan ocha ngai diangnga inphut kalapoong sik eii. Halli kei innalathat sik eii, takkha nithumni kalahong ringsik eii.” tia inthiangnga karilpi aphut jei.<verse eid="MAT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>Peter in ama kha kaangkhat tiang aruoiya aheiran. “Pumi, khawa kha Pathian in kalaak ah nadapi rase!” ama'n aleiti. “Khawa kha angtikniteii nachungnga kasuok emarase!”<verse eid="MAT 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>Jisu'n ahei-inlet ah Peter diang ati, “Kei diangnga inphut siro, Seitan! Nang hi kei diang insuina inkhat na-ejei, ajarchu hiwa ngaidonna ngai hi Pathian diangnga inphut akajuo emak takkha miring omchanna inphut eii.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>Khawa phakhan Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang aleiti, “Nangni karra tuka-ang inkhat in kanuk najuizoot inchu, ama apumtak ah inzootmak se-inlang, ama cross indom rase, halli kanuk najuirase. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Matt 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luk 14:27</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/>Ajarchu naringkhuo sanringsik namanuom inchu, amangsik eii; halli keisik naringkhuo naminmang inchu, khawa kha nalamusik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Matt 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luk 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jn 12:25</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 16:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/>Nuoipil pumpui namatorli naringkhuo naminmang inchu angme nanemna sik? Emakli mi inkhat in angleme aringkhuo aminthuul sik?<verse eid="MAT 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/>Ajarchu Miring Sapa in Apa lurna lianna khan ama marwaan tirton ngaile inruoiya ajuosik eii, halli khawa phakhan ama'n mi rakip ama chuonleitho dungjuiya atum apesik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 25:31">Matt 25:31</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Minpkla 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Rom 2:6</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 16:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/>Kei'n nangni diang inthiangnga kiril eii, hiwa hinna tuun kangirra kaom lekkhat chu Miring Sapa in Reng eya ijuo inmu makma thinunu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Meelsuo Inthuulna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mk 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>Halli niruk suoa Jisu'n Peter le anaipa James halli John, ama'n aruoiya inmani bit omnasik ching insaang inkhat khan aleisipui. <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>Inmani'n khan inhei enlai, Jisu inmani maikuungnga ameelsuo hong inthuul jei: ama meel kha kani angnga aleiwar, halli ama puondiar ngaikha war angnga aleichek. <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>Halli siamruoi inthum ngai'n Moses khat-um Elijah Jisu le inruoiya thurchi inril inleimu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Khawa jarra Peter in Jisu diang ati, “Pumi, eini'n hinna ni-om hichu angtuk kahoi me! nang in nazoot inchu, kei'n riakbuk inthum sakkate, nang sik inkhat, Moses sik inkhat, halli Elijah sik inkhat.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>Ama'n aril laichei khan, enru, akawar sumphai'n inmani aleimakhu, halli sumphaiya inphut rasa inkhat in ajuoti, “Hiwa hi kiminriang tak kasapa kha eii, ama chungnga kamalung atai; nangni ama iti rangairu!” <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Inphut 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Minpkla 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Matt 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:15">Innidan 18:15</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>Siamruoi ngaikhan rasa kha injetpha, inmani inleichithei, halli neipilchungnga inmani inmeel inkuunna inlei inbok. <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>Jisu'n inkoolla aheiwa ah akatook ah ati, “Intheiru, chimaru!” <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>Halli inmani'n inhong enpha Jisu eleiya tu inkhat bit um khawakhan leimumujei.<verse eid="MAT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>Inmani'n khan chingnga inphut injuo chumpha, Jisu'n inmani diang, “Miring Sapa in thiya inphut ahongring maklaiseng, tu inkhat diang um nangni'n ning imu ngaikha rilsuok maru tia inmani diang chong aleipeii.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>Halli siamruoi ngai'n Jisu diang inleirakel, “Angsikme sina Dan ocha ngai'n Elijah ajuo masasik eii inti?” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>Jisu'n aleimasang, “Inthiangnga Elijah juomasata,” “halli angrakip hi alaminsuuk wiaksik eii.<verse eid="MAT 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/>Takkha kei'n nangni diang kati khachu Elijah kha ajuosuojei takkha mi ngai'n ama leijetmu, takkha inmani'n inmanuom kha ama chungnga inleitho. Khawale in-angrip ah Miring Sapa kha um inmani'n inminpoong nooksik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 11:14">Matt 11:14</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>Khawa phakhan ama'n John Baptist jarra iril eii ti asiamruoi ngai'n inleijet.<verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Raikhuo kaluut Pasal nai inkhat mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mk 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Luk 9:37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>Inmani'n mipui ngaidiang injuokir pha, miring inkhat Jisu diang aheiwa, halli amaikuungnga chubei ajuotho, <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>halli ati, “Ocha, kasapa hi naminriang piro! Ama hi rikeiri araweiya apoongthei jei ajarchu ama tuisuung meisuungnga aluut kachak jei. <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>Kei'n nasiamruoi ngaidiang kaleiruoi, takkha inmani'n namindampi matormu.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>Jisu'n aleimasang, “E ngamna kasiin le mi kathamak ngai! Angtuk kasootme kei nangni le kalaom suomsik hi? Kei'n nangni le angtuk kasoot kanaladeipui sikme? Naipangpa kha hin kakoolla heiruoi ro!” <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Jisu'n ratha kathamak diang khan chong aleipeii, halli ratha kathamak kha naipangpa diangnga inphut aleisuok, khawa phachei khan naipangpa kha adamjei.<verse eid="MAT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>Halli siamruoi ngai'n ruuk ah Jisu diang inheiwa ah inleirakel, “Angjarra keini'n ratha kathamak kha kinpuutsuok matormakme?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/>“Ajarchu ning inngamna kha asiin thei,” tia Jisu'n aleimasang. “Kei'n nangni diang inthiangnga kati khachu anchamru tiatbit kalok inngamna ningnei inchu, nangni'n hiwa ching diang tiningte, ‘hiwa hinna inphut soson inthonro!’ halli khawa khan inthonsik eii. Halli nangni thomatormak sik iteii omnuni!” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:20. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscript lekkhat in alam 21 inthundel:</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Takkha bungeile inruoiya Pathian nina khan bit hiwa rakip hi apuut mator; iteii khat innum matormak </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Mk 9:29 khan enru) </char></note> <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 21:21">Matt 21:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:23">Mk 11:23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 Cor 13:2</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 17:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n inlet ah athina sik jarra iril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mk 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>Siamruoi rakip in Galilee khan injuo inchunwiak phakhan, Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Miring Sapa kha mi ngai kutchungnga inlapesuok sik eii <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/>halli inmani'n ama kha inlathatsik eii; takkha nithum huuini ama ahongringsik eii.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:23">Hiwa injetpha siamruoi ngaikha inleipoong theijei.<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Biak-inn rampar pena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>Jisu le asiamruoi ngai'n Capernaum inheitung pha, nina inna sialkakhompa in Peter diang aheiwa ah aleiti, “Nangni ning ochapa'n Biak-inna pesik kasuok sial kha pemak abe?” <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 30:13">Suok 30:13</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 38:26">38:26</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>“Oh apeii,” tia Peter in aleimasang.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Peter khan innsuung aluutpha, Jisu'n ma-insa khet ah aril, “Simon, angme nangleii ningaidon? Hiwa nuoipilchung reng ngaidiang tu ngai inme rampar inpejol? Aram mi-ngai inbe emakli ramleiilak mi ngai inbe?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>“Mi leiilak ngai'n,” tia Peter in aleimasang.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">“Kha e-inchu athajei,” tia Jisu'n aleiti, “kha tina chu ami ngai inchu penunu. <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/>Takkha eini'n hiwa mi ngaihi minpoong zootmakmi, khawa jarra siro tuidiil khan ngakhuoi jokeiro, halli ma-insakhet ah nisur ngabai khan sial lei omte, Kha lei inlang kei sik le nang sik inmani diang pero” ati.<verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Tume Marwaan Rengramma Kalok khetsik?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mk 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>Khawa phakhan siamruoi ngai'n Jisu diang inheiwa ah injuorakel, “Tume marwaan Rengramma akalok khetsik?” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luk 22:24</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>Khawa jarra Jisu'n naipang inkhat akoiya halli inmani maikuungnga aleiminngir,<verse eid="MAT 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/>Halli ama'n ati, “Kei'n inthiangnga karil khachu nangni'n ningmanuwa inphut ninghei inlet ah naipang ngaihi ninghong angmak inchu, nangni angtikniteii marwaan Rengram kha luut theinutun.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MRK 10:15">Mk 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:17">Luk 18:17</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/>Khawa jarra hiwa naipanghi angnga atheinuo ah anunchan inchuol ama khan marwaan Rengramma kalokkhet sikkha eii. <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/>Hi angnga kei karamingnga hiwa ka-ang naipang inkhat akeiluut inchu, kei um anakeiluut jei.<verse eid="MAT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Manu Chulna sik Matheemna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mk 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1">Luk 17:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>“Tuka-ang inkhat in kei kanangamna hiwa naipang ngai inkhat ama inngamna aminmangpi inchu, ama riingnga akalok lungchakari inkhit ah tuipui inthuuk suungnga indeengluut khan ama sik ah kheella atha.” <verse eid="MAT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/>Mi ngai inngamna kaminmang in-om jarra manmasituolhi angtuk poong kaom sik me! hiwa rakip ngaihi alahongsuok sik eii, takkha hiwarakip kamasuok ama kha angtuk poongkaom sik me!<verse eid="MAT 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/>“Ajarchu nakut emakli nakeii in manuwa namachulsik e-inchu, tan inlang hiaijuonro! nakut inni le nakeii inni inchella hektik kaboi meisuungnga in nadeengluut siknek achu kutkhat kekhat inchelleiya ringna kamukhan athadoom.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 5:30">Matt 5:30</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/>Halli namit in nang kha manuwa namachul sik e-inchu, kelsuok inlang hiaijuonro! namit innile inruoiya hektik kaboi meikhurra kaluut sik nek achu mit khat kaboiya ringnamun kaluut in kheella nangsik ah atha. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 9:25">Matt 9:25</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akamang keelngam chongminkhina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luk 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>“Enru, nangni'n hiwa naipang ngai chungnga enseel-musit thomaru. Ajarchu kei'n nangnidiang kati, inmani marwaan tirton ngai'n marwaanna kaom kapa maikuungnga in-omchak.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:10. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pathian chong lekkhat achu verses 11 hi inthuundel eii </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ajarchu Miring Sapa hi akamang ngai kasan sik ah aleijuo. (Luk 19:10 khan enru) </char></note> <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 19:10">Luk 19:10</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/>Ajarchu akamang ngai kasan sik ah miring Sapa ajuojei.<verse eid="MAT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>“Nangni'n angme ning ngaidon? miring inkhat in keelngam rajakhat aneili khawa ngai karra inkhat amang inchu, ama'n soomkuo leikuo ngaikha chingnga data halli akamang kha karatok asisik eii.” <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/>Kei'n nangni diang inthiangnga kati, khachu ama'n keelngam kha amupha, inmangmak soomkuo leikuo ngai neek ah kheella arokpui. <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/>Hile in-angrip ah marwaanna kaom Kapa in hiwa naipang ngai karra inkhat kha um minmang zootmak.<verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mi inkhat in Manu athopha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>“Nachungnga na-u nanai inkhat in manu atho inchu, akoolla si inlang halli ama masialna kha amadiang ruuk ah jominmuro. Ama'n nang iril kha arangai inchu, nang in na-u nanai kha woikhat naboolthar jei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 17:3">Luk 17:3</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/>Takkha ama'n nachong kha arangai mak inchu, miring inkhat emakli inni ruoiro, ajarchu Pathian chong inthiang in iril angnga, Chongkasuok rakip sakhi inni emakli inthum baisuo ah chong intansik eii ati. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Innidan 19:15</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/>Khawa katung ama'n inmani kha arangai mak inchu, koisuok ngaidiang mindikro. Ahekna ah koisuok ngai itikha arangai mak inchu, ama kha Pathian kajetmak emakli rampar kakhoompa kha eii tia leitaro.”<verse eid="MAT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Khit li Masuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>“Inthiangnga nangnidiang kei'n karil: nangni'n nuoipil chungnga ningkhit kha marwaanna inkhitsik eii, halli nangni'n nuoipil chungnga ningmasuo kha marwaanna inmasuosik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Matt 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:23">Jn 20:23</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/>“Woikhat um, kei'n nangnidiang karil: Nuoipilchungnga nangni inni'n angmekhat jarra ning inzootna inchu, marwaanna kaom Kapa in khawakha nangni sik ah inthiangnga anathopisik eii. <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/>Ajarchu kei karamingnga inni emakli inthum ning inchunna munkhan, kei inmani le khawakhan kaom.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Rangaidamlei Suok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>Khawa phakhan Peter in Jisu diang aheiwa ah aleirakel, “Pumi, ka-u kanai inkhat in kei chungnga manu athopha, woi angjetme kei'n ama kangaidam sik? woisari katung bitbe?” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 17:3">Luk 17:3</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:4">4</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>Jisu'n aleimasang, “Emak, woisari bit emak,” “takkha woisomsari hi sari chak, kei'n nangdiang kitikeeng, <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 4:24">Inphut 4:24</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/>ajarchu marwaan Rengram chu, Reng inkhat in asuok ngai sial-sum ensuisik ingaidon khale in-ang. <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/>Ama'n ka-ensui aphut pha, talent lisingsoom ka-intuol miring inkhat kha akoolla aheiruoi. <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/>Suokpa in asialpuuk thuulnasik kahun sial leineimak, Khawa jarra Rengpa in amadiang anumei, asa halli inei rakipkha intuol thuulnasik ah juojuorro tia chong aleipeii. <verse eid="MAT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/>Khawa jarra suokpa khan Rengpa maikuungnga kemurkhup thep ah, kei nangaak diro, kei'n ki-intuol rakip nathuul kate ama'n ati! <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/>Rengpa khan ama kha ahong minriangjei, halli intuol rakipkha arangaidam piya halli ama kha aleiminsijei.”<verse eid="MAT 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/>“Halli suokpa khan ahongsuok pha, asuok changpui inkhat ama sial talent lekkhat intuol alei-intongpui. Halli ama'n asurra ariing ma-ouwa, ‘ni-intuol kha nathuulro!’ ama'n aleiti. <verse eid="MAT 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/>Ama asuok changpuipa in inbok ah amadiang aleiti, ‘Kei nangaak diro, kei'n nathuul kate!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/>Takkha ama'n leizootmak; khawa rathuulla, ama'n intuol athuulsuo maklaiseng mikhumna khan aleida. <verse eid="MAT 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/>Asuok changpui lekkhat in angme akasuok ngaikha inmupha, inmani inmalung leihoi pimak jei halli inkirra inrengpa diang angme kasuok rakip injuomindik jei. <verse eid="MAT 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/>Khawa jarra amapupa in suokpa kha akoiluut ah, ati. ‘Suok kathamak nang!’ Nang in kei diang nanani jarra, ‘nasialpuuk rakip kei'n kana ngaidampi jei.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/>Kei'n nang kinaminriang angnga, nang innum nasuok changpuipa diang naminriang sik suokmakbe? <verse eid="MAT 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/>Rengpa kha araang theiya, asuokpa kha asialpuuk rakip athuulsuo maklaiseng mikhumna khan aleitirjei.”<verse eid="MAT 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/>Ahekna ah Jisu'n ati, “Nangni rakip in ning-u ningnai ngaikha ningmalungnga ning ngaidam mak inchu, marwaanna kaom kei Kapa innum kha angnga ningchungnga athosik eii.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Ompui Sangram Inthenna jarra minchu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mk 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>Jisu'n hiwa rakip ngaihi arilsuo pha, Galilee mathaanna halli Jordan tuidung raalkhat tiangnga kaom Judea ramtiang aleisi. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>Mipui katamtak in ama inheijui, halli khawakhan inmani aleimindam.<verse eid="MAT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>Pharisee lekkhat in chong rakelli ama surnasik akoolla inheiwa, “Angmekhat jarra miring inkhat in anumei kha ama lungdouwa inthenpuisik hi eini sina Dan in azootbe?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>Jisu'n aleimasang, “Inphutna makheiya Kanaboolpa in pasal khat-um numeisa abool tihi nangni'n Pathian chong inthiang khan lateel makchube?<verse eid="MAT 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/>Pathian in ati, ‘Hiwajarra pasal inkhat in anu li apa mathaanta halli anumeile inchunsik eii, halli inmani innikha pumkhat inhong esik eii,’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Inphut 2:24</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/>Khawa jarra inmani inni ekhaimujei, takkha inkhat bitkha in ejei. Pathian in iminchun jeikha, mi inkhat in khoithen marase.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>Pharisee ngai'n amadiang inleirakel, “Angtiyame, hanle, Moses in inthenpuina chongmajia kha pasalpa in anumei diang pe-inlang inthenpuiro tia chongpeii ileipe?” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 24:2-4">Innidan 24:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Matt 5:31</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Nangni ningmalung ningminngar jarra Moses in nangnidiang ningnumei ngai inthenpui acha tia inazootpi kha eii, Takkha inphutna achu kha lei-emak.<verse eid="MAT 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/>Kei'n nangnidiang kati, tuka-ang inkhat in anumei kha zool-inthai jarra eleiya inthenpuiya, halli numeisa khat aneirit inchu amakha zool-inthai athojei.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Matt 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1 Cor 7:10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>Asiamruoi ngai'n amadiang inleiti, “Hiwa omchanhi aruothar li anumei karra asuok inchu, inn kaneimak khan athadoom.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>Jisu'n aleimasang, “Hiwa minchuna hi mirakip sik emak, takkha Pathian in ipe inmani ngaisik bit eii. <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/>Ajarchu Mi ngai'n inn inneimakna jarra inteina om, lekkhat in anu wonsungnga atak inboolsa ah innei; lekkhat in miring ngai'n atak inbool; halli lekkhat in Marwaan Rengramsik ah inn kaneimak inom. Tuka-ang hiwa minchuna kazoot ngai'n hiwahi juirasu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Akadoong Naipang ngai Rawaan ipe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mk 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Mi lekkhat in naipang ngai chungnga akut aduongnga anipi nasik Jisu diang inhongruoi, takkha siamruoi ngai'n inmani kha inleiran. <verse eid="MAT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>Halli Jisu'n ati, “Naipang ngaikha kakoolla hongrasu nangni'n khapmaru, ajarchu marwaan Rengram hi hiwa ka-ang ngaita eii.”<verse eid="MAT 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>Ama'n inmani chungnga akut aduongpi halli khawa munna inphut asijei.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Inchong Ruothar inkhat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mk 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Enru, mi inkhat in Jisu diang ahongnga ati, “Ocha,” “Kei'n hektik kaneimak ringna kamunasik angkachang chuon katha khame kathosik?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>Jisu'n aleimasang, “Angsikme nang in akatha chuon jarra ninarakel?” “Akatha mi inkhat bit aom, khachu hektik kaneimak ringna kha naluutzoot inchu chongpeii ngaikha juiro.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>Jisu diang ama'n aleirakel, “Ang chongpeii ngai khame?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Jisu'n aleimasang, “Mi thatmaro; zool-inthaimaro; inruup thomaro; kadikmak sakhi pemaro; <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-16">Suok 20:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Innidan 5:17</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:14">Suok 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18">Innidan 18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:15">Suok 20:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:19">Innidan 5:19</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:16">Suok 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-20">Innidan 5:17-20</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/>nanu li napa kaya ro; halli ni-indiang ni-inwaipui ngaikha nang in napumtak ni-inriang angnga minriang ro.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Suok 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Innidan 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Levi 19:18</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>“Kei'n hiwa chongpeii rakip ngaihi kajuijei,” “Angme kei'n katho delsik?” tia ruotharpa in aleimasang.<verse eid="MAT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>Jisu'n amadiang aleiti, “Nang in puikatung na-ezoot inchu, si inlang nineirakip jojuorro halli sial kha sara ngaidiang juopero, halli marwaanna karei naneisik eii; hallikhan heiwaro, kei najuiro.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Ruotharpa in hiwa itihi ajetpha, ama'n malung poongtheiya asijei, ajarchu ama inchongthei alei eii.<verse eid="MAT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>Khawa suoli Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang ati, “Kei'n inthiangnga kiril eii: inchong mi in marwaan Rengram kaluutsik hi intak. <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/>Woikhat kei'n nangnidiang kati: mi inchong inkhat in Pathian Rengram kaluutsik neek achu salaileem inkhat in simphuoi kuorra iluut in abeidet.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>Siamruoi ngai'n hiwa injetpha, inmani'n inthiangnga inleingak. halli, “Tume, ringna akamusik?” tia inmani'n inleirakel.<verse eid="MAT 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>Jisu'n inmani diang enna aleimasang, “Hiwa hi miring ngaisik achu thomator emak, takkha Pathian inchu hiwarakip hi amator.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Khawa phakhan Peter in aleimasang. “Enro,” “Keini'n hiwarakip kinda ah nanuk kinnajui. Keinisik ang omme?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>Jisu'n inmani diang ati, “Kei'n nangnidiang inthiangnga kiti eii khachu Miring Sapa in ama apoinale inruoiya Manmasituol Kathar khan ama reng in-ongna khan in-ong pha, nangni anakajui soomleini ngai um reng in-ongna khan ningla in-ong sik eii, halli Israel zaat soomleini ngaikha chong katansik ni-eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 25:31">Matt 25:31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:30">Luk 22:30</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/>Kei sik jarra, a-inn alei, a-u anai, anu apa emakli asa ngai kada mi rakip in tum rajakhat kheella amusik eii halli hektik kaboi ringkhuo kha inmusik eii.<verse eid="MAT 19:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/>Takkha makasa katamkhat in nuk inlatongsik eii, halli nukkatong ngai khan ma-inlasasik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 20:16">Matt 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Luk 13:30</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Theibombilla Chuonkatho ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>“Marwaan Rengram hi, miring inkhat in ziingtiang ma-ah intheiya ama theibombilla chuonkathosik loom lekkhat karatok kasi khale in-ang.” <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/>Ama'n nisuokhat chuontho manhi, dangkapum inkhat ah inzootpuiya, halli inmani ngaikha ama theibombilla chuonkathosik aleitir. <verse eid="MAT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/>Halli ama'n phurjuorna munna asinook ah, i-kathomak kangirra kaom mi lekkhat kha phadan kuo khan aleimu, <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/>halli ama'n inmanidiang ati, Kei'n pesik kasuok nisuokhat chuonthoman kha napekate, nangni um si inlang theibombilla chuon juothoru. <verse eid="MAT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/>Halli inmani insijei. Ama'n inlet ah asuoknook ah phadan soomleini khat-um phadan inthum chulphakhan khawale in-angrip ah aleitho. <verse eid="MAT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/>Kholei phadan ranga juochul pha ama'n phurjuorna munna asi ah, halli miring lekkhat kangirra kaom ajuo munook, halli inmanidiang ati, Nangni'n suunsoot iteii tholeiya ningngirra ning-omhi angsik ame? <verse eid="MAT 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/>Inmani'n inleimasang, tu inkhat innum loom naruoimu. Thajei, kha e-inchu, nangni si inlang theibombilla chuon juothoru, inmanidiang ama'n aleiti.<verse eid="MAT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>“Kholei aheitung pha, theibombil mapupa in ama chuon ka-ensui ngaidiang ati, ‘Chuon katho ngaikha koi inlang halli inchuon thoman kha nuk intong khet ah inruoi makheiya phut inlang ma-insa khet ah inruoi katung kha joperu.’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 19:13">Levi 19:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:15">Innidan 24:15</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/>Phadan ranga pheiweiya chuonkaphut ngai rakip diang dangkapum inkhat inkhat inleipeii. <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/>Khawa jarra loom ma-insa ngai'n inheiwapha, inmani'n katamdet mukinte tia inlei ngaidon; takkha inmani rakip um dangkapum inkhat inkhat inleipeii. <verse eid="MAT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/>Inmani'n insial kha inleiya halli leimapupa chungnga num kati inleiphut. <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/>‘Nuk intongnga loom niruoi ngai'n phadan inkhatbit chuon intho,’ inmani'n inti, ‘Keini'n suunsoot kanisa kindeiya chuon kintho, takkha keini diangnga ninapele in-angrip ah inmani diang um napeii!’ <verse eid="MAT 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/>Khawa khan ama'n inmani diang aleimasang, ‘Rangairu, kasap ngai,’ tia leimapupa in inmani karra inkhatpa diang ati, ‘Kei'n nangnidiang maleisei thomong, nangnile suunkhat ah chuonthoman dangkapum inkhat ah ni-inzoot suo emak abe? <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/>Tuun naleisik kha lei inlang na-inna siro. Nang diangnga kinape angnga nuk intong khet ah kiruoipa diang um kei'n kapezoot. <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/>Kei kasial kha kalungdouwa thonasik ranak neimongnga be? Emakli kei kamalung inthiang hi ninara-ot be?’ ”<verse eid="MAT 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>Ahekna ah Jisu'n ati, “Khawa jarra tuka-ang nuk intong ngaikhan ma-insasik eii, halli tuka-ang ma-insa ngaikhan nuk intongsik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Matt 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mk 10:31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Luk 13:30</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu'n Woithum Huina Ama Athina sik jarra iril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mk 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>Jisu'n Jerusalem tiang asilai, siamruoi soomleini ngai lamleii inkhattiang aleiruoi halli inmani'n khan insipha, ruuk ah inmani diang aleiril. <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/>“Rangairu,” “Eini'n Jerusalem tiang nikalla nisi, khawamun khan Miring Sapa kha thiampu kalian ngai khat-um Dan ocha ngai kutchungnga inlapesik eii. Halli inmani'n amakha thatnasik ah akatuunmak eii tia inrilsesik eii, tia inmanidiang aleirilpi <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/>halli khawa suo ah Zaatlop ngaidiang, ama innuipui nasik, wuoknasik halli Cross ah makaiya thatnasik inlapesik eii; takkha nithum nikhan ama alahongring nooksik eii.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nu inkhat nina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mk 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Khawasuoli Zebedee numei khan asangai innile inruoiya Jisu diang inhongnga, ama maikuungnga chubei inthoa, imanuom inkhat nathopiro tia amadiang aleini.<verse eid="MAT 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>“Angme nimanuom?” Jisu'n amadiang aheirakel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Ama'n aheimasang, “Keidiang chong inkhitro, khawa khachu hiwa kasa inni ngaihi nang in Reng na-epha inkhat in nachangtiang halli inkhat in naweitiang in-ongrasu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>Jisu'n hin tia aleimasang, “Nangni'n ningni kha angme ti jetmakchu,” “Kei'n ka-insik poongna rabing hi nangni'n inmator tunnabe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">“Keini kinmator,” tia inmani'n inleimasang.<verse eid="MAT 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>“Nangni'n inthiangnga kei karabing kha in ningte,” tia Jisu'n inmani diang ati, “Takkha keichu tume kei kachang kawei tiangnga in-ongsik kadang nasik ranak neimong. Takkha kapa in inmanisik eii tia iboolpingai sik kha eii.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>Siamruoi soom ngai'n hiwa jar injet pha, unai inni ngai chungnga inmani inleiraang.<verse eid="MAT 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/>Khawa jarra Jisu'n inmani raja ah akoichunna ati, “Pathian kajetmak zaatlop lamkakei ngai'n inmani chungnga wairoonna ranak innei, halli inmani lamkakei ngai'n puikatungnga thomatorna innei ti nangni'n ningjet. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 2:25">Luk 2:25</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 2:26">26</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/>Nangni karra chu khawakha emak. Tuka-ang inkhat in akalok ezoot inchu, ama'n nangni rakip suok kha e-sik eii; <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Matt 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mk 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk 22:26</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/>halli nangni karra inkhat in ma-insa ezoot inchu, amakha nangni rakip ngai suok kha e-sik eii, <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/>hile in-angrip ah Miring Sapa kha sepa inthosik ah akajuo kha emak, takkha sepa kathosik halli mi rakip ngai kasanring sik ah aringkhuo kape ijuo eii.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Mitkacho Inni mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mk 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>Jisu li asiamruoi ngai'n Jericho inheimathaan pha, mipui katam tak in Jisu nuk inhongjui. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Lam sirra in-ong mitkacho miring inni'n Jisu aheiwa ti injet pha, inringnga inhongkheek, “David Sapa! Pumi, Keini naminriangro!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Mipui in omchianru tia inmanikha inleiran. Takkha inmani'n kheella inringnga inhongkheek, “David Sapa! Pumi, Keini naminriangro!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>Jisu'n angirra inmanikha aleikoi. “Angme kei nangnisik ningnamintho zoot?” tia ama'n inmani diang aleirakel.<verse eid="MAT 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>Inmani'n inti “Pumi,” “Keini kinmit kinmuzoot!”<verse eid="MAT 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Jisu'n inmani aleiminriangnga inmit ngai kha aleikatook pi; khawa phatak khan inmani inmujei halli inmani'n ama kha injuijei.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Raal matorra Jerusalem iluut</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jn 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>Jisu khat-um asiamruoi ngai'n Jerusalem inheinaiya Olives Chingnga kaom Bethphage kha inheitung, halli Jisu'n asiamruoi inni ngaikha inmatiang aleitirjei. <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/>“Ningma tiangnga kaom khuokhan siru, halli nangni'n salungdai apui koolla inkhit ateii inkhat jomuningte. Inmani kha suut inlang keidiang hongruoiru. <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/>Halli tuka-ang inkhat in anarakel inchu, ‘Pumi khan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:3. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pumi khan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Inmani mapupa</char></note> inmani hi inliingnasik aom’; ama diang tipiru, halli ama'n inmani kha khawapha takkhan aheimasuosik eii.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>Hiwa kasuok rakip hi Pathian chongkachoipa ileiril kha huui ahongtung nasik eii:<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>“Zion sanu ngaidiang rilpiru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">Enru, nangni rengpa kha nangnidiang ajuo jei!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Amachu anunchan inchuol halli salungdai achuong</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">halli salungdai khachu ateii eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zech 9:9</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>Khawa jarra siamruoi ngai'n insi ah Jisu'n angme inmani diang thoru itikha injuothojei: <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>inmani'n salungdai apui li ateii inhongruoi, inchungnga inpuon indaaplikhan Jisu inleimin-ong. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>Mipui katam khat in inpuondiar lamchungnga intha, lekkhat in thingbuo intukthaak ah lamchungnga inleitha.<verse eid="MAT 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/>Halli Jisu matiangnga kasili anuk tiangnga kasi mipui ngai'n inhongkheek, “Hosanna David Sapa! Pumi ramingnga akajuo amakha arawaan atha! insaang khet ah Hosanna.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Minpkla 118:25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>Jisu'n Jerusalem aluut phakhan, khuopui pumpui kha rasa in aleisip. “Ama hi tume?” tia mipui'n inleirakel.<verse eid="MAT 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>“Ama hi Galileeya kaom Nazareth ah inphut Pathian chongkachoi Jisu kha eii,” tia mipui ngai'n inleimasang.<verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Biak-inn Iminthiang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mk 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jn 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Jisu'n Biak-inn aluutli khanna karacho li kajuor mi rakip ngaikha aleipuutsuok. Ama'n sialchuoi kamakoi ngai khamtuol halli pharbali kajuor ngai in-ongna lukham ngaikha aleimalet aleimakhup pijei,<verse eid="MAT 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/>halli inmani diang ati, “Kei ka-inn hi Pathian nina inn intia inkoisik eii.” Takkha nangni'n inruup katho ngai omna ningmin ejei! <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer 7:11</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>Khawa suoli mitkacho li kekakiak ngai'n Biak-inna ama koolla inleihong, halli ama'n aleimindam. <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Thiampu kalian li Dan ocha ngai'n Jisu itho chuon inlak ngai halli naipang ngai'n Biak-inna “Hosanna David Sapa!” intia inkheek kha inmupha inraangnga Jisu diang inheiti,<verse eid="MAT 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/>“Angme inmani'n inti nang najetbo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">“Inthiangnga kei'n kajet,” tia Jisu'n aleimasang. “Hiwa chong inthiang hi nangni'n lateel ngaimak chube? ‘Nangni'n akadoong naipang khat-um ranu laka-in ngai murra Pathian inminpaaksik eii tia ningminchu kha.’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 8:2">Minpkla 8:2</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Jisu'n inmani amathaanna halli Bethany khuopui tiang asiya, khawa munkhan zaankhat ajuoriakjei.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Theichang Kuung Khomaak Isaam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mk 11:12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Ziingkhuo ahongwar pha, khuopuitiang aheikirna lamma, ama awon aleichaampi. <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>Ama'n lamkoolla kamoong theichang kuungkhat aleimu halli aleisi, takkha abuo elekleiya akara khat-um khawakhan leimumak. Khawa jarra ama'n theichang kuung diang khan ati, “Nang angtikniteii inra khaimaro!” Khawapha takkhan theichang kuungkha ajuochar jei.<verse eid="MAT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>Hiwahi asiamruoi ngai'n inleimu halli inleingak. “Angtho thoa hituk innoot ah theichang kuung hi icharme?” tia inmani'n inleirakel.<verse eid="MAT 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/>Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Kei'n nangnidiang inthiangnga kanati, khachu nangni'n inngamna ningneiya halli ning inngamsammak jei inchu, kei'n theichang kuungnga kitho angnga nangni innum kheella thomator ningte. Hiwa bit eleiya, nangni'n hiwa ching diang um, ‘Inphuk inlang natheinuo ah tuipui son juota-taro nati innum,’ khawakha inthosik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Matt 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 Cor 13:2</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/>Nangni'n ning inngamna inchu, Pathian diang angme ningnikha ningmusik eii.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Thomatorna jarra Chongrakelna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mk 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>Jisu'n Biak-inn tiang ahongkirra; halli ama'n aleiminchu, thiampu kalian khat-um uparup ngai'n amadiang inhongnga inhongti, “Hiwa ngaihi ang thomatorna naneiya nithome? Tu-in hika-ang thomatorna anapeme?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>Jisu'n aleimasang, “Kei'n chongkhat narakel kate, halli nangni'n ningna masang inchu, Kei innum hiwa rakip ngaihi ang thomatorna kaneiya kithome ti narilpi kate. <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/>John in baptize ileitho kha hu makheiyame: Pathian makheiyabe emakli miring makheiyabe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Inmani inkhat li inkhat inlei inbiak, “Angme eini'n nitisik? ‘Marwaanna inphut eii,’ niti inchu, ama'n einidiang atisik eii, ‘Angsik ah me hanle nangni'n ama ningngamnamak?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>Halli ‘Miringnga inphut eii niti inchu,’ eini'n mipui ngaikha nichi, ajarchu inmani rakip in John hi Pathian chongkachoi inkhat eii tia inleilei.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Khawa jarra inmani'n Jisu diang inleimasang, “Keini'n jetmungjei.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Halli ama'n inmani diang ati, “Kha e-inchu, Kei innum nangni diang, angranak kaneiya hiwa ngaihi kithome ti narilpi nuning.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sapa Inni Chungnga Chongminkhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>“Tuun, nangni'n angme ningngaidon? Mi inkhat in sapa inni aleinei. Ama'n asapa upa padiang asiya ati, ‘Sapa, awini theibombilla si inlang chuon juothoro.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/>Halli ama'n aleimasang, kei sinuning, takkha ama'n amalung thuulla aleisi. <verse eid="MAT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/>Khawa suoli apa in asapa naipangpa diang asiya khale in-angrip ah aleiti, ama'n aleimasang, Oh pa, takkha ama leisimak. <verse eid="MAT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/>Hiwa inni ngai karra tu-inme apa lungdou leikatho?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">“Upapa eii,” tia inmani'n inleimasang.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Kei'n nangni diang inthiangnga kiti hi eii: rampar kakhoom ngaili zool-inthai ngai'n Pathian Rengram tiang ningma insa ah insisik eii.<verse eid="MAT 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/>John Baptist in akatuun lamkha kanaminmusik aheiwa, halli nangni'n ama kha ngamna makchu; takkha rampar kakhoom ngai li zool-inthai ngai'n amakha inleingamna, Hiwahi nangni'n ningmu innum, ningmalung thuul inlang ama ngamna makchu. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luk 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:29">7:29</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 7:30">30</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Theibombilla Chuonkatho ngai Chongminkhina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mk 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>“Hiwa chongminkhi inkhat hi rangaingru,” Jisu'n ati. “Leimapupa inkhat in theibombil inkhat athoa aleiling, halli aleirakulla, theibomtui sumnasik khur inkhat aleichei, hiwa ngaaknasik ah berteii khat aleisak. Khawa suoli chuonkatho ngaidiang aminhuumma ramkalaak inkhattiang aleisijei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 5:1">Isa 5:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 5:2">2</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/>Theibom kara rakhoolpha ahongtung phakhan, ama changsik tum kha kaleisik asuok ngaikha chuonkatho ngaidiang aleitir. <verse eid="MAT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/>Chuonkatho ngaikhan asuok ngaikha insurra, inkhat kha inleiwuok, inkhat kha inleithat halli inkhat kha lungnga inleideeng. <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/>Woikhat inlet ah asuok katamdet aleitir, takkha chuonmi ngaikhan matiangnga intho khale in-angrip ah inmani diang inleithonook. <verse eid="MAT 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/>Ahekna khet-ah, inmani'n kasapa chu khoya nathopi inte, tia asapa kha inmani diang aleitirjei. <verse eid="MAT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/>Takkha chuonmi ngaikhan asapa inmu pha, inmani inkhatli inkhat-in inlei inti, Hiwahi leimapupa sapa kha eii, heiwaru, eini'n ama thatrui, halli ama changsik kasuok kha eini'n leirui! <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/>Halli inmani'n amakha inthat-ah, theibombil raalkhattiang, inlei kalekjuonjei.”<verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>Khawa jarra, “Theibombil mapupa in aheikirpha, khawa chuonkatho ngaidiang ama'n angme athosik?” tia Jisu'n aleirakel.<verse eid="MAT 21:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>Inmani'n inleimasang, “Ama'n mi kathamak ngaikha suoileiya athatsik eii.” “halli aphakacha ah amadiang atum theibomkara kapesik aleiilak chuonmi ngaidiang khan ama'n arahuon kha aminhuumsik eii.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>Jisu'n inmani diang ati, “Chong inthiang in angme itikha nangni'n lateel ngai makchube?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">‘Inn kasak ngai'n inhiai lungkha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">akil kasur lungkha ahong-inchang.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Hiwahi Pumi itho eii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">eini mit-en nachu inlakchuon eii!’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Minpkla 118:22</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:23">23</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>“Khawa jarra kei'n nangni diang kati,” “Pathian Rengram hi nangni diangnga inphut inlakeisuosik eii halli khawa kara kaminra mi ngaidiang inpesik eii.” <verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/>Hiwa lungchungnga kajuota tuka-ang ngaikhan alek-alek ah inkoisik eii, halli hiwa lung-in ijuodel tuka-ang mikhan rahut angnga innooisik eii.<verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>Thiampu kalian ngaili Pharisee ngai'n Jisu chongminkhi kha injetpha, inmani jarra iril eii ti inleijet. <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>Khawa jarra inmani'n ama surnasik inleitho. Takkha mipui ngaikha inleichi, ajarchu mipui ngai'n Jisu hi Pathian chongkachoi inkhat eii tia inleilei.<verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Moiruoi Bubakna ah chongminkhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luk 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>Hiwasuo Jisu'n woikhat inlet ah chongminkhina kha aneimanna mi ngaidiang aleiril. <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/>“Marwaan Rengramchu, tuka-ang reng inkhat in asapa moiruoina ah bubaknasik insuuk khale in-ang. <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/>Bukabak hongnasik ah koina cheii ipe ngaikha jokoiru tia ama suok ngai aleitir, takkha inmani leihong zootmu. <verse eid="MAT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/>Khawa jarra woikhat asuok lekkhat ngaidiang hiwa chonghi apeya koina cheii inpe ngaidiang khan: Enru, Kei'n bubaknasik kha tuun kaminsuuk suojei; kei kasaraat ngai halli akanool kasechal ngai kathat ah chuon rakip ngaihi kaminsuuk suojei. Moiruoi bubakna hin hongtaru! tia aleitir <verse eid="MAT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/>Takkha koina cheii kamu ngai'n sisik leingaidonmu halli inmani'n inchuon-inchuon tiangkhan: inkhat in aleiya, lekkhat in insiallou natiang inleisi, <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/>khawa khanna kaom aleiilak ngai'n asuok ngaikha insurra, inleiwuok, halli inleithat. <verse eid="MAT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/>Rengpa kha araang theiya; raalmi ngai atirra mikathat ngaikha aminthat jei halli inkhuopui kha um mei aminhaaljei. <verse eid="MAT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/>Khawa phakhan ama'n asuok ngai akoiya inmani diang ati, Kei moiruoi bubakna sik hi kaminhekjei, takkha kikoi ngaihi kahong sik rahoi suok mujei. <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/>Khawa jarra tuun nangni'n lampui ngaikhan si-inlang ning imu miring rakip ngaikha moiruoi bubakna sik ah juokoi ru. <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/>Khawa jarra suok ngaikhan lamma insuok ah, katha khat-um kathamak rakip ngaikha inhong minchun; halli moiruoina munkha mipui akahong ngaikhan insipjei.”<verse eid="MAT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>“Rengpa khan ahong inchun ngai ka-en aheiluut pha, moiruoi puondiar kathomak miring inkhat aleimu. <verse eid="MAT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/>Rengpa in amadiang ati, ‘Suopui, angtho-thoa moiruoi puondiar tholeiya hiwahin nihongluut me?’ takkha ama'n iteii um leirilmakjei.<verse eid="MAT 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/>Halli rengpa in suok ngaidiang aleiti, ‘Akeii akut khit inlang aziingna tuolkhan amakha kalekjuonru. Khawa munkhan ama'n aha karial ta achapsik eii.’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Matt 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luk 13:28</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>Ajarchu “Katamtak inkoi, takkha lekteiibit inkadang.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Rampar Pejarra Chongrakelna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mk 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>Khawa phakhan Pharisee ngai'n insuok ah Jisu chongrilla inphut surnasik chuon inleiminsuuk. <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Halli Herod mi ngaile inmani siamruoi ngai intirra injuo minti, “Ocha,” “Nang in akatuun naril, mi ngaidiang Pathian jarra akatuun lamkha naminchu, halli tu-inkhat um chimakche, ajarchu mimeel mimai enna chuonkatho emakche tihi keini'n kinjet. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>Khawa jarra keini diang narilpiro, angme ningaidon? Rome Rengpa Caesar diang rampar kapehi eini sina Dan akoibe emakli koimakbe?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Jisu'n inmani thamakna kha ajet ah aheiti, “Akatha omchan katho ngai! Angsik ame kei nasursik ningtho? <verse eid="MAT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/>Rampar pesik sialkha keidiang naminmuru!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Halli inmani'n amadiang dangkapum kha inheichoi, <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>Halli ama'n inmani diang aleirakel, “Tu ramil li ramingme hiwa ngaihi?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>Inmani'n inleimasang, “Reng Caesar ta eii.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Khawa phakhan Jisu'n inmani diang ati, “Athajei, kha e-inchu Reng Caesar ta kha Caesar diang peru, halli Pathian ta kha Pathian diang peru.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>Khawa injet pha inmani'n inleingak; halli amakha inmathaanna insijei.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hongringna jarra Chongrakel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mk 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>Ahongkaringnook tihi ommak kati Sadducee lekkhat khawani khan Jisu diang inhongnga inhongrakel.<verse eid="MAT 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/>Inmani'n inti, “Ocha,” “Moses in, mi inkhat in saneileiya athi inchu, ama unai inkhat in chulmeinu kha neita sa aneisik eii, khawa sangai kha akathipa sangai eii tia inleisik eii aleiti. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Innidan 25:5</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>Keini karra unai sari kinleiom; upakhetpa khan numei aleinei halli saneileiya athijei, anumei kha anai ngaidiang aleidajei. <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>Khale in-angrip ah inni huuina, inthum huuina, insuona khet ah sari huuina anaipa diang um aleisuokjei. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>Ajuohekna khetkhan numeisanu kha um athijei. <verse eid="MAT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>Khawa jarra tuunchu hongring nookna nikhuo nikhan, amahi tu numei esikme? ajarchu inmani rakip in amakha inleinei.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, Chong inthiang emakli Pathian ranak kha nangni'n jetmakchu jarra, “nangni lamleii tiang ningsijei! <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/>Ajarchu kathi ngaikhan inhongring pha, inmani khachu marwaan tirton ngai ang-inta marwaanna in-omsik eii, inmanidiang inkanei moikaruoi ti omnuni. <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/>Kathi ngai'n inhongringnook sik jarra: Pathian in nangni diangnga itikha lateel ngaimak chube? ati,<verse eid="MAT 22:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/>‘Kei Abraham Pathian, Isaac Pathian khat-um Jacob Pathian ka-eii,’ Amachu kathi ngai Pathian emak takkha akaring ngai Pathian eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Suok 3:6</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Mipui in hiwa injetpha, inmani'n ama minchuna khan inleingak.<verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akalok khet Chongpeii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mk 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Jisu'n Sadducee ngaikha min-om chianjei tikha Pharisee ngai'n injet phakhan, inmani rakip in inchunna inleinei, <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/>Halli inmani ngai karra, sina Dan ocha inkhat in, chongrakel nale inruoiya ama surnasik lei-ensui. <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>“Ocha,” “Sina Dan suungnga huwa chongpeii hume kalokkhet?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/>Jisu'n aleimasang, “ ‘Pumi na Pathian kha namalung, naratha, halli na-ngaidonna pumpuiya minriangro.’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Innidan 6:5</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/>Hiwahi akalokkhet khat-um ma-insakhet chongpeii kha eii.<verse eid="MAT 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/>Halli hi angnga inni huuina kha um: ‘Nang in na-indiang na-inwaipui ngai kha napumtak angnga minriangro.’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Levi 19:18</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 22:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/>Moses sina Dan khat-um Pathian chongkachoi ngai minchuna kha hiwa chongpeii inni hin araya ah ahuui wiakjei.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Messiah jarra Chongrakelna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mk 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>Pharisee lekkhat in inlei intup pha, Jisu'n inmani diang aheirakel, <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/>“Messiah jarra angme ningngaidon? Ama hi tu sapa me?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Inmani'n inleimasang, “Ama hi David sapa eii.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43"/>“Jisu'n inmani diang ati, kha e-inle, David in Ratha ah amadiang angtho-thoa ‘Pumi’ tia ikoime? David in ati,<verse eid="MAT 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44"/>‘Pumi in Kapumi diang ati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">Kei kachangtiang in-ongro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">Kei'n ni-inhalpui ngaikha nakeii nuoiya kada maklaiseng.’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Minpkla 110:1</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>David in amakha ‘Pumi’ tia akoi inchu, angtho-thoa Messiah hi David sapa esikme?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>Tu inkhat in num Jisu diang chong inkhat um leimasang mator mujei, khawani makheiya inphut tu-inkhat innum amadiang chong inkhat um rakelmujei.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Dan Ocha ngai li Pharisee ngai chungnga chongmakhaina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38">Mk 12:38</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 12:39">39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luk 11:43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45">20:45</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 20:46">46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Halli Jisu'n mipui ngai khat-um ama siamruoi ngaidiang aleiti. <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/>“Sinadan ocha ngaili Pharisee ngai'n Moses in-ongna khan in in-ong. <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/>Khawa jarra inmani'n angme thoru inti rakip nangni'n thoru halli juiru; takkha inmani omchan khachu juimaru, ajarchu inmani'n angme inril kha inmani'n thomu. <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/>Inmani'n phurrik kha inkhit ah, mi ngai darkhoi chungnga inminpuut, takkha inmani inchu inkutramol inkhat innum kadompuimu.<verse eid="MAT 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/>Takkha inmani chuontho rakipchu mi ngai munasik ah intho, enru inmani'n Chong inthiang ramol ngaikha inmachal khat-um inbaanna inmakhai, halli inmani puondiar inchuol inkahak mor ngaikhan inmakhai!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5. </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Inmani puondiar inchuol inkahak </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hi Pathian ka-inngamna in eii ti injetna eii (Teelna 15:37-41 hin enru)</char></note> <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 6:1">Matt 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:8">Innidan 6:8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 15:38">Teelna 15:38</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/>Inmani'n bubakna mun kahoikhet li synagogue ah in-ongna kahoikhet kha inkadang; <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/>inmani'n mipui inchunna munkhan mi ngai'n khoya intho halli Ocha tia inmani inkoikha inleimanuom. <verse eid="MAT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/>Takkha nangnichu Ocha intimaru; ajarchu nangni Ocha chu inkhat bit eii, halli nangni rakipchu unai ning-eii. <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/>Halli nuoipilchungnga tu inkhat diang-um Pa ti inlang koimaru, ajarchu nangni marwaanna Pa inkhat bitkha ningnei. <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/>Emakli nangni chu Lamkakei intimaru, ajarchu nangni ngai lamkakei khachu Messiah bit kha eii.<verse eid="MAT 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/>Nangni karra kalokkhet ama khan nangni suok ala esik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 20:26">Matt 20:26</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 20:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mk 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:43">10:43</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:44">44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk 22:26</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/>Ajarchu tuka-ang atheinuo ah indomsaang amakha alaminniamsik eii, halli tuka-ang atheinuo ah nunchan inchuol amakha lakadomsaang sik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luk 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">18:14</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Inmani Omchankatha Intho ngai Izootmak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mk 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luk 11:39-42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>“Nangni nunchan katha inleem, dan ocha khat-um Pharisee ngai! Nangni diang poongna omrase, ajarchu nangni'n marwaan Rengram kha mi ngai chungnga ningkharjei, takkha nangni-um luutmakchu, halli luutsik katho inmani kha um zootpimakchu!” <verse eid="MAT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/>Nangni nunchan katha inleemngai, Dan ocha khat-um Pharisee ngai! Nangni diang poongna omrase, ajarchu nangni'n Pathian diang kani omchan ningthoa kasoot ah ningni, halli chuulmei ngai innle-lei um ningkasut, khawa jarra nangni'n kheella kalok poongna ngaikha ningmusik eii.<verse eid="MAT 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/>“Nangni nunchan katha inleemngai, Dan karu khat-um Pharisee ngai! Nangni diang poongna omrase, ajarchu nangni'n tuipui khat-um ram rakip ah ningloonna mi inkhat omchan ninminthuul, halli nangni'n amakha nangni neek-ah chan inni chungtiang poongnakamu meikhur sapa kha ninmin eii!”<verse eid="MAT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>“Nangni mitkacho lamkakei ngai, Ningchungnga poongna omrase, nangni'n ningti, ‘Tuka-ang inkhat in Biak-inn palla chong inkhit inchu ama chong-inkhitna khan inkhitmak; takkha ama'n Biak-inna kaom soonna rakook ah chong inkhit khachu, amakha chong inkhit eii.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/>Aka-am khat-um mitkacho ngai! Soonna emakli soonna kha kaminthiang biak-inn hi hume kheella kalok? <verse eid="MAT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/>Halli nangni'n ningminchu, Tuka-ang inkhat in Pathian maichaam rakook ah chong inkhit khachu ama chong inkhitna khan inkhit mak; takkha ama'n Pathian maichaam chungnga inda kutchoi kha rakook ah chong inkhit khachu amakha chong inkhit eii. <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/>Nangni mitkacho ngai, kutchoi emakli kutchoi kaminthiang Pathian maichaam kha hume kheella kalok? <verse eid="MAT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/>Khawa jarra Pathian maichaam rakook ah chong inkhit ama'n maichaam khat-um khawa chungnga kaom phur rakipkha rakook ah chong inkhit eii. <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/>Halli Biak-inn rakook ah chong inkhit ama'n biak-inn khat-um khawa suungnga kaom Pathian rakook ah chong inkhit eii.<verse eid="MAT 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/>Halli tuka-ang inkhat in marwaan rakook ah chong inkhitpha, ama'n Pathian reng in-ongna khat-um khawa chungnga in-ong Pathian kha rakook ah chong inkhit eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:34">Matt 5:34</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>“Nangni nunchan katha inleem! Dan ocha khat-um Pharisee ngai, nangni chungnga poongna omrase! ajarchu thikaraanglei, reihiing khat-um wonpuorlei ngaihi soom suungnga inkhat Pathian diang ningpeli, chongpe khaneek ah arei ka-eii minchuna ngai, akatuun, minriang khat-um ngamna hichu ningmathaan, takkha hiwarakip hi nangni'n ningthosik asuok halli aleiilak ngaihi um manilmaru.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Levi 27:30</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/>Juchukchu kha radiikna ah ningradiikli, salaileem chu kamaduol nangni mitkacho lamkakei ngai!<verse eid="MAT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>“Nangni nunchan katha inleem! Dan ocha khat-um Pharisee ngai! Ningchungnga poongna omrase, ajarchu nangni rabing li bukheeng kha apangtiang bit ningrasu, takkha asuungtiang chu maruupnasik khat-um atheinuo sik ah ngaidonna bitkhan pumsip asip.” <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/>Mitkacho Pharisee! rabing suungnga kaom kachok kha ma-insa ah minthiang masaro halli apangnga kaom kachok kha-um ahong inthiangsik eii.<verse eid="MAT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>“Nangni nunchan katha inleem! Dan ocha khat-um Pharisee ngai! ningchungnga angtuk poong kaomme, ajarchu nangni tuollachu akatha angnga nimuli asuungnga chu akathi saru ngaili akachok-in kasip akabang inkanoot thaan ka-ang ning eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 23:3">Chuon 23:3</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 23:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/>Khawa angnga nangni-um tuollachu mi ngaidiang akatha angnga ning inmu, takkha asuung ngachu nunchan katha inleemna li manu in asip.<verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu'n Inmani Poongna sik Irilsuok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luk 11:47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>“Nangni nunchan katha inleem! Dan ocha khat-um Pharisee ngai angtuk poong kaomme! nangni'n Pathian chongkachoi ngai thaan kha katha ah ningbool, halli tuka-ang ringkhuo katha ah karing ngai thaanlung kha ningminliang; <verse eid="MAT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/>halli nangni'n ningti, keini'n kinpi-kinpu ngai phakhan kinleiom inchu, Pathian chongkachoi ngai inthat nakhan inmani ngaile inruoiya chan kinleinei maksik eii.” <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/>Khawa jarra nangni'n inthiangnga Pathian chongkachoi ngai kathat inmani sa-ngai kin-eii ti nangni ningtheinuo ah sakhi ning-inpejei. <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/>Kha e-inchu angme ningpi-ningpu ngai ileiphut kha nangni'n minsuoru!<verse eid="MAT 23:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/>Nangni maruulngai khat-um maruul sangai! angtho-thoa khawa meikhur sik ah chongtanna ah inphut suoksik tia ningngaidon me? <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 3:7">Matt 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:34">12:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Luk 3:7</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 23:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/>Khawa jarra enru, kei'n nangnidiang karil khachu Pathian chongkachoi, mi kasing, halli ocha ngaikha kajuotirsik eii; inmani lekkhat kha nangni'n ningthatsik eii, lekkhat in cross ah, halli inmani lekkhat ngaikhan nangni Synagogue ngaikhan enmeel kase ah ningwuoksik eii, halli khuopui ngaikhan thatnasik inmani ningpuutsik eii.<verse eid="MAT 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/>Hiwahi nangni'n Biak-inn li Pathian maichaam kongkarra ning-ithat mi kadik Abel la inphut Barachiah sapa Zechariah katung nuoipilla thi ningmasuokna rakip ngai poongna kha nangni chungnga achulsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Inphut 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20">2 Khang 24:20</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 24:21">21</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/>Kei'n nangni diang inthiangnga karil, hiwarakip ngai ningthatna rachaakna kha tuunna khang chungnga achulsik eii.<verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu'n Jerusalem sik ra-oiya ichap</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34">Luk 13:34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:35">35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>“Jerusalem, Jerusalem! Pathian in ijuotir chongkachoi ngai lungnga kadeeng khat-um Pathian chongkachoi ngai kathat nang! Arpui in ateii ngai amurtha nuoiya ida angnga, kei'n nami ngaihi angtuk kiompui zootme, takkha nangni'n zootmak chu!<verse eid="MAT 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/>Halli enru, nangni Biak-inn kha karuok ah kanadapi ejei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JER 22:5">Jer 22:5</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/>Ajarchu kei'n nangni diang kati, ‘Pumi ramingnga akajuo ama kha rawaan katha kha eii ningtimak laiseng, tuunna inphut nangni'n keihi supmu namu khainutun jei.’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Minpkla 118:26</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Biak-Inn kakoi sik jarra Jisu'n Iril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1">Mk 13:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5">Luk 21:5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:6">6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>Jisu'n Biak-inn mathaanna asi phakhan, asiamruoi ngai'n insak innjarra amadiang minmunasik ah akoolla inheiwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>“Oh,”Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Nangni'n hiwa rakip ngaihi mumak chube? Kei'n nangni diang inthiangnga kiti eii, lung khatbit um lung inkhat chungnga omnuni; inraja ah la-inlet wiaksik eii.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Poongna li Raalna Jarra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mk 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>Jisu'n Olives Chingnga in-ongnga omlai, siamruoi ngai'n ruuk ah amadiang inheiwa ah inleiti. “Hiwa rakip ngaihi angtik asuoksik me,” “halli nang najuonasik li manmasituol hekna jetnasik, keinidiang natipiro.”<verse eid="MAT 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>Halli Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Insingtheiru, tu-inkhat innum nangni innaminweet maknasik. <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/>Ajarchu mi katam khat in karamingnga, Kei Messiah ka-eii! ti-inta inheiwasik eii; halli mi katam khat kha aminweet sik eii. <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/>Nangni'n raal khat-um raalchong rasa akanai khat-um akalaak ah ninglajetsik eii, takkha chimaru; ajarchu hiwa rakip hi alasuoksik eii, takkha ahekna kha tuunkatung lahongmak. <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/>Ajarchu ramkhat li ramkhat inla-insuolsik eii, halli rengram khat li rengram khat inla-inthatsik eii; halli amun rakip ah bukawaang li rinook alasuoksik eii. <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/>Hiwa rakip hi naiha kahong ma-insa kha ka-ang eii.”<verse eid="MAT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/>“Halli nangni nasur inta minpoong nasik innalapesik eii, halli nangni innalathatsik eii, halli zaat rakip in kei jarra nangni innamatir sik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Matt 10:22</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/>Halli khawa phakhan akatamkhat in la-inngamna nunu, halli inmani inkhat li inkhat inla-inpesuoksik eii, halli inkhat li khat inla-intirsik eii. <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/>Halli akatuunmak Pathian chongkachoi angjet lahongsuok inta mi akatamkhat alaminweetsik eii. <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/>Hiwa ka-ang akathamak ahongkheel jarra, minriang hi mi katamtak ngai chungnga ajuotoom sik eii.<verse eid="MAT 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/>Takkha ahekna katungnga kadei ama kha aringsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Matt 10:22</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/>Halli hiwa Rengram jarra Chong Kahoi hi phungle zaat rakip ah sakhi enasik ah manmasituol pumpuiya inlarilsik eii; halli ahekna kha ajotungsik eii.<verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Chikaom Poongna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mk 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>“Khawa jarra Pathian chongkachoi Daniel diangnga ileiminril, kaminmang mator ‘Chikaompa’ khan inthiang munna ingir nangni'n ningmusik eii.” (Akateel ama khan jetrase!) <char style="rq"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/>“Khawa phakhan tuka-ang Judea ah kaom rakip in chingtiang taanrasu.”<verse eid="MAT 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/>Tuka-ang innchungnga kaom ama khan innsuungnga kaom phur ngaikha kakeisuosik juochum khaimarase; <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Luk 17:31</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/>halli tuka-ang leiya kaom ama khan apuonsil kaleisik heikir khaimarase. <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/>Halli nai kalawon numeisa ngaisik khat-um nainu ngai sik achu khawa phakha angtuk poongkaom sikme! <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/>Phanbi emakli Jihudi ngai sernikhuoni ningtaan maknasik Pathian diang niru!<verse eid="MAT 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/>Ajarchu khawa phakha manmasituol inphut makheiya awini katung lakasuokmak, halli angtikniteii um kasuok khaimaksik poongna kalok khetkha esik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Chonglar 7:14</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/>Takkha Pathian'n nikhuo ngaikha amintoomjei; kha emak inchu manmasi tu inkhat um ringthei nunu; takkha ama ikadang mi-ngai sikbit ah khawa nikhuo ngaikha Pathian in aminbongsik eii.<verse eid="MAT 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/>“Khawa pha takkhan, ‘Enru, hiwahin emakli khawakhan Messiah kha aom!’ tuka-ang inkhat in nangni diang ati inchu ngamnamaru.” <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/>Ajarchu Christa inleem khat-um Pathian Chongkahoi inleem ngai inlahong suoksik eii, halli ethei-inchu, ikadang mi ngai katung matheemna machulnasik ah, chuon inlak li ngaksik kaom angjet ngaikha inlathosik eii. <verse eid="MAT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/>Rangairu! kei'n nangni diang apha matiang kinatipi ejei.<verse eid="MAT 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/>“Emakli, mi ngai'n nangni diang, ‘Enru, ama neelramma aom inti inchu!’ khawakhan juosi maru, halli ‘Enro, ama hin inthup ah om inti innum!’ ngamnamaru.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 17:23">Luk 17:23</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:24">24</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 24:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/>Ajarchu Miring Sapa kha nisuotiangnga kool-inlek kha niluutna tiang katung inmu kha angnga alajuosik eii.<verse eid="MAT 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/>“Kathi kaluong omna munkhan laangkia ngai ininchunsik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 17:37">Luk 17:37</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Miring Sapa Juona sik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mk 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>“Poongraalna nikhuo ngai hekli hekmak innot ah kani'n ahongziing sik eii, tha in ama ra-ang penunijei, arsi ngai'n marwaanna inphut injuotasik eii, halli marwaanna ranak rakip um intuulsik eii; <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Jo 2:10</ref>,<ref loc="JOL 2:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Chonglar 6:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Ezek 32:7</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 24:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/>halli khawa phakhan lairalak ah Miring Sapa madanna kha inlarsik eii; halli manmasituolla zaat rakip in inlachapsik eii, khat-um ranak le alur-alianna khale inruoiya Miring Sapa khan suumphai chungnga ijuo kha inmani'n inmusik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:10-14">Zech 12:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Chonglar 1:7</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 24:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/>Tampalooi rasa inringkha inlatumsik eii, halli ama'n ama marwaan tirton ngaikha neipilchung raki miliya atirsik eii, khat-um ama ikadang neipilchung pumpuiya kaom mingaikha inmani ngai'n inheikhoom chunsik eii.<verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Theichang Kuungnga Inchusik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mk 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>“Tuun nangni'n theichang kuungnga inphut chongminkhi inkhat hi inchuru; aziik kadoongkha ahongcherra abuo hongsuokjei inchu, nangni'n kholumpha ahongnaijei tia ningjet.” <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/>Kha angnga nangni'n hiwarakip hi ningmu phakhan, apha anaijei, ama kotkuung juotungjei, ti nangni'n ningjetsik eii. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:33. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Apha anai jei, tinachu ama ajuo sik ejei tina eii</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/>Kei'n nangni diang inthiangnga kiti eii, hiwarakip hi asuok maklaiseng hiwa khang hi laheknuni. <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/>Marwaan li nuoipil chu lamangsik eii, takkha kei kachong ngaichu angtikniteii mangnuni.<verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tu Inkhat innum nikhuo li Aphakha Jetmu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mk 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luk 17:26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>“Khawa nikhuo li aphakha kapa eleiya, marwaan tirton ngai innum, Sapa innum,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:36. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">manuscript lekkhat achu ommak </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sapa innum </char></note> tu inkhat innum jetmu.”<verse eid="MAT 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/>Ajarchu Noah pha khanna angme kasuok angnga, Miring Sapa kajuo kha um khale in-angsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Inphut 6:5-8</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 24:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/>Ajarchu khawa tuikalian matiang khan, Noah in rakuong aluut maklaiseng, mi ngaikhan inbak inin, moi inleiruoi khat-um moiruoi nasik inleitho;<verse eid="MAT 24:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/>tuikalian kha ajuo ah inmani rakip achoi maklaiseng angme kasuok inmani injetmak kha angnga, Miring Sapa kha ajuo pha khannum kha angnga asuoksik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 7:6-24">Inphut 7:6-24</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/>Khawa phakhan leiya miring inni chuon inthosik eii; inkhat kha aruoisik eii, halli inkhat kha adasik eii. <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/>Numeisa inni chakari intak ah in-omsik eii; inkhat in aruoisik eii, halli inkhat kha adasik eii. <verse eid="MAT 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/>Khawa jarra insingtheiru, ajarchu nangni Pumi kha angtikni ajuosikme nangni'n jetmakchu.<verse eid="MAT 24:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/>Halli hiwahi jetru, angtikni innruppa'n aheiwa sikme ti innmapupa'n ajet inchu, ama'n inringchakta, halli a-inn kha innruuppa khan leimakoi matornuni. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 12:39-40">Luk 12:39-40</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/>Hiwajarra nangni um inringchakru, ajarchu ningngaidon makna phatak khan Miring Sapa kha ajuosik eii.<verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akatha emakli Akathamak Suok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luk 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>“Kha e-inchu, tume aphakacha ah innmapupa in inmani diang baksik kapesik ithun ngamna kaom khat-um akasing suok kha?” <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/>Amapupa'n inna aheikir pha hiwa ngai kathoa kaom jo-intongpui suok ama kha rawaan katha eii! <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/>Kei'n nangni diang inthiangnga kati, ama'n ineirakip kha asuokpa diang aminhuumsik eii. <verse eid="MAT 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/>Takkha ama akathamak suok kha e-inchu, ama atheinuo ah intisik eii, kamapupa chu lahongwak nuni, <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/>halli ama'n asuok changpui ngaikha kawuok khat-um ju inrui ngaile kabak khat-um ka-in aphutsik ejei. <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/>Halli suok mapupa kha suokpa khan angaidon makna phakhan ahongkirsik eii, halli ama'n aphakha jetnuni. <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/>Amapupa in ama kha abong bongnga atansik eii, halli nunchan katha inleem ngai rasi-enna tumkha ama'n amusik eii; khawakhan chapli hakarialna esik eii.<verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Nungaak Soom ngai Chongminkhina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>“Khawa pha marwaan Rengram khachu inmani meiser inchoiya moipa kadonsik ah heikasuok nungaak soom ka-angsik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 12:35">Luk 12:35</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/>Halli inmani ranga khatchu akamo in eii, khat-um ranga khat ngaichu akasing inlei-eii. <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/>Akamo ngaikhan inmeiser kha inheichoi, takkha inmani'n sariaktui inliakchu heichoimu; <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/>takkha akasing ngai khanchu inmani meiser le inruoiya sariaktui thunna inminteiya inheichoi. <verse eid="MAT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/>Moipa heikasuok insuum jarra, inmani rakip imu inlei-inchu halli inleizaaljei.<verse eid="MAT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/>“Halli zaanchim khan rasa inkhat aheikheek ah, ‘Enro moipa kha aheiwajei, ama kadonsik heisuoktaru!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/>Khawa phakhan nungaak soom ngai'n in-intheiya, inmeiser inhongminkai. <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/>Halli akamo ngai khan akasing ngaidiang inti, nangni sariaktui lekkhat naperu, ajarchu keini meiser ajothijei. <verse eid="MAT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/>Takkha akasing ngai'n inheimasang, keinisik um nangnisik um hunmak acha, nangni'n si-inlang akajuor ngaidiang, nangnisik lekkhat jorachoru. <verse eid="MAT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/>Halli inmani'n karachosik insipha, moipa kha ajuojei, halli insuukchak ah leikaom ranga ngai kha'n amale inruoiya moiruoi bubak natiang khan inluutjei; halli kotkha inkharjei.”<verse eid="MAT 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/>“Khawasuo aleiilak nungaak ngai um inhongtungjei. ‘Pumi, Pumi! keinisik kot namalongpiro!’ inhongti. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 13:25">Luk 13:25</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/>‘Kei'n nangnidiang inthiangnga kiril eii, kei'n nangni najetmong,’ tia ama'n aleimasang.”<verse eid="MAT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/>Khawa jarra, “Nangni insingtheiru, ajarchu nangni'n nikhuo li phadan kha jetmakchu.”<verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Talent ngai jarra Chongminkhina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>“Marwaan rengram hi miring inkhat in khuol-injil asi siktiang asuok ngai akoili ineirakip inmani diang iminhuum khale in-angsik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk 19:11-27</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 25:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/>Halli inkhat diang talent ranga, inkhat diang talent inni, halli inkhatpa diang talent inkhat, ama itho matorna dungkajuiya inmani rakip diang apeli, ama khuol-injil asijei. <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/>Talent ranga inhuum mipa khan innoot ah asiya sialthuoi aminsiya talent ranga khat atuongjei. <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/>Khanthoa talent inni inhuumpa kha innum talent inni khat leiminliakjei. <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/>Takkha talent inkhat inhuum suokpa khan asiya neipil acheiya amapupa sial kha athupjei.<verse eid="MAT 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>“Apha kasoottak suo ah suok ngai mapupa kha ahongnga inmani le inruoiya sial lei-inpapui jei. <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/>Halli talent ranga inhuumpa khan aheiwa ah, talent ranga khat ahongchoiya ati, ‘Ocha, nang in keidiang talent ranga nanaleipe,’ ‘Na-enpiro! kei'n talent ranga khat kaminliakjei.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/>Amapupa khan amadiang ati, ‘Athajei, akatha khat-um ngamna kaom suok!’ ‘Nangchu phur lekteii chungnga ngamna nathajarra, kei'n phur rakip kanaminhuum sik eii; heiwaro namapupa rokna khan chan neiro!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/>Talent inni ipe mipa khannum aheiwa ah, ati, ‘Ocha, nang in keidiang talent inni nanaleipeii; na-enpiro! kei'n talent inni kaminliakjei.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/>Ama mapupa khan amadiang ati, ‘Athajei, akatha khat-um ngamna kaom suok!’ ‘Nang chu phur lekkhat chungnga ngamna na-om jarra, kei'n nanghi phur rakip kanaminhuum sik eii; heiwaro namapupa rokna khan chan neiro!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/>Halli talent inkhat kamahuum suokpa innum aheiwa ah ajoti, ‘Ocha, nangchu malung kangar na-eii; lingleiya narakhool, halli muchi worleiya nakhoom ti kei'n kaleijet; <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/>khawa jarra kanachiya kei'n kasiya, talent kha neipil suungnga kaleithup jei. Enro! nata kha hi eii.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/>Amapupa khan amasangnga amadiang aheiti, ‘Kathamak khat-um huoikajoumak suok!’ kei'n kiwormak kha karakhool, halli muchi worleiya kakhoom ti ‘Nang in nijet emak abe? <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/>Khawakha alei e-inchu nang in kei kasial kha sialdana innkhan naleidali, kei'n kaheikir pha sialthuoi khale inruoiya kei'n kaleimusik eii. <verse eid="MAT 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/>Khawa jarra ama diangnga talent kha lei-inlang talent soom kaneipa ama diangkhan peru.<verse eid="MAT 25:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/>Ajarchu akanei mi rakipdiang inpedelsik eii, halli ama'n kheella aneisik eii; takkha akaneimak mipa inei lekteii kha um ama diangnga inphut inleidelsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Matt 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mk 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luk 8:18</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 25:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/>Neiman kathamak suok kha tuolla kaom kaziing khan ama juokalekjuonru; khawamun khan ama chap li aha karialla kaom erase.’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Matt 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:13">22:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luk 13:28</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahekna Chongtanna Nikhuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>“Miring Sapa in Reng eya apoina khan marwaan tirton ngaile inruoiya ajuopha khan, ama reng in-ongna khan in-ongsik eii, <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 16:27">Matt 16:27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:28">Matt 19:28</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 25:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/>halli zaat rakip ah mi-ngai kha um ama maikuungnga aminchunsik eii; keelngam kakhaalpa khan keelli keelngam ikhoithen angnga, inmani inkhatli inkhat akhoithensik eii. <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/>Halli ama'n keelngam ngaikha achangtiang, khat-um keel ngaikha aweitiang adasik eii. <verse eid="MAT 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/>Halli Reng khan achangtiangnga kaomngai diang atisik eii, ‘Heiwaru, Kapa rawaan kamu nangni ngai! Heiwa inlang neipilchung inboolla inphut nangnisik ah innaboolpi rengramkha joluotaru. <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/>Ajarchu kei kawonchaam pha nangni'n baksik ningnape, kei'n katuiraal pha khannum tui ningnapeii, kei'n khomal inkhat ka-e pha khannum ningna-leiralaang; <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/>puon choisik kaneimakpha puon ningnape, kei'n kana pha nangni'n ningna en, kei'n mikhumna ah kaom pha nangni'n ningnajuopha. <verse eid="MAT 25:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/>Khawa phakhan mikatha ngai'n ama diang inheimasangsik eii, Pumi, nang nawonkachaam kinmuwa angtik kinaminbak ame, emakli natuiraal pha kinamin-in nabe? <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/>Angtik nang in khomal na-e pha kinnamuwa kin inna kinnaruoiluut ame, emakli puon ommak pha puon kinape ame? <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/>Emakli nang in nana ah khat-um mikhumna ah niom angtik kinnamuwa nakoolla kinhongnga me?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/>Rengpa khan inmani diang heimasangta, ‘Kei'n nangnidiang inthiangnga kanatipi, kei ka-u kanai kasiinkhet chungnga nangni'n angrakip ningtho kha, keisik ah ningtho eii!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/>“Halli ama'n aweitiangnga kaom ngaidiang khan aheitisik eii, ‘E Pathian khomaak saamna kamungai! kei diangnga inphut si-inlang Seitan khat-um ama tirton ngaisik bit ah inbool hektik kaboi meikhur khan siru! <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/>Ajarchu kei'n kawonchaam pha nangni'n baksik napemak chu, halli kei'n katuiraal pha nangni'n kei namin-in mak chu, <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/>kei'n khomal inkhat ka-e pha, nangni'n kei naleiralaang makchu, puon ommak pha keidiang puon napemakchu, kana ah khat-um mikhumna ah kaom pha nangni'n naphamakchu.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/>Halli inmani innum inhongmasang sik eii, ‘Pumi, nang nawonkachaam, natuikaraal, khomal inkhat ah nisi, puon nineimak, nina emakli mikhumna ah niom keini'n kinnamuwa, kinnasan makna ommabe?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/>Khawapha Rengpa khan inmani diang heimasangta, ‘Kei'n inthiangnga nangni diang kitihi eii, nangni'n angme akasiinkhet ngai karra inkhat chungnga ningsan zootmak hi, kei ningnasan zootmak kha eii.’<verse eid="MAT 25:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/>Halli inmani kha hektik kaboi rachaakna munkhan atirsik eii, takkha mikatha ngaikhan hektik kaboi ringna khan insisik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12:2</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Thatna sik Ininsuuk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1">Mk 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Luk 22:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jn 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>Jisu'n hiwarakip ngai aminchusuo pha, ama'n asiamruoi ngaidiang aleiti,<verse eid="MAT 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/>“Nini thengnga Rakaanna Kahoi omsik eii, halli miring sapa kha cross ah thatnasik a inpesuoksik eii ti nangni'n ningjet.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Suok 12:1-27</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Halli araming Caiaphas inti Thiampu kaliankhet inntuol khan thiampu kalianngai khat-um upa ngai inlei intuup, <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>halli Jisu ruuk ah surra ama thatnasik chuonkha inleiminsuuk. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>“Mipui ngai'n inphu maknasik,” “kahoi suungngachu thomui,” inmani'n inti.<verse eid="MAT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bethany ah Jisu Sariak inkanoot</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mk 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Jn 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>Bethany ah kaom apumkaphar Simon inna Jisu kha aleiom.<verse eid="MAT 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/>Numeisa inkhat in aman katam sariak rimkahoi inthun alabaster lungbeel kasip inkhat aheichoiya Jisu koolla aheiwa, halli Jisu'n bu abak laitak khan aluchungnga aleibunpi. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 7:37">Luk 7:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 7:38">38</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>Hiwahi siamruoi ngai'n inmu halli hoimaktheiya inheiti, “Angsik hiwarakip hi niminmangme?” <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>“Ajarchu hiwa sariak hi aman katamma juorlia, sara ngaidiang sial kha pekacha eii!”<verse eid="MAT 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>Jisu'n angme inmani inti ajet ah, inmani diang ati, “Angsikme numeisanu ningminpoong? ama'n keisik ah chuon kathatak athojei.<verse eid="MAT 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/>Ajarchu sara ngaichu nangnile inchatlekleiya ning omsuom, takkha keichu nangnile inchatlekleiya omsuom numin. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Innidan 15:11</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/>Ajarchu ama'n hiwa sariak rimkahoi hi kei kapum chungnga ibunthuon hin kei phuumnasik ama insuuksuo kha ejei. <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/>Tuun kei'n inthiangnga nangni diang kitihi eii, manmasituol pumpui hiwa chongkahoi hi rilsuokna rakip khan, ama'n angme ileitho kha ama ngaidonna sikbit ah inrilsik eii.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Judas in Jisu Pesuok nasik izootpi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10">Mk 14:10</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Khawapha Judas Iscariot inti, siamruoi soomleini ngai karra inkhat in thiampu kalian ngaidiang asiya ati, <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/>“Kei'n ama kha nangnidiang kanapeii inchu, nangni'n keidiang angme ningnapesik?” Halli inmani'n amadiang dangkapum soomthum inleipeii. <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>Halli khawapha makheiya Judas in Jisu pesuok nasik aphakacha kha alei-entok.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Siamruoi ngai le Rakaan kahoi Bubakna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mk 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luk 22:7-13</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jn 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>Chol inchelmak waipool bakna nikhuo ma-insakhetni siamruoi ngai'n Jisu diang inheiwa ah inti, “Rakaanna kahoi bubak nasik kha nangsik hunme keini'n kinminsuuksik nimanuom?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>Ama'n ati, “Khuopui khan luut inlang tuka-ang mi inkhat diang,” “Kei kapha juotungjei ‘Ochapa in ati, na-inna kei kasiamruoi ngaile kei Rakaanna kahoi kha thokinte juotiru.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>Jisu'n inmani diang itipi angnga, siamruoi ngai'n Rakaanna kahoi bu kha inleiminsuuk.<verse eid="MAT 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Kholei hei-epha khan, siamruoi soomleini le Jisu bubak nasik ah inlei in-ong. <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>Jisu'n bu inbaklai khan ati, “Adik nangni karra inkhat in kei anajuorsik eii.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>Siamruoi ngaikha inmalung inleipoong theijei halli inmani rakip in amadiang inti, “Kei'n be Pumi?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/>Halli Jisu'n aleimasang, “Kheengnga keile inruoiya kut kanoom amatak in kei anapesuoksik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Minpkla 41:9</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/>Miring Sapa kha Chong inthiang in ileiril angnga alathisik eii, takkha Miring Sapa kha akapesuoksik miringpa sik achu angtuk ah poong kaom sikme! khawa mipa kha inleineimak in kheella amasik ah aleikatha sik eii!”<verse eid="MAT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>Kapesuok sik Judas khan hongmasang, “Kei'n be, Ocha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Jisu'n ama diang ati, oh, “Nang in narilsuokjei.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pumi zaansaak minsuuk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mk 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Cor 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>Inmani'n inbaklaitak khan, Jisu'n waipool kha aleiya rawaan apeli, akatherkhoijei, halli asiamruoi ngaidiang peli ati, “Lei-inlang bakru,” “hiwahi kei kataksa eii.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Halli ama'n rabing aleiya, Pathian diang rawaan apeli, inmani diang apeya, “Nangni rakip hiwahi inru” ati;<verse eid="MAT 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/>“Ajarchu khawa chong-inkhitna, manu rakip ngaidamnasik ah akasar kei kathisen kha eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Suok 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31:31-34</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 26:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/>Kei'n nangni diang kitihi eii, kapa Rengramma nangnile inruoiya woikhat hiwa theibomju hi ni-insuom nasik nikhuo atungmak laiseng, kei'n tuunna inphut hiwa theibomju innuningjei.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Halli inmani'n laa insak ah Olives Chingtiang inleisi.<verse eid="MAT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu'n Peter Izootmak sik irilsuok masa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jn 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>Khawa phakhan Jisu'n inmani diang ati, “Nangni rakip in awini zaantak hin keidiang insuina ningneisik eii, ajarchu hiwahi chong-inthiangnga injia kha ejei, ‘Pathian in keelngam kakhaalpa kha alathatsik eii, halli keelngam rahooi ngaikha inlachaangdar sik eii.’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zech 13:7</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 26:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/>Takkha woikhat kei'n kahongringli, kei'n nangni matiang Galileeya kasisik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Matt 28:16</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 26:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>Peter in Jisu diang aleimasang, “Mi rakip in nangdiang insuina innei-innum, Kei'n chu angtikniteii insuina neinuning!”<verse eid="MAT 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>Jisu'n Peter diang heiti, “Kei'n nang diang inthiangnga kitihi eii, awini zaantak hin Arkhong khan akhuong makma, nang in keihi woithum nazoot nutin.”<verse eid="MAT 26:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>Peter'n leimasang, “Kei'n pumile thisuomsik asuok innum, kei'n chu nangkha zootmak suptho nathonuning!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:35">Khawakhale in-angrip ah siamruoi rakip innum inleiti.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu'n Gethsemane ah Pathian Nina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mk 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Khawa phakhan Gethsemane intiya inkoi amun khan Jisu'n inmanile inruoiya inheiwapha, siamruoi ngaidiang ati, “Kei'n soson kasiya Pathian kani phakhan, nangni hiwahin lei-inongru.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>Pumi'n amale inruoiya Peter khat-um Zebedee sangai inni aleiruoi, halli pumi kha malung poongnale malung dongna khan aleisip. <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>Khawa phakhan pumi'n inmani diang ati, “Kei karathahi thisik katungnga apoongjei; nangni hin om-inlang, keile inruoiya inringchak kha erui.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>Ama'n matiang lekkhat asidetli, ameel nuoitiang enna inbok ah aleini, “E kapa, hiwahi acha-inchu kei diangnga inphut poongna rabinghi nakhaipiro! kha e-innum kei kalungdou emarase, takkha nang nalungdou kha erase.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>Halli ama'n siamruoi inthum ngaidiang heikirpha, inmani inleizaal kha ajuomu, halli Peter diang ati, nangni'n “Kei le angtiame phadan inkhat um ningna-inringchak puimatormak? <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/>Nangni'n matheemna khan ningchulmak nasik, inringchak inlang niru; ratha inchu athozoot, takkha taksa inchu asuol.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>Woikhat um Jisu'n inlet ah akirra nina ajuonei, “E kapa, hiwa rabinghi Kei'n ka-inmak innum khaikathamak sik ejei inchu, nalungdou kha inthorase,” <verse eid="MAT 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>Ama'n woikhat heikirpha siamruoi ngai inleizaal kha ajuomunook; ajarchu inmani inmit leimakek matormu.<verse eid="MAT 26:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>Jisu'n inmani woikhat amathaanna akirli, woithum huuina nina kha chongramol in-angrip ah aleini. <verse eid="MAT 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Khawa phakhan Jisu'n siamruoi ngaidiang aheikirra ati, “Nangni tuunkatug ninglazaalla poong ninglamachum be? Enru! phadan kha ajuonaijei; Miring Sapa kha manu karoon ngai kutchungnga inpenasik. <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/>Intheitaru, eini situi; enru, kei kanapesuok sik mi kha hin omjei!”<verse eid="MAT 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Insur</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Jn 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Jisu'n chong arilla omlaitak khan, enro, Judas, siamruoi soomleini ngai karra inkhat kha ahongjei, halli thiampu kalian ngaili katar ngai ihongtir, chemli ramol kachoi mipui katamtak amale inhong inruoi. <verse eid="MAT 26:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>Halli pumi kapesuokpa khan jetna inkhat apeya aleiti, “Kei'n kimazoop mi kha eii; amakha surru!”<verse eid="MAT 26:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>Khawa phatak khan Judas Jisu koolla ahongnga, “Ocha, chubei” tia, amakha hongmazoop.<verse eid="MAT 26:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>Jisu'n amadiang ati, “Suopui, nang in thosik ah nihong kha angme innot ah thoro!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Halli inmani inhongnga, Jisu kha insurli inkhitjei. <verse eid="MAT 26:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Khat-um enru, Jisu le leikaom inmani ngai karra inkhat in achem keisuoa thiampu kaliankhet suokpa kuorkha aleitukthakpi. <verse eid="MAT 26:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>Khawa phakhan Jisu'n amadiang ati, “Nachem kha akok ah thunkirro,” “Ajarchu chem kachoi rakip chemma inthisik eii. <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/>Marwaan tirton legion<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:53. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Roman raalmi 6000 dam eii</char></note> soomleini kakhel tuuntak kakoolla juomasuo nasik kei'n kapadiang nimatornutin tia nang na-ngaidonbe? <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/>Kha katho inchu, angtho thoa Chong inthiang kha hintia asuoksik eii itikha huui tungniame?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>Khawa phadantak khan Jisu'n mipui ngaidiang ati, “Dan kamakoi inkhat kasur sik angnga nangni'n chem khat-um ramol ningchoiya kei kanasur ninghongbe? Nisuorakip ah kei'n Biak-inn khan ka-in-ongnga kaminchu, halli nangni'n kei nasurmak chu. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 26:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/>Takkha hiwarakip ngaihi Pathian chongkachoi ngai imajia chong kha tungnasik ah kasuok eii.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Khawa phakhan siamruoi ngai'n ama inmathaanna intaanjei.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Katarrup ngai ma ah</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mk 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Luk 22:54</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:55">55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13">Jn 18:13</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Halli Jisu kasur ngai'n Dan ocha ngaili katarngai inlei-inchunna, Thiampu Kaliankhet Caiaphas inna Jisu kha inleiruoi. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>Takkha Thiampu Kaliankhet inntuol katung Peter in inlaakjenna anuk leijui, halli aluut ah angme hongkasuok sik ennasik raalpa ngai khale inlei in-ong. <verse eid="MAT 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Thiampu kalian ngaile katarrup rakip in Jisu chungnga akatuunmak sakhi thatnasik ah inleiratok; <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>takkha ama jarra maleisei sakhi kape mi katamma inhong innum, inmani'n iteii um leimumu. Ahekna ah miring inni inhongnga inhongti, <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/>“Hiwa mipa'n, ‘Kei'n hiwa Pathian Biak-inn hi kathiatli nithum suungnga kasak mator aleiti.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Thiampu Kaliankhet khan intheiya Jisu diang ati, “Nang iteii um masang nutinbe? nachungnga mi ngai'n inpe sakhi hi angme?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Takkha Jisu lei-omchianjei. Halli Thiampu Kaliankhet khan amadiang ati, “Pathian Sapa Messiah kha nang na-e inchu, akaring Pathian raming rakook inlang keinidiang rilro”<verse eid="MAT 26:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/>Jisu'n amadiang ati, “Nang in natijei. Takkha kei'n nangni rakip diang kati, hiwa suoa Miring Sapa khan Akaraat khetpa changtiang in-ongnga marwaan suumphai chungnga ijuo kha nangni'n ningmusik eii!” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 26:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>Khawa pha Thiampu Kaliankhet khan apuondiar katherra ati, “Pathian kha kase ah aril jei! hiwakheella eini'n sakhi leisik arei ommakjei? enru, Pathian kha kase ah irilkha nangni'n ningjetjei! <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Levi 24:16</ref> </char><verse eid="MAT 26:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/>Nangni'n angme ninglangaidon?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Inmani'n inheimasang, “Ama kathisik rahoi asuok.”<verse eid="MAT 26:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>Khawa phakhan inmani'n amaiya inmachilthuon halli kuttumma inleisuk; lekkhat ngai'n angemtaang inkabenna inti, <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 50:6">Isa 50:6</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 26:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>“E Messiah, tume nang kanawuok? keini diang heirilro!”<verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Peter in Jisu Izootmak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mk 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Jn 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>Peter in tuolla in-ongnga omlai, Thiampu Kaliankhetpa suok numeisa inkhat aheiwa ah amadiang ati, “Nang um Galilee Jisu le ninglei-inruoi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>Takkha ama'n inmani rakip maikuungnga zootmak ah aheiti, “Nang itikha kei jetmong,” <verse eid="MAT 26:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>halli ama'n tuolkot khan asuok pha, leiilak suok numeisa inkhat in amakha aleimuwa khanna kaom mi ngaidiang ati, “Ama Nazareth Jisu le inlei-inlop eii.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>“Kei'n mipa kha jettakmong tia khomaak lei-insaamma,” woikhat zootnook makjei.<verse eid="MAT 26:72"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Phabongkhat suo khawa koolla kangirra kaom ngai'n inheiwa ah Peter diang injuoti, “Inthiangnga nang um inmani ngai karra inkhat na-eii,” “Ajarchu nachongril khan kinnajet!”<verse eid="MAT 26:73"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>Khawa phakhan, “Tume ma kha kei jetmong katakchungnga Pathian in poongna naperase tia khomaak insaam aphut jei!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Khawa phatak khan innot ah arkhong kha akhuongjei, <verse eid="MAT 26:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>“Arkhong khan akhuongma, nang in kei kha woithum nazootnutin tia Jisu'n iti chongkha Peter in ahongngaidonjei.” Halli ama'n tuol asuok ah malung intook ah ajuochapjei.<verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Pilate Maikuungnga Inruoi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mk 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Luk 23:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 23:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Jn 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>Ziingtiang matak khan, thiampu kalian rakiple katar rakip in Jisu thatnasik chuon inlei-insuuk. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Halli inmani'n ama kha inkhit ah Rome ramwaikaroon Pilate diang inruoiya injopejei.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Judas Thina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18">Chuon 1:18</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 1:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>Khawa phakhan Jisu kajuorpa Judas khan Jisu diang noonkuung inpekha ahongjet phakhan, amalung athuulla, dangka sialpum soomthum kha thiampu kalian ngaili katar upa ngaidiang woikhat hongchoiya ahongti, <verse eid="MAT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>“Kei'n manu karoon mak mikha thatsik kipesuok khan kei manu karoonjei!” ama'n ahongti. Inmani'n inleimasang,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">“Keini ang kinthosik ommame?” “Khawakha nang nachuon eii!”<verse eid="MAT 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Judas in Biak-inn khan dangkapum kha adeengjuonna suokjei; halli asiya ruiya kaiya atheinuo ah ajuothijei.<verse eid="MAT 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Halli thiampu kalian ngaikhan dangkapum kha inleiya inti, “Hiwahi sialdana ah dasik hi eini Dan khan zootmak, ajarchu hiwahi thisenman kha eii.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>Halli inmani'n in-inbiak ah, khomal ngai phuumnasik ah Beelkaboolpa Lei kha khawa sialla inrachojei. <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/>Khawa jarra khawa lei kha “Thisen Lei” intia winikatung inlakoi.<verse eid="MAT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>Halli Pathian chongkachoipa Jeremiah ileiril kha huui tungjei: “Israel mi ngai'n inzootna aman dangkapum soomthum kha inmani'n inleijei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12">Zech 11:12</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 11:13">13</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/>Halli Pumi'n keidiang chongpeii inape angnga, inmani'n beelkaboolpa lei kha khawa sial kha inneimanna inleirachojei.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pilate in Jisu Chongrakel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mk 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luk 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Jn 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>Jisu Rome ramwaikaroonpa maikuungnga aleingir, halli ramwaikaroonpa'n amadiang aheirakel, “Nang Jihudi ngai rengpa na-ebe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Jisu'n amadiang leimasang, “Nang in niti kha ejei.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>thiampu kalian ngaili katar ngai'n inrilsepha ama'n iteii khat-um leimasangmak.<verse eid="MAT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Pilate in amadiang ati, “Inmani'n nachungnga innarilse ngaihi nang nijet makbe?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Jisu'n amadiang chongramol inkhat bit um masangmak pha, ramwaikaroonpa kha aleingak theijei.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Thatna sik Inpe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mk 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Jn 18:39–19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>Rakaanna Kahoi rakip ah Rome ramwaikaroonpa'n mipui ikadang mikhumna ah inda miring inkhat inmani sik bit ah ileithojol angnga aleimasuopi kachak. <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>Khawa phakhan mi rakip in injet mikhumna ah kaom araming Jisu Barabbas inti inkhat aleiom. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Khawa jarra mipui inintup pha, Pilate in inmani diang aleirakel, kei'n nangni sik ah “Tume ningnaminsuo zoot? Jisu Barabbas be, emakli Messiah inti Jisu khabe?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>Ajarchu Jihudi chuonkaroon ngai'n Jisu hi enzootmu ah amadiang inpe eii ti ama'n aleijet.<verse eid="MAT 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>Pilate in chongtanna munna in-onglai, anumei'n hiwa chong hongtirra ati, “Mikadikpa diang nang iteii khat um thomaro, ajarchu ama jarra kei'n wini zaan karamang khan kaleipoong thei.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>Takkha thiampu kalian ngai khat-um katar ngai inchu Barabbas kha masuoro halli Jisu kha thatro tiru tia mipui ngaikha inleimasok. <verse eid="MAT 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Ramwaikaroon Pilate in amasangnga halli inmani diang ati, hiwa inni ngai karra tume nangnisik ah ningnaminsuo zoot</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">inmani'n inti, “Barabbas!”<verse eid="MAT 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>Pilate in inmani diang ati “Kha e-inchu Messiah inti Jisu hi kei'n angme kathosik?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Inmani rakip in inti, “Ama kha Cross ah thatro!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>Takkha pilate in ati, angsime, “Ama akathamak ang thomejei?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Takkha ama kha “Cross ah thatru” tia inmani'n kheella inringnga kakheek inhongphut.<verse eid="MAT 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/>Khanthoa Pilate in iteii anemna ommak ti amuwa, khawa rathuulla mipui senasik eii ti amu pha, ama'n tui leiya mipui maikuungnga akut rasuwa aheiti, “Hiwa mikadikpa thisen jarra kei chu iteii jetmong! nangni lungdou erase!” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 21:6-9">Innidan 21:6-9</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>Mipui rakip in inhongmasang, “Ama thisen kha keini khat-um kinsa ngai chungnga chulrase!”<verse eid="MAT 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Khawasuo khan ama'n Barabbas kha inmani sikbit ah amasuopi jei, halli Jisu kha ama'n minwuok ah, ama'n Cross ah thatnasik ama kha apejei.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Raalmi ngai'n Jisu Ensel Musit Intho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mk 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2">Jn 19:2</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:3">3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Khawa phakhan ramwaikaroonpa raalmi ngai khan Jisu kha mipui inchunna waikaroonpa innsuungnga inkeiluut ah raalmi rup rakip in ama koolla in-inchunjei. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>Inmani'n ama puondiar kha inkhaipiya, puonsen kha amadiang inminsiljei. <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>Halli inmani'n ralinglukhu inkhat inboolli ama luchungnga inminkhu, achangtiang ramol inkhat inminhumma; halli inmani'n amaikuungnga in-inbok ah amakha in-innuipui, “E Jihudi ngai Reng, kasoot ah ringro!” inmani'n inti. <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>Halli inmani'n inmachin thuonna, tuoitung kha inleiya alukhan inleiwuok. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Halli inmani'n ama kha in-innuipui suopha, puonsen kha inkhaiya, ama puondiar kha inmintho kirra Cross ah thatnasik inruoijei.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Cross ah Inmakhai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jn 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>Halli inmani'n inheisuok pha, Simon tia inkoi Cyrene pasal inkhat inlei-intongpui, halli raalmi ngai'n ama kha Jisu cross kha azootmak pumma inleimindom. <verse eid="MAT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Inmani'n Golgotha inti mun tinachu “Lukiar mun” khan inheiwa pha, <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/>Inmani'n Jisu diang mathinnamit le inminchel akathur theibomtui insik inleipeii, takkha ama'n amintem pha lei-inpimak.<verse eid="MAT 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/>Halli ama kha cross ah inmakhai suopha, inmani'n rawaan katha in-enli ama puondiarkha inlei-insem. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Minpkla 22:18</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 27:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>Khawasuo inmani'n khawa munkhan inin-ongnga amakha inleingaak <verse eid="MAT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>Ama luchungkhan ama inrilsena inmajia kha inleitar, tichu, “Hiwa Jisu, Jihudi ngai Reng kha eii.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Khawa phakhan Jisu le inruoiya inruup inni um, inkhat in changtiang, inkhat in weitiang, cross ah inleimakhai.<verse eid="MAT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>Khawa koolla kasi-kahong mipui ngai'n inlu inkalek ah, kase ah amakha jakna inpeya inti, <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Minpkla 22:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:25">109:25</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 27:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/>“Biak-inn thiatli nithum suungnga kasak nang, natheinuo ah insanro; nang Pathian Sapa na-e-inchu, cross ah inphut jochumro!” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Matt 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Jn 2:19</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Khawale in-angrip ah thiampu kalian, Dan ocha khat-um katar ngai inchella in-innuipuiya inti, <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>“Mileiilak ngaichu ama'n asan; atheinuo achu insanring matormak! ama Israel ngai reng e-inchu; tuun ama'n cross ah inphut juochumrase, halli keini'n ama kha ngamnakinte!<verse eid="MAT 27:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/>Ama'n Pathian kha angamna ah; Pathian Sa ka-eii inti inchu, tuun Pathian in sanrase; ajarchu ama'n ati, keichu Pathian Sapa ka-eii!” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 22:8">Minpkla 22:8</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 27:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>Jisu le cross ah inmakhaisuom inruup ngai innum khawa ka-ang jakna chongkhan inleirakook.<verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu'n Ithi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mk 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jn 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Suunchim makheiya phadan inthum katung nuoipilchung pumpui aleiziingjei.<verse eid="MAT 27:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/>Halli phadan inthum juochultiang Jisu'n inringtak rasa khan ahongkheek ah, “Eli, Eli, lema sabachthani?” tinachu, “Ka Pathian, Ka Pathian, angsikme nang in keidiangnga inphut khattiang nina inletdel?” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Minpkla 22:1</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 27:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Khanna kangirra kaom mi lekkhat khawakha injetpha inheiti, “Ama'n Elijah kha akoi!”<verse eid="MAT 27:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/>Khawa phatak khan inmani karra inkhat ataanna tuipompuon aleiya, khawakha akathur theibom juchoong khan anoomli, ramol khan kathilla, amadiang insik ah aleipeii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Minpkla 69:21</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 27:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>Halli lekkhat in inti, ngaakdirui, “Elijah in ama kasansik ajuobe eini enrui!”<verse eid="MAT 27:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Khawa suonuk Jisu'n woikhat rasa inringnga akheekli, arang chatjei.<verse eid="MAT 27:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>Enru, Biak-inn suungnga induong puonkha achung makheiya anuoi katung lekniya intherjei, nuoipil um innikjei, lungpui um akoijei, <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Suok 26:31-33</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 27:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>Thaan ngai um alei-inlongjei, halli Pathian kangamna katamtak aleikathi mi ngai um inhongringjei. <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>Halli Jisu'n ahongringsuo nuk thaanna inphut inmani'n inhongsuokli Inthiang Khuopui tiang inluut ah mipui katamtak ngaidiang inlei-inlar.<verse eid="MAT 27:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Raalmi rajakhat lamkakeipa le inruoiya, Jisu kangaak ngai'n rinook khat-um kasuok ngaikha inmu ah, inchitheiya inheiti, “Inthiangnga amahi Pathian Sapa kha eii!”<verse eid="MAT 27:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>Khawa munkhan numeisa katamkhat in kalaak ah inhei enna inleiom, inmani ngaikha ama sepa inthoa Galileeya inphut Jisu nuk heikajui ngaikha in-eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 8:2-3">Luk 8:2-3</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 27:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/>Inmani ngai karra Mary Magdalene, James li Joseph nu Mary, halli Zebedee numei inlei-inchel.<verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Inphuum</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jn 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Kholei aheitung pha, Arimathea makheiya Jisu siamruoi inkhat, araming Joseph intia inkoi, inchong inkhat ahongtung. <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>Ama'n Pilate koolla asiya Jisu kaluongkha aleini. Halli Pilate in khawakha Joseph diang penasik ah chong aleipejei. <verse eid="MAT 27:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>Khawa jarra Joseph in Jisu kaluong kha aleiya, akathar puonkanemma katuomma, <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>halli ama'n lungpuikha kawit ah amasik bit ah ibool thaan kathar khan aleiphuum; halli ama'n thaan kotkha lungkalok khat ah akharra aleisijei. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>Mary magdalene khat-um Mary inti khat in thaankha in-enna khawakhan inin-ongnga inleiom.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Thaan Inngaak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>Ziingnga, tichu Jihudi ngai serni, thiampu kalian halli Pharisee ngai'n Pilate koolla inhong inchunna,<verse eid="MAT 27:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/>inti, “Ocha, maleisei karilpa khan aringlai ‘Kei nithumni kahongringsik eii tia ileiril kha keini'n kinngaidon.’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Matt 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:23">17:23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:19">20:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mk 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33">10:33</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luk 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18:31-33</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 27:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>Khawa jarra nithum katungbit thaanhi katha ah ngaaknasik ah chong napepiro, kha emak inchu ama siamruoi ngai'n inhongli akaluong kha hongmaruup inta, amakha thiya inphut ahongringjei, tia mi ngaidiang hongrilcha; halli ma-insa maleisei khaneek ah nuk-intong maleisei khadoom kheella hongthamak acha.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>“Raalpa ruoiru,”Pilate in inmani diang ati, “Siru halli nangni imatortak khan thaankha ngaakru.”<verse eid="MAT 27:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Khawa jarra inmani'n insiya raalpa ngai khale inruoiya lungkha madanna indeengnga, thaankha katha ah inminngaakjei.<verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Hongringna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mk 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jn 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Jihudi ngai sernikhuo ahekli, hakta ma-insa khoserni ziingtiang khuowarli, Mary Magdalene khat-um Mary khat khawakhan thaan ka-en inleisi. <verse eid="MAT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Jetlei theileiya rinook kangartak aleihong; halli Pumi tirton kha marwaanna inphut ajuochumma, lungkha amalet ah, achung khan alei in-ong. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>Ama meelsuo kha kool-inlek alei-ang, halli ama puondiar ngaikha kawur angnga aleichek; <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>akangaak raalpa ngaikha inleichi theiya inlei-intuul, halli akathi mi kha in-ang jei.<verse eid="MAT 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>Marwaan tirton khan numeisa ngai diang aleiti. “Nangni chimaru,” “Ajarchu cross ah inthat Jisu kha nangni'n ning-entok ti Kei'n kajet. <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>Ama hin ommakjei; ajarchu ama ileiril angnga ama aringjei. Hongru halli hong-enru, ama leizaalna munkha. <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>Innoot ah si-inlang, halli ama siamruoi ngaidiang juomindikru, ‘Amachu thiya inphut aringjei; khat-um enru, nangni matiang ama Galileeya asijei, khawakhan nangni'n ama jomuningte!’ ngaidonru angme kei-inarilpi hi.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>Halli inmani'n kachi khat-um karokle inruoiya thaan kha inmathaanna innot ah, asiamruoi ngaidiang kamindiksik intaanjei.<verse eid="MAT 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>Enru, jetleitheileiya Jisu'n inmani intongpuiya ati, “Rawaan katha eru.” Halli inmani'n inheinaiya akeii khan inma-ouwa amakha chubei inthojei. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Jisu'n inmani diang ati, “Chimaru,” “Siru, kei ka-u kanai ngaikha Galileeya sinasik rilpiru, halli inmani'n khawakhan kei namu inte.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Raalpa ngai chonghongpe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Numeisa ngaikhan inlamma insi lai, enru, thaan kangaak raalmi lekkhat in khuopui khan inkirra, akasuok rakip kha thiampu kalian ngaidiang inleirilpi jei. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Halli katar ngai'n thiampu kalian ngaile inmuwa halli inmani chong inlei-insiamma, raalmi ngaidiang inmani'n sial katamma inleipe ah <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>manidiang inti, “Nangni'n tiru, keini'n zaanna kinzaal rathil ‘Ama siamruoi ngai'n inhongnga, akaluongkha inmaruupjei. <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>Halli hiwahi ramkaroonpa kuor tung-inchu, keini'n ama matheem kinta, halli nangni iteii naminpoong nunung.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Khan inthoa akangaak raalmi ngai'n sial kha inlei li inmani diang inminchu angnga inthojei; halli hiwa thurchi hi winikatung Jihudi ngai karra inlaril.<verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu'n Asiamruoi ngaidiang Inlar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mk 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jn 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Chuon 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>Siamruoi soomleikhat ngaikhan Galileeya Jisu'n ileirilpi chingkatung inleisijei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Matt 26:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Mk 14:28</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Halli inmani'n ama kha inmupha chubei inhongtho; takkha lekkhat inchu inlei-inngamsamna. <verse eid="MAT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>Halli Jisu'n aheinaiya inmani diang ati, “Marwaan khat-um nuoipil chungnga kaom ranak rakip kei diang anapejei.<verse eid="MAT 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/>Khawa jarra nangni'n si-inlang, zaat rakip ngaikha siamruoi juoboolru; inmani kha Apa, Asa khat-um Ratha Inthiang ramingnga baptize thoru, <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Matt 26:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Mk 14:28</ref></char><verse eid="MAT 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/>halli kei'n kinape chongpeii rakip juinasik ah inmani kha minchuru; halli, enru, manmasituol ahekkatung kei'n nangni kana-inruoipui chaksik eii.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
